rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn\'t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "whenever you cast a historic spell" doesn\\\'t trigger if a historic card is put onto the battlefield without being cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent protects, or the player that goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Lands are never cast, so abilities that trigger "whenever you cast a historic spell" won\\\'t trigger if you play a legendary land. They also won\\\'t trigger if a card on the battlefield transforms into a card with the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some abilities trigger "whenever you cast a historic spell." Such an ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn\'t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "whenever you cast a historic spell" doesn\\\'t trigger if a historic card is put onto the battlefield without being cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the target permanent\'s controller has two or fewer cards left in their library when Lost to Legend resolves, that permanent becomes the bottom card of their library."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Lands are never cast, so abilities that trigger "whenever you cast a historic spell" won\\\'t trigger if you play a legendary land. They also won\\\'t trigger if a card on the battlefield transforms into a card with the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some abilities trigger "whenever you cast a historic spell." Such an ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn\'t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "whenever you cast a historic spell" doesn\\\'t trigger if a historic card is put onto the battlefield without being cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Lands are never cast, so abilities that trigger "whenever you cast a historic spell" won\\\'t trigger if you play a legendary land. They also won\\\'t trigger if a card on the battlefield transforms into a card with the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some abilities trigger "whenever you cast a historic spell." Such an ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "A creature attacks alone if it\'s the only creature declared as an attacker during the declare attackers step. For example, Bilbo\'s Ring\'s second ability won\'t trigger if you attack with multiple creatures and all but one of them are removed from combat."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "A phased-out token will phase in at the beginning of its controller\'s untap step just like a nontoken permanent would."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'An attacking or blocking creature that phases out is removed from combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Any continuous effects with a "for as long as" duration, such as that of Rangers of Ithilien, ignore phased-out objects. If ignoring those objects causes the effect\\\'s conditions to no longer be met, the duration will expire.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As a creature is phased out, Auras and Equipment attached to it also phase out at the same time. Those Auras and Equipment will phase in at the same time that creature does, and they\'ll phase in still attached to that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Choices made for permanents as they entered the battlefield are remembered even after they phase in.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If King of the Oathbreakers phases in at the same time as one or more other Spirits you control, King of the Oathbreakers\'s last ability will trigger for each of them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a spell an opponent controls targets multiple Spirits you control, King of the Oathbreakers\'s triggered ability will trigger once for each of those Spirits."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Permanents phase back in during their controller\'s untap step, immediately before that player untaps their permanents. Creatures that phase in this way are able to attack and pay a cost of {T} during that turn. If a permanent had counters on it when it phased out, it will have those counters when it phases back in."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Phased-out permanents are treated as though they don\'t exist. They can\'t be the target of spells or abilities, their static abilities have no effect on the game, their triggered abilities can\'t trigger, they can\'t attack or block, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Phasing out doesn\\\'t cause any "leaves the battlefield" abilities to trigger. Similarly, phasing in won\\\'t cause any "enters the battlefield" abilities to trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Although the creature you put onto the battlefield is an attacking creature, it was never declared as an attacking creature. This means that abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks won\'t trigger when it enters the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Haste reminder text isn\'t normally included in most card sets these days, but we felt explaining what haste means was important for this card."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If Shadowfax, Lord of Horses leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, compare the power of the creature card in your hand with Shadowfax\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The creature card you put onto the battlefield needs to have lesser power in your hand than the Shadowfax, Lord of Horses on the battlefield. The creature that enters the battlefield doesn\'t need to have lesser power than Shadowfax (this can happen if it enters with +1/+1 counters on it, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You choose which player, planeswalker, or battle the creature you put onto the battlefield is attacking as it enters the battlefield. It doesn\'t have to be attacking the same player, planeswalker, or battle that Shadowfax, Lord of Horses is attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Control of the Equipment doesn\'t change. If you target an Equipment an opponent controls, you won\'t be able to activate its equip ability, for example, and they can activate its equip ability as a sorcery to reattach it to a creature they control."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "When Shagrat, Loot Bearer\'s ability triggers, you can choose not to target an Equipment just to amass Orcs. However, if you do choose a target, and that target is illegal at the time the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t amass Orcs."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Gríma Wormtongue\'s activated ability checks whether the sacrificed creature was legendary as it last existed on the battlefield. It doesn\'t matter whether or not it\'s legendary in the graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If an effect says to set an opponent\'s life total to a number that\'s higher than the opponent\'s current life total while Gríma Wormtongue is on the battlefield, the player\'s life total doesn\'t change."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Spells and abilities that cause opponents to gain life still resolve while Gríma Wormtongue is on the battlefield. No opponent will gain life, but any other effects of that spell or ability will still happen.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you choose a value of 0 for X while you control a non-Orc Army, you won\'t put any counters on it, but it will become an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you choose a value of 0 for X while you don\'t control an Army, you will create a 0/0 Orc Army creature token and won\'t put any counters on it. In most cases, that 0/0 token will die immediately."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The last chapter ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Any creatures that come under your control later in the turn won\'t be affected."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can cast Treason of Isengard without a target just to amass Orcs. However, if you do choose a target, and that target is illegal at the time Treason of Isengard tries to resolve, Treason of Isengard won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t amass Orcs."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Foray of Orcs at the time you cast it. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you amass Orcs this way. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Grishnákh, Brash Instigator\\\'s ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you amass Orcs this way. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Spells that were cast before Saruman the White count. If Saruman the White was the first spell you cast this turn, the next spell you cast this turn is your second spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The legendary creature must already be on the battlefield as the land enters the battlefield. If it enters the battlefield at the same time, the land will enter tapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Excess damage has been dealt to a creature if the damage dealt to it is greater than lethal damage. Usually, this means damage greater than its toughness, although damage already marked on the creature is taken into account.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If Warbeast of Gorgoroth and one or more other creatures you control with power 4 or greater die at the same time, its ability will trigger once for each of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Amass Zombies works the same way, except you create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token if you don\'t control an Army. If the Army creature you chose isn\'t already a Zombie, it becomes a Zombie in addition to its other types. By combining cards with amass Orcs and amass Zombies, you can end up with an Orc Zombie Army."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Amass abilities are now written as "amass [subtype] N." Previous cards with amass have received errata to say "amass Zombies N."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability causes an opponent to put cards into their hand without specifically using the word "draw," it\\\'s not a card drawn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Orc Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you played a creature with changeling) while you amass Orcs, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn\'t an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some cards refer to the "amassed Army." That means the Army creature you chose to receive counters, even if no counters were placed on it for some reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that amass Orcs may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t amass Orcs."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To amass Orcs N, if you don\'t control an Army creature, create a 0/0 black Orc Army creature token. Then you choose an Army creature you control and put N +1/+1 counters on it. If that Army isn\'t already an Orc, it becomes an Orc in addition to its other types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers when another ability resolves, such as Tom Bombadil\'s triggered ability, triggers when all of its instructions (as modified by applicable replacement effects) have been followed and it has been removed from the stack. For example, if Tom Bombadil is returned to the battlefield by the final chapter ability of Elspeth Conquers Death, it will be on the battlefield in time to see that final chapter ability finish resolving and get removed from the stack, and thus Tom Bombadil\'s last ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Damage dealt to creatures remains on those creatures until the cleanup step or until an effect removes that damage. If you control Tom Bombadil with at least 4 damage on it as well as a single Saga which has four or more lore counters on it, and that Saga leaves the battlefield later in the turn, Tom Bombadil will be destroyed. This will be true even if that Saga leaves the battlefield as a result of its final chapter ability leaving the stack; state-based actions will be checked before Tom Bombadil\'s triggered ability could get you another Saga."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The final chapter ability of a Saga is the ability with the greatest chapter number among chapter abilities that Saga has.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Any choices made as a spell resolves won\'t have been made yet once it\'s copied. Any such choices will be made separately as the copy resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Display of Power\'s first ability only functions on the stack. It can still be copied from your graveyard, your hand, or any other zone."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a spell has damage divided as it was put onto the stack, the division can\'t be changed, although the targets receiving that damage still can. The same is true of spells that distribute counters to targets."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a spell that\'s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy has the same value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If a spell that\\\'s copied is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy will have the same mode or modes. You can\\\'t choose different ones.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you cast Display of Power, you can, at most, make one copy of each instant and sorcery spell on the stack. It\'s not possible for one Display of Power to copy the same spell multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If you copy multiple spells with Display of Power, you can put the copies on the stack in any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The copies are created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast." Creating the copies won\\\'t cause abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The copies will have the same targets as the spells they\'re copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. The new targets must be legal. If, for any target, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for a copied spell. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Any choices made when the spell resolves won\'t have been made yet when it\'s copied. Any such choices will be made separately when the copy resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a permanent spell is copied, it\'s put onto the battlefield as a token as the spell resolves rather than putting the copy of the spell onto the battlefield. The rules that apply to a permanent spell becoming a permanent apply to a copy of a spell becoming a token."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the spell has damage divided as it was put onto the stack, the division can\'t be changed, although the targets receiving that damage still can. The same is true of spells that distribute counters."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy has the same value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the spell that\\\'s copied is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy will have the same mode or modes. You can\\\'t choose different ones.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Spells that were cast before Storm of Saruman count. If Storm of Saruman was the first spell you cast this turn, the next spell you cast this turn is your second spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The copy is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast." Creating the copy won\\\'t cause abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If the spell is a permanent spell with targets, such as an Aura, you may also choose a new target for that spell. The new targets must be legal. If, for any target, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The token that a resolving copy of a permanent spell becomes isn\\\'t said to have been "created" and won\\\'t interact with abilities that care about tokens being created, such as that of Rosie Cotton of South Lane.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for a copied spell. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Call of the Ring\'s last ability will trigger any time you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer, even if that creature was already your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the Ring tempts you but you can\'t choose a creature as your Ring-bearer (probably because you control no creatures), Call of the Ring\'s last ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Fiery Inscription\'s second triggered ability will resolve before the spell that caused the ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Frodo, Sauron\'s Bane\'s first ability checks whether it\'s a Citizen, and its second ability checks whether it\'s a Scout. It doesn\'t matter how it became the appropriate creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "None of these abilities have a duration. If one of them resolves, it will remain in effect until the game ends, Frodo, Sauron\'s Bane leaves the battlefield, or some subsequent effect changes its characteristics, whichever comes first."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can activate Frodo, Sauron\'s Bane\'s abilities regardless of what creature types it is. Each of those abilities checks Frodo\'s creature types when that ability resolves. If Frodo, Sauron\'s Bane isn\'t the appropriate creature type at the time, that ability does nothing."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If Frodo Baggins is your Ring-bearer but each creature the defending player controls can\'t block for any reason (such as by having greater power than Frodo along with the first ability of the Ring emblem), then Frodo Baggins isn\'t blocked. If there\'s a cost associated with blocking Frodo Baggins, the defending player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to be blocked in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If Frodo Baggins is your Ring-bearer, only one creature is required to block it. Other creatures may also block it and are free to block other creatures or not block at all.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If Scroll of Isildur leaves the battlefield or you lose control of it before its first chapter ability resolves, control of the target artifact doesn\'t change at all."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the target is not legal as Scroll of Isildur\'s first chapter ability tries to resolve, the ability is removed from the stack. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast with an alternative cost that includes mana (such as flashback), Boromir\'s second ability won\'t trigger and won\'t counter that spell. Similarly, if a spell is cast without paying its mana cost, but the player did pay mana for additional costs such as from kicker or from Thorn of Amethyst, Boromir\'s second ability won\'t trigger and won\'t counter that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Players may cast spells that they know Boromir, Warden of the Tower will counter. Any abilities that trigger when spells are cast will still trigger and resolve if appropriate, and any effects that count how many spells are cast will still count those spells if appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Once the exiled creature returns, it\'s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled creatures will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creatures will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creatures will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can target a creature you own but don\'t control with Slip On the Ring."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you\'re fortunate enough to open or draft ten or more Nazgûl during a Limited event, you can include only nine of them in your deck. The rest remain in your sideboard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The last ability of Nazgûl also lets you ignore the "singleton" rule in formats like Commander.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The last ability of Nazgûl lets you ignore the "four-of" rule. It doesn\\\'t let you ignore format legality. For example, during a The Lord of the Rings: Tales of Middle-earth™ Limited event, you can\\\'t add Nazgûl from your personal collection, no matter how much Sauron might want you to.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Ringsight won\'t let you search for a colorless card, even if you control a colorless legendary creature."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Your Ring-bearer is legendary, so you can search for a card that shares a color with the Ring-bearer that you chose as the Ring tempted you.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Shortcut to Mushrooms doesn\'t need to have been on the battlefield when the permanent you controlled left the battlefield. For example, if a creature dies during combat on your turn and you cast Shortcut to Mushrooms during your second main phase, its last ability will trigger at the beginning of your end step."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Shortcut to Mushrooms\'s last ability will trigger only once during your end step, no matter how many permanents you controlled left the battlefield this turn. However, if no permanents you control have left the battlefield so far this turn as your end step begins, the ability won\'t trigger at all. It\'s not possible to cause a permanent you control to leave the battlefield during the end step in time to have the ability trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Sméagol, Helpful Guide doesn\'t need to have been on the battlefield when the creature died. For example, if a creature dies under your control during combat on your turn and you cast Sméagol, Helpful Guide during your second main phase, its first ability will trigger at the beginning of your end step."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Sméagol, Helpful Guide\'s first ability will trigger only once during your end step, no matter how many creatures died under your control this turn. However, if no creatures have died under your control so far this turn as your end step begins, the ability won\'t trigger at all. It\'s not possible to cause a creature to die under your control during the end step in time to have the ability trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The opponent may split the cards into one pile of four and one pile of zero. The pile of four cards could be the face-up pile or the face-down pile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You choose just one opponent to look at the top four cards of your library and put them into piles. Other players can\'t look, but they may attempt to offer advice without knowing what cards are there. The player who looks may choose what information to share with others if that player wants advice on how to split the cards, but that player doesn\'t have to share any information at all."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to reveal the cards in the face-down pile if you put it into your hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "As the Ring tempts you, you get an emblem named The Ring if you don\'t have one. Then your emblem gains its next ability and you choose a creature you control to become (or remain) your Ring-bearer."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each player can have only one emblem named The Ring and only one Ring-bearer at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Each time the Ring tempts you, you must choose a creature if you control one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If you gain control of a creature with the triggered ability, you can immediately choose that creature as your Ring-bearer as the Ring tempts you.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Rangers of Ithilien\'s triggered ability lets you gain control of a creature if it has lesser power than Rangers of Ithilien at the time that you choose the target and at the time that the ability resolves. After that, it no longer matters what the creature\'s power is; you will continue to control it for as long as you control Rangers of Ithilien."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that cause the Ring to tempt you may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring gains its abilities in order from top to bottom. Once it gains an ability, it has that ability for the rest of the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "When Rangers of Ithilien\'s ability triggers, you can choose not to target a creature just to have the Ring tempt you. However, if you do choose a target, and that target is illegal at the time the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. The Ring won\'t tempt you."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Attaching an Equipment with its enters-the-battlefield triggered ability isn\'t the same as using its equip ability. You don\'t pay mana for the attachment, and the timing restrictions for equip abilities don\'t apply."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Galadhrim Bow doesn\'t enter the battlefield attached to a creature. Instead, the Equipment enters the battlefield and then a triggered ability attaches it to a creature. You may cast Galadhrim Bow even if you don\'t control any creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the target creature becomes an illegal target, the Equipment remains on the battlefield unattached, and no creatures are untapped.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Attaching an Equipment with its enters-the-battlefield triggered ability isn\'t the same as using its equip ability. You don\'t pay mana for the attachment, and the timing restrictions for equip abilities don\'t apply."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the target creature becomes an illegal target, the Equipment remains on the battlefield unattached.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Mithril Coat doesn\'t enter the battlefield attached to a creature. Instead, the Equipment enters the battlefield and then a triggered ability attaches it to a creature. You may cast Mithril Coat even if you don\'t control any creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Attacking a planeswalker you control or battle you\'re protecting doesn\'t count as attacking you."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Bill the Pony\'s last ability doesn\'t actually change any creature\'s power. It changes only the amount of combat damage it assigns. All other rules and effects that check power or toughness use the real values. For example, since having two creatures fight doesn\'t result in combat damage, an effect that causes the affected creature to fight another creature will still use its power to determine how much damage is dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Butterbur, Bree Innkeeper\'s ability checks if you control a Food at the beginning of your end step. If you do, the ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the ability does trigger, but you control a Food when it tries to resolve, the ability will do nothing. No Food will be created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Celeborn the Wise\'s first ability has you scry 1 just once whenever you attack with one or more Elves, no matter how many Elves you attack with and no matter how many players you attack."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Celeborn the Wise\'s last ability cares about the number of cards you actually looked at. For example, if you were supposed to scry 3 but only had two cards in your library, Celeborn would get +2/+2."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Denethor, Ruling Steward doesn\'t need to have been on the battlefield when the creature died. For example, if a creature dies during combat on your turn and you cast Denethor, Ruling Steward during your second main phase, its first ability will trigger at the beginning of your end step."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Denethor, Ruling Steward\'s first ability will trigger only once during your end step, no matter how many creatures died under your control this turn. However, if no creatures have died under your control this turn as your end step begins, the ability won\'t trigger at all. It\'s not possible to cause a creature to die under your control during the end step in time to have the ability trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Eagles of the North\'s triggered ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Any creatures that come under your control later in the turn won\'t be affected."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Typecycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on a card being typecycled. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops a typecycling ability from being activated.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Unlike the normal cycling ability, typecycling doesn\'t allow you to draw a card. Rather, it lets you search your library for a card with the type or types indicated by the ability name. For example, a card with basic landcycling lets you search for a basic land card, and a card with Wizardcycling lets you search for a Wizard card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Elrond, Master of Healing\'s first ability cares about the number of cards you actually looked at. For example, if you were supposed to scry 3 but only had two cards in your library, X would be 2."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If two creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them become the target of the same spell or ability an opponent controls, Elrond, Master of Healing\'s last ability will trigger twice."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Elven Chorus doesn\'t change when you can cast creature spells. Normally, this means during your main phase when the stack is empty, although flash may change this."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can\'t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast a spell from the top of your library, you can\'t look at the next one until you\'re done paying for that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The top card of your library isn\'t in your hand, so you can\'t take other actions that would normally be allowed from your hand, such as discarding it due to an effect or activating a cycling ability."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can look at the top card of your library whenever you want (with one restriction; see below), even if you don\'t have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You\'ll still pay all costs for the spell, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Elvish Mariner\'s last ability cares about the number of cards you actually looked at. For example, if you were supposed to scry 3 but only had two cards in your library, X would be 2."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Erebor Flamesmith\'s triggered ability will resolve before the spell that caused the ability to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Erkenbrand, Lord of Westfold\'s triggered ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Any creatures that come under your control later in the turn won\'t be affected."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Faramir, Field Commander doesn\'t need to have been on the battlefield when the creature died. For example, if a creature dies during combat on your turn and you cast Faramir, Field Commander during your second main phase, its first ability will trigger at the beginning of your end step."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Faramir, Field Commander\'s first ability will trigger only once during your end step, no matter how many creatures died under your control this turn. However, if no creatures have died under your control so far this turn as your end step begins, the ability won\'t trigger at all. It\'s not possible to cause a creature to die under your control during the end step in time to have the ability trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Fires of Mount Doom\'s first ability can target a creature that has no Equipment attached to it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the target of Fires of Mount Doom\'s first ability is illegal by the time the ability tries to resolve, it\'s removed from the stack. You won\'t destroy any Equipment."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you activate Fires of Mount Doom\'s last ability but don\'t play the exiled card this turn using that casting permission, Fires of Mount Doom won\'t deal damage to each player."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for a card played this way. For example, if the exiled card is a land card, you may play it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "First the active player chooses which creature they\'ll sacrifice, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing choices made before their choice. Then all those creatures are sacrificed simultaneously."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You cannot return the same permanent card that you sacrificed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You choose which permanent card you\'re returning to the battlefield, if any, as Rise of the Witch-King resolves, after permanents are sacrificed."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "For the last ability, the target Kraken can (and probably will) be The Watcher in the Water. If it is, and if it has at least one stun counter on it, you\'ll remove a stun counter from it instead of untapping it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Gaining protection from everything causes a spell or ability on the stack to have an illegal target if it targets you. As a spell or ability tries to resolve, if all its targets are illegal, that spell or ability doesn\'t resolve and none of its effects happen, including effects unrelated to the target. If at least one target is still legal, the spell or ability does as much as it can to the remaining legal targets, and its other effects still happen."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a player has protection from everything, it means three things: 1) All damage that would be dealt to that player is prevented. 2) Auras can\'t be attached to that player. 3) That player can\'t be the target of spells or abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Nothing other than the specified events are prevented or illegal. An effect that doesn\'t target you could still cause you to discard cards, for example. Creatures can still attack you while you have protection from everything, although combat damage that they would deal to you will be prevented."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Protection from everything will usually prevent damage if it would be dealt to you, but some damage can\'t be prevented. In this case, that damage reduces your life total as normal."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Gimli\'s Fury checks whether the creature is legendary as it resolves. If the target isn\'t legendary as the spell is cast but becomes one before the spell resolves, that creature will gain trample."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Gimli, Mournful Avenger doesn\'t need to have been on the battlefield when creatures died under your control for the first ability to count them. For example, if two creatures you control die during combat on your turn and you cast Gimli, Mournful Avenger during your second main phase, it will have indestructible until end of turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Gimli, Mournful Avenger\\\'s last ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when its last ability resolves for the third time in a turn. You may choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If Andúril is equipped to a creature an opponent controls, Andúril\'s controller will create two tapped Spirit tokens each time that creature attacks. Even if that creature is legendary, the Spirits would not enter the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the equipped creature is legendary, Andúril\'s controller chooses which player, planeswalker, or battle the Spirit tokens are attacking. Each Spirit token can enter attacking a different player, planeswalker, or battle, and they don\'t need to be the same player, planeswalker, or battle that the equipped creature is attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If Gandalf, White Rider\'s owner has three or fewer cards left in their library when the last ability resolves, you may have it become the bottom card of their library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If Saradoc, Master of Buckland\'s power is greater than 2 as it enters the battlefield, its first ability will still trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If Smite the Deathless doesn\'t deal damage to the target creature (perhaps because that damage was prevented), the additional effects will still apply. It will still lose indestructible, and it will be exiled instead of dying that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The damaged creature will be exiled if it would die for any reason that turn, not just if it dies due to damage from Smite the Deathless.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can target a creature that doesn\'t have indestructible with Smite the Deathless. It will still be exiled if it would die this turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a green mana you add to your mana pool has certain restrictions or riders associated with it (for example, if it was produced by Great Hall of the Citadel), they\'ll apply to that mana no matter when you spend it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Once Fangorn, Tree Shepherd leaves the battlefield, you have until the end of the current step or phase to spend whatever green mana is in your mana pool before it too empties as normal. There is no penalty associated with this other than the loss of the mana.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You can keep green mana in your mana pool indefinitely while Fangorn, Tree Shepherd is on the battlefield. That means if you add a green mana to your mana pool during one step or phase, you can spend it during a later step or phase, or even a later turn. Other types of mana will continue to empty from your mana pool as each step and phase ends.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a permanent with {X} in its mana cost is returned to a player\'s hand this way, {X} is 0 for the purpose of evaluating its mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a spell is returned to its owner\'s hand, it\'s removed from the stack and thus will not resolve. The spell isn\'t countered; it just no longer exists. This works against a spell that can\'t be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a spell with {X} in its mana cost is returned to a player\'s hand this way, {X} is the value chosen as the spell was cast for the purpose of evaluating the spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a spell is returned to its owner\'s hand, it\'s removed from the stack and thus will not resolve. The spell isn\'t countered; it just no longer exists. This works against a spell that can\'t be countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Meneldor\'s second ability can target any permanent you own, including those another player controls."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Once the exiled permanent returns, it\'s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the ability doesn\'t resolve (either for having its target become illegal or because a spell or ability counters it), the mode chosen for that instance of the ability still counts as being chosen."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter who has chosen any particular mode. For example, say you control Gandalf the Grey and have chosen the first two modes. If an opponent gains control of Gandalf the Grey, that player can choose only the third or fourth mode."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The phrase "that hasn\\\'t been chosen" refers only to that specific Gandalf the Grey. If Gandalf the Grey leaves the battlefield (possibly because of the fourth mode of its ability) and then returns to the battlefield later, it will be a new object with no memory of the modes chosen when it was last on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You choose the mode as the triggered ability goes on the stack. You can choose a mode that requires targets only if there are legal targets available.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Hithlain Knots tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You won\'t scry 1, and you won\'t draw a card. However, if the target is legal but doesn\'t become tapped (most likely because it\'s already tapped), you do scry 1, and you do draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the target creature\'s controller has zero cards left in their library when Isolation at Orthanc resolves, that creature becomes the top card of their library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the target is not legal as Ringwraiths\'s first ability tries to resolve, the ability is removed from the stack. The creature\'s controller won\'t lose life."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The Ring can tempt you even if you don\\\'t control a creature. In this case, abilities that trigger "whenever the Ring tempts you" will still trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the target of Arwen\'s second ability is illegal as it tries to resolve, the ability does nothing. You won\'t get to put any counters on Arwen."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You remove the indestructible counter from Arwen as a cost to activate its second ability. If Arwen already received 2 damage earlier in the turn, it will be destroyed due to having lethal damage before you get to put a +1/+1 counter on it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell that targets Legolas, Master Archer and at least one creature you don\'t control, both of Legolas, Master Archer\'s abilities will trigger. You choose the order in which those triggers go on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Legolas, Master Archer\'s last ability triggers when you cast a spell that has multiple targets as long as at least one of those targets is a creature you don\'t control. It doesn\'t trigger multiple times if you cast a spell that targets a creature you don\'t control multiple times or that targets multiple creatures you don\'t control."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Legolas, Master Archer\'s triggered abilities resolve before the spells that caused them to trigger. They resolve even if those spells are countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell that\'s multiple colors, more than one of Aragorn, the Uniter\'s abilities may trigger. In that case, you choose the order in which the abilities are put onto the stack."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you choose the first mode for Glorfindel, Dauntless Rescuer\'s triggered ability but each creature the defending player controls can\'t block for any reason (such as being tapped), then Glorfindel, Dauntless Rescuer isn\'t blocked. If there\'s a cost associated with blocking Glorfindel, Dauntless Rescuer, the defending player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to be blocked in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you choose the first mode for Glorfindel, Dauntless Rescuer\'s triggered ability, only one creature is required to block it. Other creatures may also block it (unless you\'ve also chosen the second mode for Glorfindel, Dauntles Rescuer\'s triggered ability this turn) and are free to block other creatures or not block at all."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you have no cards in your library as Gollum, Scheming Guide\'s ability resolves, your opponent\'s guess will not be right no matter what they guess. That means you\'ll draw a card, or more accurately, attempt to draw a card from your empty library and therefore (usually) lose the game."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you only have one card in your library as Gollum, Scheming Guide\'s ability resolves, you\'ll look at that card, put it back on top of your library, and then continue with the ability as normal."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You reveal the card even if your opponent guessed correctly.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If Éomer, Marshal of Rohan and one or more other attacking legendary creatures you control die at the same time (probably due to combat damage), Éomer, Marshal of Rohan\'s last ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Notably, Éomer, Marshal of Rohan\'s triggered ability doesn\'t give you any additional main phases. This means that you will move directly from the end of combat step of one combat phase to the beginning of combat step of the next one."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, Horn of the Mark\'s triggered ability triggers once for each player you attack with at least two creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Two or more creatures you control must attack the same player in order for Horn of the Mark\'s ability to trigger. Creatures you control that attack planeswalkers that player controls or battles that player is protecting won\'t count toward Horn of the Mark\'s trigger condition."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, Landroval, Horizon Witness\'s triggered ability triggers once for each player you attack with at least two creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Two or more creatures you control must attack the same player in order for Landroval, Horizon Witness\'s ability to trigger. Creatures you control that attack planeswalkers that player controls or battles that player is protecting won\'t count toward Landroval, Horizon Witness\'s trigger condition."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Isildur\'s Fateful Strike is the first legendary instant. It is subject to the same casting restrictions as existing legendary sorceries, as listed in the following rulings."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Other than the casting restriction, the legendary supertype on an instant carries no additional rules. You may cast any number of legendary instants in a turn, and your deck may contain any number of legendary cards (but no more than four of any with the same name).\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast a legendary instant unless you control a legendary creature or a legendary planeswalker. Once you begin to cast a legendary instant, losing control of your legendary creatures and planeswalkers won\'t affect that spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Mauhúr\'s last ability applies to counters placed on Army tokens when you amass Orcs (or Zombies, or anything else.)"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Merry and the other attacking legendary creature don\'t have to be attacking the same player, planeswalker, or battle."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Mordor Trebuchet\'s controller chooses which player, planeswalker, or battle the token is attacking. It doesn\'t need to be the same player, planeswalker, or battle that any of the Goblins and/or Orcs are attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Once Nimrodel Watcher has been blocked, resolving its triggered ability won\'t change or undo that block."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Once you cast Flame of Anor and choose two modes, it doesn\'t matter what happens to the Wizard you control in response. Flame of Anor will still have two modes chosen."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Players can respond to Lash of the Balrog only after it\'s been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to stop you from casting this spell or to make it cost more mana."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You must sacrifice exactly one creature or pay an extra {4} to cast this spell; you can\'t cast it without paying one of those costs, and you can\'t pay either multiple times."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The Balrog, Durin\'s Bane\'s first ability can\'t reduce its cost to less than {B}{R}."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The Balrog, Durin\'s Bane\'s first ability counts every permanent that was sacrificed this turn, by any player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The Balrog, Flame of Udûn will be put on the bottom of its owner\'s library only if it\'s still on the battlefield when the ability resolves. If it leaves the battlefield before that point, it will stay in whatever zone it\'s in, even if it\'s returned to the battlefield before the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The Bath Song\'s final chapter ability is not a mana ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can choose no targets for The Bath Song\'s final chapter ability just to add {U}{U}. However, if you do choose targets, and all of those targets are illegal at the time the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t add {U}{U}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The Goblin or Orc you control doesn\'t have to block."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Whether you control a Goblin or Orc matters only at the time you declare blockers. Once Olog-Hai Crusher blocks a creature, that won\'t change even if all the Goblins and Orcs you control leave the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The ability triggers only once, no matter how many creatures are blocking it. The ability resolves and deals damage to those creatures before combat damage is dealt. Even if that damage destroys all creatures blocking Battle-Scarred Goblin, Battle-Scarred Goblin doesn\'t become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The creature\'s controller chooses whether or not to pay 2 life as the triggered ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Bag End Porter\'s triggered ability resolves. It won\'t change later in the turn if the number of legendary creatures you control changes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "To determine the amount of damage it deals, use Goblin Fireleaper\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield, not its power in the graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Use the card\'s power as it last existed in the graveyard to determine the value of X."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Wizard\'s Rockets last ability triggers no matter how it\'s put into a graveyard from the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You must choose the colors of mana Wizard\'s Rockets produces before its last ability has you draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You Cannot Pass! can target a creature that\'s currently blocking or being blocked by a legendary creature, or one that blocked or was blocked by a legendary creature earlier in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You Cannot Pass! only cares that the second creature was a legendary creature at the moment it blocked or became blocked by the target creature. If that legendary creature has become a nonlegendary creature (perhaps because it\'s no longer your Ring-bearer) or left the battlefield, You Cannot Pass! can still target the first creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You choose a target for Palantír of Orthanc\'s ability when it goes on the stack. If that target is illegal as the ability tries to resolve, the ability is removed from the stack. You won\'t put an influence counter on Palantír of Orthanc, and you won\'t scry, draw, or mill."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You finish scrying before choosing a target for Arwen\'s first ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You must follow all normal timing rules for a card you play using Moria Marauder\'s last ability and, if it\'s a spell, you must pay its costs to cast it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You sacrifice the lands as part of the resolution of Entish Restoration. It isn\'t an additional cost. If Entish Restoration is countered, you won\'t sacrifice any lands."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Éowyn, Fearless Knight cares about the creature\'s colors just before it left the battlefield. These could be different from the creature card\'s colors in exile (for example, if it had a copy effect applied to it on the battlefield.)"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'"Do this only once each turn" lets you choose whether or not to untap Legolas as the triggered ability resolves. If you don\\\'t untap it, the ability will trigger again the next time the condition is met. Once you choose to do so, the ability will no longer trigger for the rest of the turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Abilities that apply "as [this permanent] enters the battlefield," such as choosing a color with Gauntlet of Power, are also unaffected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'An ability of a permanent that triggers when a card is put into a graveyard "from anywhere" triggers twice only if Gandalf the White and that permanent are both still on the battlefield immediately after the legendary permanent or the artifact has been put into the graveyard from the battlefield. For example, say you control both Gandalf the White and Sefris of the Hidden Ways. If another legendary creature you control dies, Sefris\\\'s first ability will trigger twice. But if Gandalf the White dies, Sefris\\\'s first ability will trigger only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Gandalf the White affects a permanent\\\'s own enters-the-battlefield and leaves-the-battlefield triggered abilities as well as other triggered abilities that trigger when that permanent enters or leaves the battlefield. Such triggered abilities start with "when" or "whenever."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Gandalf the White\'s effect doesn\'t copy the triggered ability; it just causes the ability to trigger twice. Any choices made as you put the ability onto the stack, such as modes and targets, are made separately for each instance of the ability. Any choices made on resolution, such as whether to put counters on a permanent, are also made individually."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If a legendary permanent or an artifact entering or leaving the battlefield at the same time as Gandalf the White (including Gandalf the White itself) causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If you somehow control two copies of Gandalf the White, a legendary permanent or an artifact entering or leaving the battlefield causes abilities to trigger three times, not four. A third Gandalf the White causes abilities to trigger four times, a fourth causes abilities to trigger five times, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Look at each legendary permanent and each artifact as it exists on the battlefield, taking into account continuous effects, to determine whether any triggered abilities will trigger multiple times. For example, if a nonlegendary creature that has become legendary (probably because it\'s a player\'s Ring-bearer) dies, an ability that triggers when it leaves the battlefield triggers twice."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Replacement effects are unaffected by Gandalf the White\'s ability. For example, a legendary creature that enters the battlefield with one +1/+1 counter on it won\'t receive an additional +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The second ability applies only to casting spells. It does not, for example, change when you may activate abilities that can be activated "only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The trigger event doesn\\\'t have to specifically refer to legendary permanents or to artifacts, nor does it have to specifically refer to when something "leaves the battlefield." For example, an ability that triggers "whenever a creature dies" would trigger twice if a legendary creature or an artifact creature dies while Gandalf the White is on the battlefield, as would an ability that triggers "whenever a permanent is put into a graveyard from the battlefield."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You don\'t need to control the permanent entering or leaving the battlefield, only the permanent that has the triggered ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keywords are activated abilities; they have colons in their reminder text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'An activated mana ability is one that produces mana as it resolves, not one that costs mana to activate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If an activated ability of a land an opponent controls references the card it\'s printed on by name, treat Sharkey, Tyrant of the Shire\'s version of that ability as though it referenced Sharkey, Tyrant of the Shire by name instead."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Sharkey, Tyrant of the Shire gains only activated abilities, excluding activated mana abilities. It doesn\'t gain keyword abilities (unless those keyword abilities are activated), triggered abilities, or static abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Sharkey, Tyrant of the Shire\'s last ability uses a new template indicating that you may spend mana as though it were mana of any type to activate Sharkey, Tyrant of the Shire\'s abilities. The six types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Snow mana is not a type of mana. Sharkey, Tyrant of the Shire\'s last ability won\'t let you pay a snow cost using mana produced by a nonsnow source."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Any abilities that trigger during the resolution of Hew the Entwood will wait to be put on the stack until everything is put on the battlefield and resolution is complete. The player whose turn it is puts their triggered abilities on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. (The last ability put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You sacrifice the lands as part of the resolution of Hew the Entwood. It isn\'t an additional cost. If Hew the Entwood is countered, you won\'t sacrifice any lands."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any "as [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[this creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the chosen creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Except for being a Food artifact, having the listed activated ability, and losing all other card types and subtypes, the token copies only what was printed on the original creature (unless that creature is copying something else; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature was tapped or untapped, whether it had any counters on it or Auras or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that had changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the copied creature is a token, the new token that\'s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created that token, with the exceptions noted above."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is copying something else, then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied, with the exceptions noted above.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Since the token is a Food artifact and not a creature, it can\'t attack or block unless it becomes a creature somehow."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The token copies the creature as it last existed on the battlefield before it died, not as it exists in the graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Any time you are instructed to draw more than one card, you draw them one at a time. For example, if you control Phial of Galadriel and have no cards in hand and you\\\'re instructed to "draw two cards," your first card draw is replaced by drawing two cards, then you\\\'ll draw the second card from the original instruction. In total, you\\\'ll draw three cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect would set your life total to a specific number that\\\'s higher than your current life total, that effect causes you to gain life equal to the difference. If your life total is 5 or less, Phial of Galadriel will then double the amount of life that effect would cause you to gain. For example, if you have 3 life and an effect says that your life total "becomes 10," you would gain 7 life which Phial doubles to 14, so your life total will actually become 17.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If two or more replacement effects would apply to a card-drawing event, the player drawing the card chooses the order in which to apply them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If you somehow control more than one Phial of Galadriel, each one will effectively add one card. For example, if you control two Phials of Galadriel and would draw a card while you have no cards in hand, the effect of one Phial of Galadriel will replace the event "draw a card" with "draw two cards." The effect of the other Phial of Galadriel will replace the drawing of the first of those two cards with "draw two cards." In total, you would draw three cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won\'t cause Phial of Galadriel\'s second ability to apply, even though it will cause your team\'s life total to increase."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The second abilities of multiple Phials of Galadriel are cumulative. If you control two, life gained while you have 5 or less life will be multiplied by 4. Three Phials will multiply that life gain by 8. And so on.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Because creatures controlled by opponents aren\\\'t being put into a graveyard, any "when [this creature] dies" triggered abilities those creatures have won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the target is not legal as Stone of Erech\'s activated ability tries to resolve, the ability is removed from the stack. You won\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Elanor Gardner doesn\'t need to have been on the battlefield when you sacrificed a Food this turn. For example, if you sacrifice a Food during your first main phase and you cast Elanor Gardner during your second main phase, its last ability will trigger at the beginning of your end step."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Elanor Gardner\'s last ability will trigger only once during your end step, no matter how many Foods you sacrificed this turn. However, if you haven\'t sacrificed any Foods this turn as your end step begins, the ability won\'t trigger at all. It\'s not possible to sacrifice a Food during the end step in time to have the ability trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Halflings attacking a planeswalker or battle won\'t cause Meriadoc Brandybuck\'s ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Meriadoc Brandybuck\'s ability has you create just one Food token per player you attack with a Halfling, no matter how many Halflings you attack them with beyond the first."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas to Pippin\'s Bravery."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Pippin\'s Bravery tries to resolve, Pippin\'s Bravery is removed from the stack. You won\'t be able to sacrifice a Food to it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You choose a target creature as you cast Pippin\'s Bravery, but you don\'t choose whether to sacrifice a Food until the spell resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If a Food you control is also a creature, it will be counted twice.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you create a creature token, you can target it with Rosie Cotton of South Lane\'s last ability."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you create multiple tokens at once, Rosie Cotton of South Lane\'s last ability will trigger once for each token you created."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Peregrin Took\'s first ability applies to all kinds of tokens that its controller creates, not just Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The additional Food tokens won\\\'t have any abilities the other tokens were created with. Anything else specified in the effect creating the token (such as tapped or "Exile that token at end of combat") applies to both the original tokens and the Food.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You don\'t need to control the spell or ability that creates the tokens, but you do have to be the one creating the tokens for Peregrin Took\'s ability to apply."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Eastfarthing Farmer\\\'s ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you create a Food token this way. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Nimble Hobbit\\\'s ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you sacrifice a Food or pay {2}{W} this way. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The legendary creature must already be on the battlefield as the land enters the battlefield. If it enters the battlefield at the same time, the land will enter tapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Do not eat the delicious cards. No, not even for second breakfast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures in other sets, it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Lembas, an artifact card with the Food subtype, to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Some spells and abilities that create Food tokens may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Food tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Typecycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on a card being typecycled. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops a typecycling ability from being activated.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Unlike the normal cycling ability, typecycling doesn\'t allow you to draw a card. Rather, it lets you search your library for a card with the type or types indicated by the ability name. For example, a card with basic landcycling lets you search for a basic land card, and a card with Wizardcycling lets you search for a Wizard card."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the last ability of Bill the Pony."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Excess damage caused by a spell or ability is similar to how combat damage from a creature with trample is handled. Start with the amount of damage being dealt to the creature and determine what is "lethal." This is the creature\\\'s toughness minus the amount of damage that it already has marked on it, but ignoring any replacement or prevention effects that will modify this damage. Also ignore whether the creature has an ability such as indestructible that will result in it not being destroyed by this damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Gandalf\'s Sanction is not yet in your graveyard when you determine the value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Gandalf\'s Sanction tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. It won\'t deal damage to any player."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve determined how much damage is excess, Gandalf\'s Sanction simultaneously deals damage to the creature and to its controller. This damage may be modified by replacement or prevention effects."}]', "[{'date': '2023-06-16', 'text': 'For the last ability, none of the chosen creatures are targets of the ability. You may choose creatures with shroud, for example.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-06-16', 'text': 'If Bill Ferny, Bree Swindler is removed from combat, it remains tapped if it was tapped.'}, {'date': '2023-06-16', 'text': 'The ability triggers only once, no matter how many creatures are blocking it.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-06-16', 'text': 'If Gimli, Counter of Kills dies at the same time as one or more creatures an opponent controls, the last ability will trigger for each of those other creatures.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If Shire Shirriff leaves the battlefield before its last ability resolves, you can still sacrifice a token. However, when you do, the target creature won\\\'t be exiled when the "reflexive" triggered ability resolves. Similarly, if Shire Shirriff leaves the battlefield while the "reflexive" ability is still on the stack, the target creature won\\\'t be exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Shire Shirriff\\\'s last ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you sacrifice a token this way. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If a token copy of Radagast the Brown enters the battlefield, its own ability will trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If the top X cards of your library don\'t contain a creature card that doesn\'t share a creature type with a creature you control, you won\'t get to put a card into your hand. Apologies to Mistform Ultimus fans everywhere."}]', "[{'date': '2023-06-16', 'text': 'If one of the two target creatures you control is an illegal target as Friendly Rivalry resolves, the other will still deal damage equal to its power.'}, {'date': '2023-06-16', 'text': 'If the last target is an illegal target as Friendly Rivalry resolves, or if both of the first targets are illegal targets, no creature deals or is dealt damage.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the card copied by the token had any "when [this permanent] enters the battlefield" abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it\\\'s created. Similarly, any "as [this permanent] enters the battlefield" or "[this permanent] enters the battlefield with" abilities that the token has copied will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the exiled card has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The delayed triggered ability will exile the token at the beginning of your next end step unless Sauron, the Necromancer is your Ring-bearer at the time that the ability resolves. If Sauron, the Necromancer leaves the battlefield before the delayed triggered ability resolves, that ability will exile the token, even if Sauron, the Necromancer later returns to the battlefield or you control another copy of Sauron, the Necromancer as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics it specifically modifies. It doesn\'t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The token is a Wraith instead of its other creature types (and other subtypes if it has any) and is black instead of its other colors. Its base power and toughness are 3/3. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-06-16', 'text': 'If the creature put onto the battlefield this way is a Dwarf and/or Elf, Doors of Durin will see it when checking whether you control a Dwarf or Elf.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The second ability applies only to casting spells. It does not, for example, change when you may activate abilities that can be activated "only as a sorcery."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You finish scrying before revealing the top card of your library.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature you choose as your Ring-bearer was already your Ring-bearer, that still counts as choosing that creature as your Ring-bearer for the purpose of abilities that trigger "whenever you choose a creature as your Ring-bearer" or abilities that care about which creature was chosen as your Ring-bearer.\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-06-16', 'text': 'If the defending player controls two or more creatures tied for the least power among creatures they control, that player chooses one of them to sacrifice.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the legendary spell you cast this way is copied, the copy can be countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'The legendary spell can\\\'t be countered if the mana produced by Delighted Halfling is spent to pay any portion of the spell\\\'s cost, even an additional cost or an alternative cost. This is true even if you pay an additional cost while casting a spell "without paying its mana cost."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost", you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell using Glamdring\'s triggered ability, you do so as part of the resolution of the ability. You can\'t wait to cast the spell later in the turn. Timing permissions based on the card\'s type are ignored."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If the spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have an enchantment, instant, or sorcery card in your hand, you won\'t be able to pay Saruman of Many Colors\'s ward cost."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t want to cast the copy, you can choose not to; the copy ceases to exist the next time state-based actions are checked."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "You cast the copy while the ability is resolving and still on the stack. You can\'t wait to cast it later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Saruman of Many Colors\\\'s ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when one or more cards are milled this way. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Shadow of the Enemy uses a new template indicating that you may spend mana as though it were mana of any type to cast the exiled cards. The six types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Snow mana is not a type of mana. Shadow of the Enemy won\'t let you pay a snow cost using mana produced by a nonsnow source."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for spells cast this way.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some Equipment creature cards in other sets have reconfigure, a different ability that attaches them to a creature. Reconfigure is not an equip ability, and reconfigure costs are not reduced by Éowyn, Lady of Rohan\\\'s last ability. Equip variants or equip abilities with restrictions, like the "equip Human" ability of Dúnedain Blade, are still equip abilities, and their costs will be reduced by Éowyn, Lady of Rohan\\\'s last ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Éowyn, Lady of Rohan\'s last ability reduces only the amount of generic mana in equip abilities. For example, it will reduce an equip cost of {1} to {0}, but it will have no effect on an equip cost of {G}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Some Equipment creature cards in other sets have reconfigure, a different ability that attaches them to a creature. Reconfigure is not an equip ability. Reconfigure abilities cannot be activated at instant speed by Forge Anew\\\'s second ability, and you may not pay {0} rather than pay their reconfigure cost with Forge Anew\\\'s last ability. Equip variants or equip abilities with restrictions, like the "equip Human" ability of Dúnedain Blade, are still equip abilities, and you may pay {0} rather than pay their cost.\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-06-16', 'text': 'Spells that were cast before Lotho, Corrupt Shirriff count. If Lotho, Corrupt Shirriff was the first spell you cast this turn, the next spell you cast this turn is your second spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-06-16', 'text': 'The legendary creature must already be on the battlefield as the land enters the battlefield. If it enters the battlefield at the same time, the land will enter tapped.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'This applies only to casting spells. It does not, for example, change when you can activate abilities that can be activated "only as a sorcery."\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-06-16', 'text': 'To move a counter from one permanent to another, the counter is removed from the first permanent and put on the second. Any abilities that care about a counter being removed from or put onto a permanent will apply.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'Typecycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on a card being typecycled. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops a typecycling ability from being activated.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': "Unlike the normal cycling ability, typecycling doesn\'t allow you to draw a card. Rather, it lets you search your library for a card with the type or types indicated by the ability name. For example, a card with basic landcycling lets you search for a basic land card, and a card with Wizardcycling lets you search for a Wizard card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a mode for Gorbag of Minas Morgul\\\'s ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you sacrifice a Goblin or Orc this way. You choose a mode for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-16\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t choose a target for Old Man Willow\\\'s last ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you sacrifice a creature or token this way. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal.\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-06-16', 'text': 'You may choose any card type. The ones that may appear in a normal game of Magic are artifact, battle, creature, enchantment, instant, land, planeswalker, sorcery, and tribal (a card type found on some older cards). Supertypes such as legendary and basic may not be chosen. Subtypes such as Halfling, Aura, and Forest also may not be chosen.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Adler des Nordens\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Adler des Nordens ins Spiel kommen, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+0 und Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nEbenenumwandlung {1} ({1}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617098&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10f70d10-5b37-4322-8097-dfc892148736\', \'multiverseId\': 617098}, \'multiverseid\': 617098}, {\'name\': \'Águilas del norte\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando las Águilas del norte entren al campo de batalla, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+0 y ganan la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\\nCiclo de llanura {1}. ({1}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a325c895-d360-411a-b65f-075cc2c06b98\', \'multiverseId\': 617359}, \'multiverseid\': 617359}, {\'name\': \'Aigles du nord\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand les Aigles du nord arrivent sur le champ de bataille, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 et acquièrent l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nRecyclage de plaine {1} ({1}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.)", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617620&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d92745c6-5e5c-43d2-aaeb-4f56cde940ad\', \'multiverseId\': 617620}, \'multiverseid\': 617620}, {\'name\': \'Aquile del Nord\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando le Aquile del Nord entrano nel campo di battaglia, le creature che controlli prendono +1/+0 e hanno attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\\nCiclopianura {1} ({1}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e482dd6e-228f-4312-9b41-c5c1870f66f6\', \'multiverseId\': 617881}, \'multiverseid\': 617881}, {\'name\': \'北方の大鷲\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n北方の大鷲が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受け先制攻撃を得る。\\n平地サイクリング {1} ({1}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5147272-72c9-46fd-a666-951bfef8c6fb\', \'multiverseId\': 618142}, \'multiverseid\': 618142}, {\'name\': \'Águias do Norte\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Águias do Norte entra no campo de batalha, as criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+0 e ganham iniciativa até o final do turno.\\nReciclar Planície \\\\{1} (\\\\{1}, descarte este card: Procure em seu grimório um card de Planície, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'119bf846-645d-4c82-bfd5-f244f3894560\', \'multiverseId\': 618403}, \'multiverseid\': 618403}, {\'name\': \'北山群鹰\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当北山群鹰进战场时，直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+1/+0且获得先攻异能。\\n循环平原{1}（{1}，弃掉此牌：从你牌库中搜寻一张平原牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe68e58c-178c-465f-a480-1db9528ad0ee\', \'multiverseId\': 618664}, \'multiverseid\': 618664}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anbruch eines neuen Zeitalters\', \'text\': \'Der Anbruch eines neuen Zeitalters kommt für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, mit einer Hoffnungsmarke ins Spiel.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments entfernst du eine Hoffnungsmarke vom Anbruch eines neuen Zeitalters. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte. Falls dann keine Hoffnungsmarken auf dem Anbruch eines neuen Zeitalters liegen, opfere ihn und du erhältst 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617096&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'152ea5e0-ff96-4f28-9b0d-c1f1ee0d57c1\', \'multiverseId\': 617096}, \'multiverseid\': 617096}, {\'name\': \'El albor de una Nueva Edad\', \'text\': \'El albor de una Nueva Edad entra al campo de batalla con un contador de esperanza sobre él por cada criatura que controlas.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, remueve un contador de esperanza de El albor de una Nueva Edad. Si lo haces, roba una carta. Luego, si El albor de una Nueva Edad no tiene contadores de esperanza sobre él, sacrifícalo. Ganas 4 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8694085-147c-4e12-94e2-d8463989f698\', \'multiverseId\': 617357}, \'multiverseid\': 617357}, {\'name\': "Aube d\'un Nouvel Âge", \'text\': "L\'Aube d\'un Nouvel Âge arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « espoir » sur elle pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, retirez un marqueur « espoir » de l\'Aube d\'un Nouvel Âge. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte. Puis, si l\'Aube d\'un Nouvel Âge n\'a aucun marqueur « espoir » sur elle, sacrifiez-la et vous gagnez 4 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617618&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbc4680f-a0c4-489c-bae6-ca11c91926ab\', \'multiverseId\': 617618}, \'multiverseid\': 617618}, {\'name\': \'Alba di una Nuova Era\', \'text\': "L\'Alba di una Nuova Era entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino speranza per ogni creatura che controlli.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, rimuovi un segnalino speranza dall\'Alba di una Nuova Era. Se lo fai, peschi una carta. Poi, se l\'Alba di una Nuova Era non ha segnalini speranza, sacrificala e guadagni 4 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33ab2a1a-0627-4b66-8ace-004dce2fa346\', \'multiverseId\': 617879}, \'multiverseid\': 617879}, {\'name\': \'新たなる紀の始まり\', \'text\': \'新たなる紀の始まりは、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき１個の希望カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、新たなる紀の始まりの上から希望カウンター１個を取り除く。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。その後、新たなる紀の始まりの上に希望カウンターがないなら、これを生け贄に捧げ、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9bf2c81-243e-4cae-970d-17b0801bfe0c\', \'multiverseId\': 618140}, \'multiverseid\': 618140}, {\'name\': \'Alvorecer de Uma Nova Era\', \'text\': \'Alvorecer de Uma Nova Era entra no campo de batalha com um marcador de esperança para cada criatura que você controla.\\nNo início de sua etapa final, remova um marcador de esperança de Alvorecer de Uma Nova Era. Se fizer isso, compre um card. Em seguida, se Alvorecer de Uma Nova Era não tiver mais marcadores de esperança, sacrifique-o e você ganha 4 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'891c4393-b954-4a15-9aeb-4c5be9cb0e41\', \'multiverseId\': 618401}, \'multiverseid\': 618401}, {\'name\': \'新纪元的曙光\', \'text\': \'新纪元的曙光进战场时上面有数个希望指示物，其数量等同于由你操控的生物数量。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，从新纪元的曙光上移去一个希望指示物。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。然后如果新纪元的曙光上没有希望指示物，则将它牺牲且你获得4点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73a7cf8b-f469-484d-8d7b-a4ea9da64dcc\', \'multiverseId\': 618662}, \'multiverseid\': 618662}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anbruch eines neuen Zeitalters\', \'text\': \'Der Anbruch eines neuen Zeitalters kommt für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, mit einer Hoffnungsmarke ins Spiel.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments entfernst du eine Hoffnungsmarke vom Anbruch eines neuen Zeitalters. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte. Falls dann keine Hoffnungsmarken auf dem Anbruch eines neuen Zeitalters liegen, opfere ihn und du erhältst 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619193&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'218f66c8-a115-4f1e-b4b9-553940e5df7c\', \'multiverseId\': 619193}, \'multiverseid\': 619193}, {\'name\': "Aube d\'un Nouvel Âge", \'text\': "L\'Aube d\'un Nouvel Âge arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « espoir » sur elle pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, retirez un marqueur « espoir » de l\'Aube d\'un Nouvel Âge. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte. Puis, si l\'Aube d\'un Nouvel Âge n\'a aucun marqueur « espoir » sur elle, sacrifiez-la et vous gagnez 4 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619230&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59882b0e-37f9-4e95-af5a-10a06aebd2f7\', \'multiverseId\': 619230}, \'multiverseid\': 619230}, {\'name\': \'新たなる紀の始まり\', \'text\': \'新たなる紀の始まりは、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき１個の希望カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、新たなる紀の始まりの上から希望カウンター１個を取り除く。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。その後、新たなる紀の始まりの上に希望カウンターがないなら、これを生け贄に捧げ、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9d895f4-682f-431b-b986-ad02d23c6df6\', \'multiverseId\': 619267}, \'multiverseid\': 619267}, {\'name\': \'新纪元的曙光\', \'text\': \'新纪元的曙光进战场时上面有数个希望指示物，其数量等同于由你操控的生物数量。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，从新纪元的曙光上移去一个希望指示物。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。然后如果新纪元的曙光上没有希望指示物，则将它牺牲且你获得4点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fd797e4-a958-405c-8c7e-ad9b9b292464\', \'multiverseId\': 619304}, \'multiverseid\': 619304}]', '[{\'name\': \'Andúril, Flamme des Westens\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+1.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, erzeuge zwei getappte 1/1 weiße Geist-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit. Falls jene Kreatur legendär ist, erzeuge stattdessen zwei getappte und angreifende solcher Spielsteine.\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617327&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdc345ec-3b03-4a77-a34c-8f49502db4ab\', \'multiverseId\': 617327}, \'multiverseid\': 617327}, {\'name\': \'Andúril, Llama del Oeste\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+1.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada ataque, crea dos fichas de criatura Espíritu blancas 1/1 giradas con la habilidad de volar. Si esa criatura es legendaria, en vez de eso, crea dos de esas fichas que están giradas y atacando.\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d028d01-9dab-4e60-830c-841a8ddbd3a5\', \'multiverseId\': 617588}, \'multiverseid\': 617588}, {\'name\': "Andúril, Flamme de L\'Ouest", \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +3/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, créez, engagés, deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol. Si cette créature est légendaire, à la place créez deux de ces jetons, engagés et attaquants.\\nÉquipement {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617849&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64a93c60-a756-4ad9-95eb-6a02270ca242\', \'multiverseId\': 617849}, \'multiverseid\': 617849}, {\'name\': "Andúril, Fiamma dell\'Ovest", \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +3/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, crea due pedine creatura Spirito 1/1 bianche con volare TAPpate. Se quella creatura è leggendaria, crea invece due di quelle pedine TAPpate e attaccanti.\\nEquipaggiare {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70b5e9e0-a9ab-4ec0-9b18-3b0ad22f2a87\', \'multiverseId\': 618110}, \'multiverseid\': 618110}, {\'name\': \'西方の焰、アンドゥーリル\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン２体をタップ状態で生成する。そのクリーチャーが伝説であるなら、代わりにそれらのトークンをタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。\\n装備{2}\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'219c87b9-2668-42a6-8880-65cedcef24d0\', \'multiverseId\': 618371}, \'multiverseid\': 618371}, {\'name\': \'Andúril, Chama do Oeste\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +3/+1.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada atacar, crie duas fichas de criatura Espírito branca 1/1 viradas com voar. Se aquela criatura for lendária, em vez disso, crie duas daquelas fichas viradas e atacando.\\nEquipar {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a42f2a4a-48d7-4c2e-8b99-3073b2bf8f91\', \'multiverseId\': 618632}, \'multiverseid\': 618632}, {\'name\': \'西方之焰安督利尔\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+3/+1。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，派出两个已横置的1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。若该生物是传奇，则改为派出两个已横置且正进行攻击的上述衍生物。\\n佩带{2}\', \'type\': \'传奇神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17ab63b7-f6e2-490d-b328-f46d75ae6430\', \'multiverseId\': 618893}, \'multiverseid\': 618893}]', '[{\'name\': \'Andúril, Flamme des Westens\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+1.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, erzeuge zwei getappte 1/1 weiße Geist-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit. Falls jene Kreatur legendär ist, erzeuge stattdessen zwei getappte und angreifende solcher Spielsteine.\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619221&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63c75bf1-9e8b-4857-b711-721d79eb0141\', \'multiverseId\': 619221}, \'multiverseid\': 619221}, {\'name\': "Andúril, Flamme de L\'Ouest", \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +3/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, créez, engagés, deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol. Si cette créature est légendaire, à la place créez deux de ces jetons, engagés et attaquants.\\nÉquipement {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619258&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ced76ccf-0f4a-4f7f-a3cd-2a454d99c0eb\', \'multiverseId\': 619258}, \'multiverseid\': 619258}, {\'name\': \'西方の焰、アンドゥーリル\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン２体をタップ状態で生成する。そのクリーチャーが伝説であるなら、代わりにそれらのトークンをタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。\\n装備{2}\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dda7961-42f5-47b8-83e4-b27f40038ff7\', \'multiverseId\': 619295}, \'multiverseid\': 619295}, {\'name\': \'西方之焰安督利尔\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+3/+1。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，派出两个已横置的1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。若该生物是传奇，则改为派出两个已横置且正进行攻击的上述衍生物。\\n佩带{2}\', \'type\': \'传奇神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c31f9134-d40d-4773-9d85-b19217379137\', \'multiverseId\': 619332}, \'multiverseid\': 619332}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angriff auf Osgiliath\', \'text\': \'Ork-Aufmarsch X, dann erhalten Goblins und Orks, die du kontrollierst, Doppelschlag und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Um Ork-Aufmarsch X anzuwenden, lege X +1/+1-Marken auf eine Armee, die du kontrollierst. Sie ist auch ein Ork. Falls du keine Armee kontrollierst, erzeuge zuerst einen 0/0 schwarzen Ork-Armee-Kreaturenspielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620045&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47c9b0aa-50bd-4843-ac2d-445acf0b264b\', \'multiverseId\': 620045}, \'multiverseid\': 620045}, {\'name\': \'Asalto a Osgiliath\', \'text\': \'Enrola X Orcos, luego los Trasgos y Orcos que controlas ganan las habilidades de dañar dos veces y prisa hasta el final del turno. (Para enrolar X Orcos, pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre un Ejército que controlas. También es un Orco. Si no controlas un Ejército, crea primero una ficha de criatura Ejército Orco negra 0/0.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6899c4ba-f948-414f-9e37-fe4314ab4867\', \'multiverseId\': 620050}, \'multiverseid\': 620050}, {\'name\': \'Assaut sur Osgiliath\', \'text\': "Amassez des orques X, puis les gobelins et les orques que vous contrôlez acquièrent la double initiative et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Pour amasser des orques X, mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur une armée que vous contrôlez. C\'est aussi un orque. Si vous ne contrôlez pas d\'armée, créez d\'abord un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Orque et Armée.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620055&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4db6fa1e-01dd-4196-9674-ad6773c044cb\', \'multiverseId\': 620055}, \'multiverseid\': 620055}, {\'name\': \'Assalto a Osgiliath\', \'text\': \'Recluta X Orchi, poi i Goblin e gli Orchi che controlli hanno doppio attacco e rapidità fino alla fine del turno. (Per reclutare X Orchi, metti X segnalini +1/+1 su un Esercito che controlli. È anche un Orco. Se non controlli un Esercito, crea prima una pedina creatura Esercito Orco 0/0 nera.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90811302-9cc5-4019-9c73-ad2e9a0393e8\', \'multiverseId\': 620060}, \'multiverseid\': 620060}, {\'name\': \'オスギリアスへの猛攻\', \'text\': \'オーク動員Ｘを行う。ターン終了時まで、オークやゴブリンのうちあなたがコントロールしているすべては二段攻撃と速攻を得る。（オーク動員Ｘを行うとは、あなたがコントロールしている軍団１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。それはオークでもある。あなたが軍団をコントロールしていないなら、その前に、黒の０/０のオーク・軍団・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'357e8db5-8e5d-471d-ae85-38eeaca31819\', \'multiverseId\': 620065}, \'multiverseid\': 620065}, {\'name\': \'Ataque a Osgiliath\', \'text\': \'Arregimente Orcs X e, depois, os Goblins e Orcs que você controla ganham golpe duplo e ímpeto até o final do turno. (Para arregimentar Orcs X, coloque X marcadores +1/+1 em um Exército que você controla. Ele também é um Orc. Se você não controlar um Exército, crie antes uma ficha de criatura Orc Exército preta 0/0.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e3c85bb-6450-4f47-b60c-437108315be8\', \'multiverseId\': 620070}, \'multiverseid\': 620070}, {\'name\': \'突袭欧斯吉利亚斯\', \'text\': \'囤兵半兽人X，然后由你操控的鬼怪和半兽人获得连击与敏捷异能直到回合结束。（囤兵半兽人X的流程是，在一个由你操控的军队上放置X个+1/+1指示物。它也是半兽人。如果你未操控军队，则先派出一个0/0黑色半兽人／军队衍生生物。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fd50c9e-c599-4f93-ac2a-673599abf877\', \'multiverseId\': 620075}, \'multiverseid\': 620075}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angriff auf Osgiliath\', \'text\': \'Ork-Aufmarsch X, dann erhalten Goblins und Orks, die du kontrollierst, Doppelschlag und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620085&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e45a623e-e525-43d6-9ca8-5e2a5660002a\', \'multiverseId\': 620085}, \'multiverseid\': 620085}, {\'name\': \'Assaut sur Osgiliath\', \'text\': "Amassez des orques X, puis les gobelins et les orques que vous contrôlez acquièrent la double initiative et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620090&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'690414cd-27cd-4f52-8035-72d5ebc6a020\', \'multiverseId\': 620090}, \'multiverseid\': 620090}, {\'name\': \'オスギリアスへの猛攻\', \'text\': \'オーク動員Ｘを行う。ターン終了時まで、オークやゴブリンのうちあなたがコントロールしているすべては二段攻撃と速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92c2ae13-002b-46a8-b59e-a9a405e425e2\', \'multiverseId\': 620095}, \'multiverseid\': 620095}, {\'name\': \'突袭欧斯吉利亚斯\', \'text\': \'囤兵半兽人X，然后由你操控的鬼怪和半兽人获得连击与敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74dd3f31-7e3a-4716-b171-2555d0d7d818\', \'multiverseId\': 620100}, \'multiverseid\': 620100}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aragorn der Einiger\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen weißen Zauberspruch wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nImmer wenn du einen blauen Zauberspruch wirkst, wende Hellsicht 2 an.\\nImmer wenn du einen roten Zauberspruch wirkst, fügt Aragorn der Einiger einem Gegner deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nImmer wenn du einen grünen Zauberspruch wirkst, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +4/+4 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617283&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'879b84e6-1cc8-4bd8-ab81-e021b62ee7ad\', \'multiverseId\': 617283}, \'multiverseid\': 617283}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, el Unificador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo blanco, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado Humano blanca 1/1.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo azul, adivina 2.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo rojo, Aragorn, el Unificador hace 3 puntos de daño al oponente objetivo.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo verde, la criatura objetivo obtiene +4/+4 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebb02355-30bc-47e0-b12c-db86aaeeb41c\', \'multiverseId\': 617544}, \'multiverseid\': 617544}, {\'name\': "Aragorn, l\'unificateur", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort blanc, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort bleu, regard 2.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort rouge, Aragorn, l\'unificateur inflige 3 blessures à un adversaire ciblé.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort vert, une créature ciblée gagne +4/+4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617805&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea734ffe-34b0-4482-a355-04a689b595a9\', \'multiverseId\': 617805}, \'multiverseid\': 617805}, {\'name\': "Aragorn, l\'Unificatore", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia bianca, crea una pedina creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianca.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia blu, profetizza 2.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia rossa, Aragorn, l\'Unificatore infligge 3 danni a un avversario bersaglio.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia verde, una creatura bersaglio prende +4/+4 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88420047-9a2b-489e-8e55-ec7809ea2984\', \'multiverseId\': 618066}, \'multiverseid\': 618066}, {\'name\': \'統一王、アラゴルン\', \'text\': \'あなたが白の呪文を唱えるたび、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたが青の呪文を唱えるたび、占術２を行う。\\nあなたが赤の呪文を唱えるたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。統一王、アラゴルンはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\nあなたが緑の呪文を唱えるたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋４/＋４の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2476a787-d91a-4e8d-b43d-0a453c80b315\', \'multiverseId\': 618327}, \'multiverseid\': 618327}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, o Unificador\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica branca, crie uma ficha de criatura Humano Soldado branca 1/1.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica azul, use vidência 2.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica vermelha, Aragorn, o Unificador, causa 3 pontos de dano ao oponente alvo.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica verde, a criatura alvo recebe +4/+4 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd7f341f-a1a3-447f-adce-ed7e6b53fcd0\', \'multiverseId\': 618588}, \'multiverseid\': 618588}, {\'name\': \'重联君王阿拉贡\', \'text\': \'每当你施放白色咒语时，派出一个1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物。\\n每当你施放蓝色咒语时，占卜2。\\n每当你施放红色咒语时，重联君王阿拉贡向目标对手造成3点伤害。\\n每当你施放绿色咒语时，目标生物得+4/+4直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'434d95da-97d8-4a49-b76a-242d15b4a8c7\', \'multiverseId\': 618849}, \'multiverseid\': 618849}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aragorn der Einiger\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen weißen Zauberspruch wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nImmer wenn du einen blauen Zauberspruch wirkst, wende Hellsicht 2 an.\\nImmer wenn du einen roten Zauberspruch wirkst, fügt Aragorn der Einiger einem Gegner deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nImmer wenn du einen grünen Zauberspruch wirkst, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +4/+4 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619497&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3769c0cd-4fd9-4a5a-a74c-e27d11900d63\', \'multiverseId\': 619497}, \'multiverseid\': 619497}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, el Unificador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo blanco, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado Humano blanca 1/1.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo azul, adivina 2.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo rojo, Aragorn, el Unificador hace 3 puntos de daño al oponente objetivo.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo verde, la criatura objetivo obtiene +4/+4 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28f4b10a-6ce2-4205-bd2b-4926c2d9ba13\', \'multiverseId\': 619527}, \'multiverseid\': 619527}, {\'name\': "Aragorn, l\'unificateur", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort blanc, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort bleu, regard 2.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort rouge, Aragorn, l\'unificateur inflige 3 blessures à un adversaire ciblé.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort vert, une créature ciblée gagne +4/+4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619557&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cec34f4f-3714-4994-852e-681291a2718f\', \'multiverseId\': 619557}, \'multiverseid\': 619557}, {\'name\': "Aragorn, l\'Unificatore", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia bianca, crea una pedina creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianca.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia blu, profetizza 2.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia rossa, Aragorn, l\'Unificatore infligge 3 danni a un avversario bersaglio.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia verde, una creatura bersaglio prende +4/+4 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5fb0cd0-c3b3-4729-92b5-2fbbaf151778\', \'multiverseId\': 619587}, \'multiverseid\': 619587}, {\'name\': \'統一王、アラゴルン\', \'text\': \'あなたが白の呪文を唱えるたび、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたが青の呪文を唱えるたび、占術２を行う。\\nあなたが赤の呪文を唱えるたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。統一王、アラゴルンはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\nあなたが緑の呪文を唱えるたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋４/＋４の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'803bf162-fb88-4ef5-81fa-866b78acf89b\', \'multiverseId\': 619617}, \'multiverseid\': 619617}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, o Unificador\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica branca, crie uma ficha de criatura Humano Soldado branca 1/1.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica azul, use vidência 2.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica vermelha, Aragorn, o Unificador, causa 3 pontos de dano ao oponente alvo.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica verde, a criatura alvo recebe +4/+4 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc6b2fb1-dbea-4bbf-aba9-9d47daf631e9\', \'multiverseId\': 619647}, \'multiverseid\': 619647}, {\'name\': \'重联君王阿拉贡\', \'text\': \'每当你施放白色咒语时，派出一个1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物。\\n每当你施放蓝色咒语时，占卜2。\\n每当你施放红色咒语时，重联君王阿拉贡向目标对手造成3点伤害。\\n每当你施放绿色咒语时，目标生物得+4/+4直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04b0aa75-7107-43c8-9af4-edb1b406b9c0\', \'multiverseId\': 619677}, \'multiverseid\': 619677}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aragorn der Einiger\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen weißen Zauberspruch wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nImmer wenn du einen blauen Zauberspruch wirkst, wende Hellsicht 2 an.\\nImmer wenn du einen roten Zauberspruch wirkst, fügt Aragorn der Einiger einem Gegner deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nImmer wenn du einen grünen Zauberspruch wirkst, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +4/+4 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619764&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9cd5f49-475e-4366-b4d0-dbec23998e4a\', \'multiverseId\': 619764}, \'multiverseid\': 619764}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, el Unificador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo blanco, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado Humano blanca 1/1.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo azul, adivina 2.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo rojo, Aragorn, el Unificador hace 3 puntos de daño al oponente objetivo.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo verde, la criatura objetivo obtiene +4/+4 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad8682fc-df54-49cf-856b-3e6683208c7c\', \'multiverseId\': 619807}, \'multiverseid\': 619807}, {\'name\': "Aragorn, l\'unificateur", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort blanc, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort bleu, regard 2.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort rouge, Aragorn, l\'unificateur inflige 3 blessures à un adversaire ciblé.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort vert, une créature ciblée gagne +4/+4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619850&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5158373-110e-4aae-947b-31ff97d30abb\', \'multiverseId\': 619850}, \'multiverseid\': 619850}, {\'name\': "Aragorn, l\'Unificatore", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia bianca, crea una pedina creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianca.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia blu, profetizza 2.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia rossa, Aragorn, l\'Unificatore infligge 3 danni a un avversario bersaglio.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia verde, una creatura bersaglio prende +4/+4 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d735b50-195d-455b-85b9-dd37d56dd30f\', \'multiverseId\': 619893}, \'multiverseid\': 619893}, {\'name\': \'統一王、アラゴルン\', \'text\': \'あなたが白の呪文を唱えるたび、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたが青の呪文を唱えるたび、占術２を行う。\\nあなたが赤の呪文を唱えるたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。統一王、アラゴルンはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\nあなたが緑の呪文を唱えるたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋４/＋４の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f25fa6f3-bb24-4a99-aba7-0a9485211758\', \'multiverseId\': 619936}, \'multiverseid\': 619936}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, o Unificador\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica branca, crie uma ficha de criatura Humano Soldado branca 1/1.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica azul, use vidência 2.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica vermelha, Aragorn, o Unificador, causa 3 pontos de dano ao oponente alvo.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica verde, a criatura alvo recebe +4/+4 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'265cfec2-79ce-4e80-b446-1f478c78ae47\', \'multiverseId\': 619979}, \'multiverseid\': 619979}, {\'name\': \'重联君王阿拉贡\', \'text\': \'每当你施放白色咒语时，派出一个1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物。\\n每当你施放蓝色咒语时，占卜2。\\n每当你施放红色咒语时，重联君王阿拉贡向目标对手造成3点伤害。\\n每当你施放绿色咒语时，目标生物得+4/+4直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52864b55-4375-475f-9bbf-1aef728a72f9\', \'multiverseId\': 620022}, \'multiverseid\': 620022}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aragorn und Arwen, das Brautpaar\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn Aragorn und Arwen, das Brautpaar, ins Spiel kommen oder angreifen, lege auf jede andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke. Du erhältst für jede andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'Aragorn, der König Elessar, heiratete Arwen Undómiel, und so erfüllte sich die Geschichte von ihrem langen Warten und ihrer großen Mühsal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620214&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbaedc41-0c8e-4260-b4c3-619ed04c794c\', \'multiverseId\': 620214}, \'multiverseid\': 620214}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn et Arwen, époux\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Aragorn et Arwen, époux arrivent sur le champ de bataille ou attaquent, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque autre créature que vous contrôlez. Vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque autre créature que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': "Aragorn, Roi Elessar, épousa Arwen Undómiel, et le récit de leur longue attente et de leurs épreuves s\'acheva.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620224&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'945bc9a5-ca83-4887-a8f2-75305422ef7a\', \'multiverseId\': 620224}, \'multiverseid\': 620224}, {\'name\': \'契り結びし、アラゴルンとアルウェン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n契り結びし、アラゴルンとアルウェンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでない各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。あなたは、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体につき１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'エレスサール王アラゴルンとアルウェン・ウンドーミエルは婚礼の式を挙げ、二人の長い渇望と辛苦の物語はここに完結した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f62b953-1952-43b3-8301-d88c302431a6\', \'multiverseId\': 620234}, \'multiverseid\': 620234}, {\'name\': \'新婚燕尔阿拉贡与阿尔玟\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n每当新婚燕尔阿拉贡与阿尔玟进战场或攻击时，在每个由你操控的其他生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。你每操控一个其他生物，便获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'埃莱萨王阿拉贡与阿尔玟·乌多米尔成婚，他们漫长等待与历经艰辛的故事终于有了圆满结局。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'342bf754-e83b-4a93-957b-40523dcd8ee0\', \'multiverseId\': 620244}, \'multiverseid\': 620244}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aragorn und Arwen, das Brautpaar\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn Aragorn und Arwen, das Brautpaar, ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, lege auf jede andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke. Du erhältst für jede andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'Aragorn, der König Elessar, heiratete Arwen Undómiel, und so erfüllte sich die Geschichte von ihrem langen Warten und ihrer großen Mühsal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620184&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5e8653d-7cd4-4e68-82df-fa4f326fea4b\', \'multiverseId\': 620184}, \'multiverseid\': 620184}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn y Arwen, desposados\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nSiempre que Aragorn y Arwen, desposados entren al campo de batalla o ataquen, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada otra criatura que controlas. Ganas 1 vida por cada otra criatura que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble elfo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Aragorn, Rey Elessar, desposó a Arwen Undómiel, y la historia de su larga espera y esfuerzo culminó al fin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a356ae00-a2ef-4a03-bf17-9cd26a12d488\', \'multiverseId\': 620186}, \'multiverseid\': 620186}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn et Arwen, époux\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Aragorn et Arwen, époux arrivent sur le champ de bataille ou attaquent, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque autre créature que vous contrôlez. Vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque autre créature que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': "Aragorn, Roi Elessar, épousa Arwen Undómiel, et le récit de leur longue attente et de leurs épreuves s\'acheva.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620188&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76d87f6d-a5c1-4ad0-9fc1-845f77698ccc\', \'multiverseId\': 620188}, \'multiverseid\': 620188}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn e Arwen, Sposi\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nOgniqualvolta Aragorn e Arwen, Sposi entrano nel campo di battaglia o attaccano, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni altra creatura che controlli. Guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni altra creatura che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Elfo Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Quando Aragorn, il Re Elessar, sposò Arwen Undómiel, la storia della loro attesa e delle loro fatiche giunse infine a compimento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69d0ae2e-59cb-49eb-a961-cb8b17200376\', \'multiverseId\': 620190}, \'multiverseid\': 620190}, {\'name\': \'契り結びし、アラゴルンとアルウェン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n契り結びし、アラゴルンとアルウェンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでない各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。あなたは、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体につき１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'エレスサール王アラゴルンとアルウェン・ウンドーミエルは婚礼の式を挙げ、二人の長い渇望と辛苦の物語はここに完結した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a43507d0-cca8-4427-a7ce-7ec1274164d6\', \'multiverseId\': 620192}, \'multiverseid\': 620192}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn e Arwen, Casados\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nToda vez que Aragorn e Arwen, Casados, entrar no campo de batalha ou atacar, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada outra criatura que você controla. Você ganha 1 ponto de vida para cada outra criatura que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Elfo Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'Aragorn, o Rei Elessar, casou-se com Arwen Undómiel, e a história de sua longa e laboriosa espera chegou ao fim.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93239a9b-9c46-47fb-b8d8-7bc92dcd276b\', \'multiverseId\': 620194}, \'multiverseid\': 620194}, {\'name\': \'新婚燕尔阿拉贡与阿尔玟\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n每当新婚燕尔阿拉贡与阿尔玟进战场或攻击时，在每个由你操控的其他生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。你每操控一个其他生物，便获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'埃莱萨王阿拉贡与阿尔玟·乌多米尔成婚，他们漫长等待与历经艰辛的故事终于有了圆满结局。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25d2c2f0-2d51-45a0-9183-21dd89babc39\', \'multiverseId\': 620196}, \'multiverseid\': 620196}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aragorn, Anführer der Gefährten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Ring dich in Versuchung führt und falls du eine andere Kreatur als Aragorn, Anführer der Gefährten, als deinen Ringträger bestimmt hast, lege eine Erstschlag-, Wachsamkeit-, Todesberührung- oder Lebensverknüpfung-Marke auf Aragorn (du entscheidest).\\nImmer wenn du eine oder mehrere Marken auf Aragorn legst, lege je eine solcher Marken auf bis zu eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Waldläufer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617282&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'402321fa-631f-4c17-ac83-f6af42b392e5\', \'multiverseId\': 617282}, \'multiverseid\': 617282}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, líder de la compañía\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Anillo te tiente, si eliges una criatura que no sea Aragorn, líder de la compañía como tu portador del Anillo, pon sobre Aragorn el contador que elijas: de dañar primero, de vigilancia, de toque mortal o de vínculo vital.\\nSiempre que pongas uno o más contadores sobre Aragorn, pon un contador de cada uno de esos tipos sobre hasta una otra criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guardabosque humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af920b9b-0447-4201-8fa3-b869a55b893b\', \'multiverseId\': 617543}, \'multiverseid\': 617543}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, chef de la compagnie\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Anneau vous tente, si vous choisissez une créature autre qu\'Aragorn, chef de la compagnie comme porteur de l\'Anneau, mettez sur Aragorn un marqueur de votre choix parmi « initiative », « vigilance », « contact mortel » et « lien de vie ».\\nÀ chaque fois que vous mettez au moins un marqueur sur Aragorn, mettez un marqueur de chacune de ces sortes sur jusqu\'à une autre créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et ranger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617804&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f423a56e-107e-4de8-a07d-b714c343ad8a\', \'multiverseId\': 617804}, \'multiverseid\': 617804}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, Capo della Compagnia\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta l\'Anello ti tenta, se hai scelto una creatura diversa da Aragorn, Capo della Compagnia come tuo Portatore dell\'Anello, metti su Aragorn un segnalino a tua scelta tra attacco improvviso, cautela, tocco letale e legame vitale.\\nOgniqualvolta metti uno o più segnalini su Aragorn, scegli fino a un\'altra creatura bersaglio. Metti uno di ognuno di quei tipi di segnalini su quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Ranger Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2016ec8f-b38c-491a-a52c-8620b594471e\', \'multiverseId\': 618065}, \'multiverseid\': 618065}, {\'name\': \'一行のリーダー、アラゴルン\', \'text\': \'指輪があなたを誘惑するたび、あなたが一行のリーダー、アラゴルンでないクリーチャーをあなたの指輪所持者に選んだ場合、先制攻撃や警戒や接死や絆魂のうちあなたが選んだカウンター１個を一行のリーダー、アラゴルンの上に置く。\\nあなたが一行のリーダー、アラゴルンの上に１個以上のカウンターを置くたび、これでないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それの上に、それらの各種類のカウンターのうち１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・レインジャー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c26fddf1-6e94-4d44-8ecf-19cd7836db80\', \'multiverseId\': 618326}, \'multiverseid\': 618326}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, Líder da Sociedade\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que o Anel tentar você, se você escolher uma criatura que não seja Aragorn, Líder da Sociedade, como seu Guardião do Anel, coloque um marcador de iniciativa, vigilância, toque mortífero ou vínculo com a vida, à sua escolha, em Aragorn.\\nToda vez que você colocar um ou mais marcadores em Aragorn, coloque um de cada um daqueles tipos de marcadores em até uma outra criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Guardião\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7215e23-16bc-4bbc-954e-43fbeaef1441\', \'multiverseId\': 618587}, \'multiverseid\': 618587}, {\'name\': \'远征队长阿拉贡\', \'text\': \'每当魔戒引诱你时，若你选择远征队长阿拉贡以外的生物作你的持戒人，则在阿拉贡上依你的选择放置一个先攻，警戒，死触或系命指示物。\\n每当你在阿拉贡上放置一个或数个指示物时，选择至多另一个目标生物。将所放置的指示物每种各在该生物上放置一个。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／游侠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06d8f38c-49fc-4d40-8bc9-8fd65c028ae6\', \'multiverseId\': 618848}, \'multiverseid\': 618848}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aragorn, Anführer der Gefährten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Ring dich in Versuchung führt und falls du eine andere Kreatur als Aragorn, Anführer der Gefährten, als deinen Ringträger bestimmt hast, lege eine Erstschlag-, Wachsamkeit-, Todesberührung- oder Lebensverknüpfung-Marke auf Aragorn (du entscheidest).\\nImmer wenn du eine oder mehrere Marken auf Aragorn legst, lege je eine solcher Marken auf bis zu eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Waldläufer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619496&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7d1e929-ba46-4845-a1ee-31b1e2520e38\', \'multiverseId\': 619496}, \'multiverseid\': 619496}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, líder de la compañía\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Anillo te tiente, si eliges una criatura que no sea Aragorn, líder de la compañía como tu portador del Anillo, pon sobre Aragorn el contador que elijas: de dañar primero, de vigilancia, de toque mortal o de vínculo vital.\\nSiempre que pongas uno o más contadores sobre Aragorn, pon un contador de cada uno de esos tipos sobre hasta una otra criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guardabosque humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2ced8ad-79af-4a61-afde-a471e3610170\', \'multiverseId\': 619526}, \'multiverseid\': 619526}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, chef de la compagnie\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Anneau vous tente, si vous choisissez une créature autre qu\'Aragorn, chef de la compagnie comme porteur de l\'Anneau, mettez sur Aragorn un marqueur de votre choix parmi « initiative », « vigilance », « contact mortel » et « lien de vie ».\\nÀ chaque fois que vous mettez au moins un marqueur sur Aragorn, mettez un marqueur de chacune de ces sortes sur jusqu\'à une autre créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et ranger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619556&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b32331e7-b8c6-4d6b-8f80-91a30c7fe773\', \'multiverseId\': 619556}, \'multiverseid\': 619556}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, Capo della Compagnia\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta l\'Anello ti tenta, se hai scelto una creatura diversa da Aragorn, Capo della Compagnia come tuo Portatore dell\'Anello, metti su Aragorn un segnalino a tua scelta tra attacco improvviso, cautela, tocco letale e legame vitale.\\nOgniqualvolta metti uno o più segnalini su Aragorn, scegli fino a un\'altra creatura bersaglio. Metti uno di ognuno di quei tipi di segnalini su quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Ranger Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'150cb538-bf32-427e-9457-f72d5a75143c\', \'multiverseId\': 619586}, \'multiverseid\': 619586}, {\'name\': \'一行のリーダー、アラゴルン\', \'text\': \'指輪があなたを誘惑するたび、あなたが一行のリーダー、アラゴルンでないクリーチャーをあなたの指輪所持者に選んだ場合、先制攻撃や警戒や接死や絆魂のうちあなたが選んだカウンター１個を一行のリーダー、アラゴルンの上に置く。\\nあなたが一行のリーダー、アラゴルンの上に１個以上のカウンターを置くたび、これでないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それの上に、それらの各種類のカウンターのうち１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・レインジャー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75edfb94-4e32-4200-95b4-8e1946bb5bf7\', \'multiverseId\': 619616}, \'multiverseid\': 619616}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, Líder da Sociedade\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que o Anel tentar você, se você escolher uma criatura que não seja Aragorn, Líder da Sociedade, como seu Guardião do Anel, coloque um marcador de iniciativa, vigilância, toque mortífero ou vínculo com a vida, à sua escolha, em Aragorn.\\nToda vez que você colocar um ou mais marcadores em Aragorn, coloque um de cada um daqueles tipos de marcadores em até uma outra criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Guardião\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bca2ac4-5087-4d71-bcce-cd73038fa507\', \'multiverseId\': 619646}, \'multiverseid\': 619646}, {\'name\': \'远征队长阿拉贡\', \'text\': \'每当魔戒引诱你时，若你选择远征队长阿拉贡以外的生物作你的持戒人，则在阿拉贡上依你的选择放置一个先攻，警戒，死触或系命指示物。\\n每当你在阿拉贡上放置一个或数个指示物时，选择至多另一个目标生物。将所放置的指示物每种各在该生物上放置一个。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／游侠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5da0195-5074-4c72-a979-d5d501e728c4\', \'multiverseId\': 619676}, \'multiverseid\': 619676}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aragorn, Anführer der Gefährten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Ring dich in Versuchung führt und falls du eine andere Kreatur als Aragorn, Anführer der Gefährten, als deinen Ringträger bestimmt hast, lege eine Erstschlag-, Wachsamkeit-, Todesberührung- oder Lebensverknüpfung-Marke auf Aragorn (du entscheidest).\\nImmer wenn du eine oder mehrere Marken auf Aragorn legst, lege je eine solcher Marken auf bis zu eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Waldläufer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619740&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f5a978a-39f9-47a4-b967-6f513d9f43a9\', \'multiverseId\': 619740}, \'multiverseid\': 619740}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, líder de la compañía\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Anillo te tiente, si eliges una criatura que no sea Aragorn, líder de la compañía como tu portador del Anillo, pon sobre Aragorn el contador que elijas: de dañar primero, de vigilancia, de toque mortal o de vínculo vital.\\nSiempre que pongas uno o más contadores sobre Aragorn, pon un contador de cada uno de esos tipos sobre hasta una otra criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guardabosque humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60135eec-79dc-4983-a2aa-c6948a00f745\', \'multiverseId\': 619783}, \'multiverseid\': 619783}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, chef de la compagnie\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Anneau vous tente, si vous choisissez une créature autre qu\'Aragorn, chef de la compagnie comme porteur de l\'Anneau, mettez sur Aragorn un marqueur de votre choix parmi « initiative », « vigilance », « contact mortel » et « lien de vie ».\\nÀ chaque fois que vous mettez au moins un marqueur sur Aragorn, mettez un marqueur de chacune de ces sortes sur jusqu\'à une autre créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et ranger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619826&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b450cd7-29f4-4805-9208-5fc5bbc13b13\', \'multiverseId\': 619826}, \'multiverseid\': 619826}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, Capo della Compagnia\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta l\'Anello ti tenta, se hai scelto una creatura diversa da Aragorn, Capo della Compagnia come tuo Portatore dell\'Anello, metti su Aragorn un segnalino a tua scelta tra attacco improvviso, cautela, tocco letale e legame vitale.\\nOgniqualvolta metti uno o più segnalini su Aragorn, scegli fino a un\'altra creatura bersaglio. Metti uno di ognuno di quei tipi di segnalini su quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Ranger Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c4d5015-c289-4d0a-9efd-25ab293bb043\', \'multiverseId\': 619869}, \'multiverseid\': 619869}, {\'name\': \'一行のリーダー、アラゴルン\', \'text\': \'指輪があなたを誘惑するたび、あなたが一行のリーダー、アラゴルンでないクリーチャーをあなたの指輪所持者に選んだ場合、先制攻撃や警戒や接死や絆魂のうちあなたが選んだカウンター１個を一行のリーダー、アラゴルンの上に置く。\\nあなたが一行のリーダー、アラゴルンの上に１個以上のカウンターを置くたび、これでないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それの上に、それらの各種類のカウンターのうち１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・レインジャー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'806d7f48-095e-4b44-a7f9-ac9b1d00db8b\', \'multiverseId\': 619912}, \'multiverseid\': 619912}, {\'name\': \'Aragorn, Líder da Sociedade\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que o Anel tentar você, se você escolher uma criatura que não seja Aragorn, Líder da Sociedade, como seu Guardião do Anel, coloque um marcador de iniciativa, vigilância, toque mortífero ou vínculo com a vida, à sua escolha, em Aragorn.\\nToda vez que você colocar um ou mais marcadores em Aragorn, coloque um de cada um daqueles tipos de marcadores em até uma outra criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Guardião\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b713be7-f53a-46d7-9be4-51b90f27dee0\', \'multiverseId\': 619955}, \'multiverseid\': 619955}, {\'name\': \'远征队长阿拉贡\', \'text\': \'每当魔戒引诱你时，若你选择远征队长阿拉贡以外的生物作你的持戒人，则在阿拉贡上依你的选择放置一个先攻，警戒，死触或系命指示物。\\n每当你在阿拉贡上放置一个或数个指示物时，选择至多另一个目标生物。将所放置的指示物每种各在该生物上放置一个。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／游侠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52fda001-afaa-4ffd-95b8-4e95308051f1\', \'multiverseId\': 619998}, \'multiverseid\': 619998}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arwen Undómiel\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Hellsicht anwendest, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n{4}{G}{U}: Hellsicht 2.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'Sie trug den Namen Undómiel, denn sie war der Abendstern ihres Volkes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617285&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0bcb3d2-4501-4235-bc8d-47b016b407fc\', \'multiverseId\': 617285}, \'multiverseid\': 617285}, {\'name\': \'Arwen Undómiel\', \'text\': \'Siempre que adivines, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\\n{4}{G}{U}: Adivina 2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble elfo\', \'flavor\': \'La llamaban Undómiel, ya que era la Estrella de la Tarde de su pueblo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ad03075-7d31-4e21-be85-9aa48cfa97a9\', \'multiverseId\': 617546}, \'multiverseid\': 617546}, {\'name\': \'Arwen Undómiel\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous appliquez le regard, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.\\n{4}{G}{U} : Regard 2.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': "Elle s\'appelait Undómiel, car elle était l\'étoile du soir de son peuple.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617807&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e36dcc0b-dd6f-45c7-8c55-100be7ddcd44\', \'multiverseId\': 617807}, \'multiverseid\': 617807}, {\'name\': \'Arwen Undómiel\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta profetizzi, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\\n{4}{G}{U}: Profetizza 2.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Era chiamata Undómiel, poiché era la Stella del Vespro del suo popolo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edf0ff59-1874-463e-ae74-50340fed143c\', \'multiverseId\': 618068}, \'multiverseid\': 618068}, {\'name\': \'アルウェン・ウンドーミエル\', \'text\': \'あなたが占術を行うたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n{4}{G}{U}:：占術２を行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'民から夕星姫と呼ばれたが故に、彼女はウンドーミエルの名を持った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23099d8b-547e-4c23-8dfd-d5b7e5fa3168\', \'multiverseId\': 618329}, \'multiverseid\': 618329}, {\'name\': \'Arwen Undómiel\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você usar vidência, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo.\\n{4}{G}{U}: Vidência 2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'Ela era chamada de Undómiel, pois era a Estrela Vespertina de seu povo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'068a41dc-de90-474a-9c80-61ea3172aa86\', \'multiverseId\': 618590}, \'multiverseid\': 618590}, {\'name\': \'阿尔玟·乌多米尔\', \'text\': \'每当你占卜时，在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{4}{G}{U}：占卜2。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'她又被称为乌多米尔，因她是她族人的暮星。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f0aae5f-cce2-4c42-9aa2-19459cd8a904\', \'multiverseId\': 618851}, \'multiverseid\': 618851}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arwen, sterbliche Königin\', \'text\': \'Arwen, sterbliche Königin, kommt mit einer Unzerstörbar-Marke ins Spiel.\\n{1}, Entferne eine Unzerstörbar-Marke von Arwen: Eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Lege eine +1/+1-Marke und eine Lebensverknüpfung-Marke auf jene Kreatur und eine +1/+1-Marke und eine Lebensverknüpfung-Marke auf Arwen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617284&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f593f937-768c-41fc-acdc-d6b51c4097ae\', \'multiverseId\': 617284}, \'multiverseid\': 617284}, {\'name\': \'Arwen, reina mortal\', \'text\': \'Arwen, reina mortal entra al campo de batalla con un contador de indestructible sobre ella.\\n{1}, remover un contador de indestructible de Arwen: Otra criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. Pon un contador +1/+1 y un contador de vínculo vital sobre esa criatura, y pon un contador +1/+1 y un contador de vínculo vital sobre Arwen.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'735da4e3-a570-4844-bc01-927e005137ed\', \'multiverseId\': 617545}, \'multiverseid\': 617545}, {\'name\': \'Arwen, reine mortelle\', \'text\': "Arwen, reine mortelle arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « indestructible » sur elle.\\n{1}, retirez un marqueur « indestructible » d\'Arwen : Une autre créature ciblée acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 et un marqueur « lien de vie » sur cette créature et un marqueur +1/+1 et un marqueur « lien de vie » sur Arwen.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617806&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1efa288-e1de-47d0-bc5e-f6353c0ed916\', \'multiverseId\': 617806}, \'multiverseid\': 617806}, {\'name\': \'Arwen, Regina Mortale\', \'text\': "Arwen, Regina Mortale entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino indistruttibile.\\n{1}, Rimuovi un segnalino indistruttibile da Arwen: Un\'altra creatura bersaglio ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 e un segnalino legame vitale su quella creatura e un segnalino +1/+1 e un segnalino legame vitale su Arwen.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98c2fefb-b8b4-4b0c-8a65-a07fd4a552b7\', \'multiverseId\': 618067}, \'multiverseid\': 618067}, {\'name\': \'人の子の女王、アルウェン\', \'text\': \'人の子の女王、アルウェンは破壊不能・カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{1}, 人の子の女王、アルウェンの上から破壊不能・カウンター１個を取り除く：これでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。そのクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個と絆魂・カウンター１個を、人の子の女王、アルウェンの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個と絆魂・カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da67b121-f7c3-444a-a7d2-a6064946e933\', \'multiverseId\': 618328}, \'multiverseid\': 618328}, {\'name\': \'Arwen, Rainha Mortal\', \'text\': \'Arwen, Rainha Mortal, entra no campo de batalha com um marcador de indestrutível.\\n{1}, remova um marcador de indestrutível de Arwen: Outra criatura alvo ganha indestrutível até o final do turno. Coloque um marcador +1/+1 e um marcador de vínculo com a vida naquela criatura e um marcador +1/+1 e um marcador de vínculo com a vida em Arwen.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Nobre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ffa8e70-4b91-4a05-9bee-86d829669cde\', \'multiverseId\': 618589}, \'multiverseid\': 618589}, {\'name\': \'归凡皇后阿尔玟\', \'text\': \'归凡皇后阿尔玟进战场时上面有一个不灭指示物。\\n{1}，从阿尔玟上移去一个不灭指示物：另一个目标生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。在该生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物和一个系命指示物，并在阿尔玟上放置一个+1/+1指示物和一个系命指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf19f584-d995-4c2c-8c1b-50dd403878d3\', \'multiverseId\': 618850}, \'multiverseid\': 618850}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arwen, sterbliche Königin\', \'text\': \'Arwen, sterbliche Königin, kommt mit einer Unzerstörbar-Marke ins Spiel.\\n{1}, Entferne eine Unzerstörbar-Marke von Arwen: Eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Lege eine +1/+1-Marke und eine Lebensverknüpfung-Marke auf jene Kreatur und eine +1/+1-Marke und eine Lebensverknüpfung-Marke auf Arwen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619213&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d230be4-8ecd-428f-8020-8297573ba9fa\', \'multiverseId\': 619213}, \'multiverseid\': 619213}, {\'name\': \'Arwen, reine mortelle\', \'text\': "Arwen, reine mortelle arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « indestructible » sur elle.\\n{1}, retirez un marqueur « indestructible » d\'Arwen : Une autre créature ciblée acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 et un marqueur « lien de vie » sur cette créature et un marqueur +1/+1 et un marqueur « lien de vie » sur Arwen.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619250&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5a2ed03-1d8e-4209-b2e0-ad8d1b921cad\', \'multiverseId\': 619250}, \'multiverseid\': 619250}, {\'name\': \'人の子の女王、アルウェン\', \'text\': \'人の子の女王、アルウェンは破壊不能・カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{1}, 人の子の女王、アルウェンの上から破壊不能・カウンター１個を取り除く：これでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。そのクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個と絆魂・カウンター１個を、人の子の女王、アルウェンの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個と絆魂・カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b5ff2b2-cf8c-4ce8-8320-ebf84f5169ec\', \'multiverseId\': 619287}, \'multiverseid\': 619287}, {\'name\': \'归凡皇后阿尔玟\', \'text\': \'归凡皇后阿尔玟进战场时上面有一个不灭指示物。\\n{1}，从阿尔玟上移去一个不灭指示物：另一个目标生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。在该生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物和一个系命指示物，并在阿尔玟上放置一个+1/+1指示物和一个系命指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79c5cc2f-9576-4c0f-8196-ea4d35d6d0bc\', \'multiverseId\': 619324}, \'multiverseid\': 619324}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arwens Gabe\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {1} weniger, falls du zwei oder mehr legendäre Kreaturen kontrollierst.\\nHellsicht 2, ziehe dann zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Trage dies als Erinnerung an Elbenstein und Abendstern, mit denen dein Leben nun auf immer verwoben ist!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617130&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'584c948f-e492-439f-8118-6394254057d0\', \'multiverseId\': 617130}, \'multiverseid\': 617130}, {\'name\': \'Dádiva de Arwen\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo si controlas dos o más criaturas legendarias.\\nAdivina 2, luego roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Lleva esto en recuerdo de Piedra de Elfo y Estrella de la Tarde, que formarán parte de tu vida para siempre".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ded4352-bcf1-4ba2-903a-e8da25e76344\', \'multiverseId\': 617391}, \'multiverseid\': 617391}, {\'name\': "Cadeau d\'Arwen", \'text\': \'Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer si vous contrôlez au moins deux créatures légendaires.\\nRegard 2, puis piochez deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Portez ceci en mémoire de la Pierre elfique et de l\'étoile du soir avec qui votre vie a été entrelacée ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617652&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22fbca9a-09df-400d-9a04-04166437f8df\', \'multiverseId\': 617652}, \'multiverseid\': 617652}, {\'name\': \'Dono di Arwen\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata se controlli due o più creature leggendarie.\\nProfetizza 2, poi pesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Indossalo in ricordo della Gemma Elfica e della Stella del Vespro, le cui vite sono intrecciate con la tua!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73ee7a18-9351-4487-800b-e097d88c5db0\', \'multiverseId\': 617913}, \'multiverseid\': 617913}, {\'name\': \'アルウェンの贈り物\', \'text\': \'あなたが２体以上の伝説のクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\n占術２を行い、その後、カード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたの人生と共に紡がれた夕星とエルフの石を忘れぬよう、これを身に着けなさい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84f720f2-fefb-4eab-93e0-6b41e1a5bc52\', \'multiverseId\': 618174}, \'multiverseid\': 618174}, {\'name\': \'Dádiva de Arwen\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada se você controla duas ou mais criaturas lendárias.\\nUse vidência 2 e depois compre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Agora use isto em memória da Pedra Élfica e da Estrela Vespertina com as quais sua vida se entrelaçou!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac89a19f-35fb-426d-94c6-aae90509b89f\', \'multiverseId\': 618435}, \'multiverseid\': 618435}, {\'name\': \'阿尔玟的赠礼\', \'text\': \'如果你操控两个或更多传奇生物，则此咒语减少{1}来施放。\\n占卜2，然后抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「请戴着它，以纪念织就你生命的精灵宝石和暮星！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2d4e2ad-19c9-4a04-81f3-6f1931cee96f\', \'multiverseId\': 618696}, \'multiverseid\': 618696}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auf nun, zu Zorn und Verderben!\', \'text\': \'Lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke. Sie erhalten Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Der Ring führt dich in Versuchung.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Heermeister des Westens begaben sich für eine letzte Schlacht zum Schwarzen Tor, um die Macht Mordors herauszufordern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617115&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b975bbe-e41d-44cd-85d2-03e4fd420a6f\', \'multiverseId\': 617115}, \'multiverseid\': 617115}, {\'name\': \'¡La hora de la ira y la ruina!\', \'text\': \'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas. Ganan la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno. El Anillo te tienta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Finalmente, los capitanes del Oeste marcharon a desafiar la Puerta Negra y el poder de Mordor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c16a6b0d-ed8c-4ded-b39c-e4cae9863858\', \'multiverseId\': 617376}, \'multiverseid\': 617376}, {\'name\': \'Place à la colère, place à la ruine !\', \'text\': "Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez. Elle acquiert la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour. L\'Anneau vous tente.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les capitaines de l\'ouest arrivèrent enfin pour défier la Porte Noire et la puissance du Mordor.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617637&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49691ee1-1c66-47dd-9906-a3bdba2b0da5\', \'multiverseId\': 617637}, \'multiverseid\': 617637}, {\'name\': \'Per la Collera, per la Rovina!\', \'text\': "Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli. Hanno cautela fino alla fine del turno. L\'Anello ti tenta.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "I Capitani dell\'Ovest giunsero infine a sfidare il Cancello Nero e la potenza di Mordor.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'533b827c-c7ef-4dd2-bd03-32fcaa2a4045\', \'multiverseId\': 617898}, \'multiverseid\': 617898}, {\'name\': \'今は怒りの時、今は滅びの時！\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それらは警戒を得る。指輪があなたを誘惑する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'西方の隊長たちは遂に黒門とモルドールの軍勢と対峙する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8c066ac-5d3b-4847-821c-f92a86314948\', \'multiverseId\': 618159}, \'multiverseid\': 618159}, {\'name\': \'Hora da Ira, Hora da Ruína!\', \'text\': \'Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla. Elas ganham vigilância até o final do turno. O Anel tenta você.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os Capitães do Oeste por fim chegaram para desafiar o Portão Negro e o poder de Mordor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbe26c4a-1e09-4a85-a269-c0870d0bf109\', \'multiverseId\': 618420}, \'multiverseid\': 618420}, {\'name\': \'仇愤之时，战毁之时！\', \'text\': \'在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。它们获得警戒异能直到回合结束。魔戒引诱你。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'西方众将领终于来到黑门前，准备挑战魔多的势力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdbd2be8-3542-4371-ab29-404f1da35035\', \'multiverseId\': 618681}, \'multiverseid\': 618681}]', '[{\'name\': \'Barad-dûr\', \'text\': \'Barad-dûr kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine legendäre Kreatur.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T}: Ork-Aufmarsch X. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur gestorben ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Jene, die Barad-dûr betreten, kehren nicht zurück."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617344&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e46a391-dfa8-483e-a797-2c2d80542594\', \'multiverseId\': 617344}, \'multiverseid\': 617344}, {\'name\': \'Barad-dûr\', \'text\': \'Barad-dûr entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles una criatura legendaria.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T}: Enrola X Orcos. Activa esto solo si una criatura murió este turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra legendaria\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquellos que cruzan las puertas de Barad-dûr no regresan nunca".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dce5517-d9c3-418a-9730-a80df2d2e535\', \'multiverseId\': 617605}, \'multiverseid\': 617605}, {\'name\': \'Barad-dûr\', \'text\': "Barad-dûr arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez une créature légendaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T} : Amassez des orques X. N\'activez que si une créature est morte ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Terrain légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'« Ceux qui passent les portes de Barad-dûr ne reviennent pas. »\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617866&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95054feb-57b4-4a6d-a7d1-fac6887a7623\', \'multiverseId\': 617866}, \'multiverseid\': 617866}, {\'name\': \'Barad-dûr\', \'text\': \'Barad-dûr entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli una creatura leggendaria.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T}: Recluta Orchi X. Attiva solo se è morta una creatura in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra Leggendaria\', \'flavor\': \'"Chi varca i cancelli di Barad-dûr non fa più ritorno."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8843af74-e2c8-4dd1-83bf-2b93c9e29f7e\', \'multiverseId\': 618127}, \'multiverseid\': 618127}, {\'name\': \'バラド＝ドゥール\', \'text\': \'あなたが伝説のクリーチャーをコントロールしていないかぎり、バラド＝ドゥールはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T}：オーク動員Ｘを行う。このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'伝説の土地\', \'flavor\': \'「バラド＝ドゥールの門を潜って戻って来たものはいない。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f84cd11e-9e98-4437-8984-24efd39d75b8\', \'multiverseId\': 618388}, \'multiverseid\': 618388}, {\'name\': \'Barad-dûr\', \'text\': \'Barad-dûr entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle uma criatura lendária.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T}: Arregimente Orcs X. Ative apenas se uma criatura tiver morrido neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'"Os que passam pelos portões de Barad-dûr não retornam."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'352036c5-74bf-48ba-96dc-944528fc969b\', \'multiverseId\': 618649}, \'multiverseid\': 618649}, {\'name\': \'巴拉督尔\', \'text\': \'除非你操控传奇生物，否则巴拉督尔须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}。\\n{X}{X}{B}，{T}：囤兵半兽人X。只能于有生物死去的回合中起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇地\', \'flavor\': \'「那些进入巴拉督尔大门的，都一去不返。」\\n～甘道夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de1e4741-63ef-469a-aee2-c6a045babdf6\', \'multiverseId\': 618910}, \'multiverseid\': 618910}]', '[{\'name\': \'Barad-dûr\', \'text\': \'Barad-dûr kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine legendäre Kreatur.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T}: Ork-Aufmarsch X. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur gestorben ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619085&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'728fbab5-66a6-4fb2-bbd8-df00a9aa3a48\', \'multiverseId\': 619085}, \'multiverseid\': 619085}, {\'name\': \'Barad-dûr\', \'text\': \'Barad-dûr entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles una criatura legendaria.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T}: Enrola X Orcos. Activa esto solo si una criatura murió este turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra legendaria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22535c9d-844b-40fa-b4b0-4d6cd9ff38c7\', \'multiverseId\': 619091}, \'multiverseid\': 619091}, {\'name\': \'Barad-dûr\', \'text\': "Barad-dûr arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez une créature légendaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T} : Amassez des orques X. N\'activez que si une créature est morte ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Terrain légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619097&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a47515b5-e4c0-4b84-b233-350e95d41145\', \'multiverseId\': 619097}, \'multiverseid\': 619097}, {\'name\': \'Barad-dûr\', \'text\': \'Barad-dûr entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli una creatura leggendaria.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T}: Recluta Orchi X. Attiva solo se è morta una creatura in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra Leggendaria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5521ffb1-301b-4c19-8c85-68b1ddb0458f\', \'multiverseId\': 619103}, \'multiverseid\': 619103}, {\'name\': \'バラド＝ドゥール\', \'text\': \'あなたが伝説のクリーチャーをコントロールしていないかぎり、バラド＝ドゥールはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T}：オーク動員Ｘを行う。このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'伝説の土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d6ad499-f94e-46a2-9a06-3b2c961ad5d3\', \'multiverseId\': 619109}, \'multiverseid\': 619109}, {\'name\': \'Barad-dûr\', \'text\': \'Barad-dûr entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle uma criatura lendária.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T}: Arregimente Orcs X. Ative apenas se uma criatura tiver morrido neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fd457ff-6b54-4b1f-a08b-0051ca765526\', \'multiverseId\': 619115}, \'multiverseid\': 619115}, {\'name\': \'巴拉督尔\', \'text\': \'除非你操控传奇生物，否则巴拉督尔须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}。\\n{X}{X}{B}，{T}：囤兵半兽人X。只能于有生物死去的回合中起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3095c37d-0961-4082-ad8c-6fe65006185e\', \'multiverseId\': 619121}, \'multiverseid\': 619121}]', '[{\'name\': \'Barad-dûr\', \'text\': \'Barad-dûr kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine legendäre Kreatur.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T}: Ork-Aufmarsch X. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur gestorben ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619755&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dfee8f5-dc47-4340-b04b-da1cee2b1740\', \'multiverseId\': 619755}, \'multiverseid\': 619755}, {\'name\': \'Barad-dûr\', \'text\': \'Barad-dûr entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles una criatura legendaria.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T}: Enrola X Orcos. Activa esto solo si una criatura murió este turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra legendaria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c07e5e2-2ebf-47de-94af-d7b44a3459ae\', \'multiverseId\': 619798}, \'multiverseid\': 619798}, {\'name\': \'Barad-dûr\', \'text\': "Barad-dûr arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez une créature légendaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T} : Amassez des orques X. N\'activez que si une créature est morte ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Terrain légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619841&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ab6f4e7-35cb-448d-84d9-4c79cb5f16ad\', \'multiverseId\': 619841}, \'multiverseid\': 619841}, {\'name\': \'Barad-dûr\', \'text\': \'Barad-dûr entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli una creatura leggendaria.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T}: Recluta Orchi X. Attiva solo se è morta una creatura in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra Leggendaria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e718ad1-3ce8-44ff-80da-0aa813548b47\', \'multiverseId\': 619884}, \'multiverseid\': 619884}, {\'name\': \'バラド＝ドゥール\', \'text\': \'あなたが伝説のクリーチャーをコントロールしていないかぎり、バラド＝ドゥールはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T}：オーク動員Ｘを行う。このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'伝説の土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eb38906-f560-438b-8508-059f149f5226\', \'multiverseId\': 619927}, \'multiverseid\': 619927}, {\'name\': \'Barad-dûr\', \'text\': \'Barad-dûr entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle uma criatura lendária.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.\\n{X}{X}{B}, {T}: Arregimente Orcs X. Ative apenas se uma criatura tiver morrido neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6241b6cc-b493-4cfd-8570-6725fc5b0468\', \'multiverseId\': 619970}, \'multiverseid\': 619970}, {\'name\': \'巴拉督尔\', \'text\': \'除非你操控传奇生物，否则巴拉督尔须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}。\\n{X}{X}{B}，{T}：囤兵半兽人X。只能于有生物死去的回合中起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ad508c3-7da4-43a8-828c-76a30bf5e7a0\', \'multiverseId\': 620013}, \'multiverseid\': 620013}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bauer aus dem Ostviertel\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Bauer aus dem Ostviertel ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein. Wenn du dies tust, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges +1/+1 für jede Speise, die du kontrollierst. (Ein Speise-Spielstein ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Halbling, Gesinde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617099&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f1b4917-7945-43e1-a0c6-217b52ce4a74\', \'multiverseId\': 617099}, \'multiverseid\': 617099}, {\'name\': \'Granjero de la Cuaderna del Este\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Granjero de la Cuaderna del Este entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Comida. Cuando lo hagas, la criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno por cada Comida que controlas. (Una ficha de Comida es un artefacto con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Plebeyo mediano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d68ef564-d0f4-44a8-8011-0eea2be542ed\', \'multiverseId\': 617360}, \'multiverseid\': 617360}, {\'name\': "Fermier du Quartier de l\'Est", \'text\': "Quand le Fermier du Quartier de l\'Est arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton Nourriture. Quand vous faites ainsi, une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque nourriture que vous contrôlez. (Un jeton Nourriture est un artefact avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)", \'type\': \'Créature : halfelin et paysan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617621&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75597b8d-6704-41fe-9b5f-ddf42139076c\', \'multiverseId\': 617621}, \'multiverseid\': 617621}, {\'name\': \'Contadino del Decumano Est\', \'text\': \'Quando il Contadino del Decumano Est entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina Cibo. Quando lo fai, una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni Cibo che controlli. (Una pedina Cibo è un artefatto con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Popolano Halfling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4b6ba6e-4028-4538-ac6f-f2f1cb23f882\', \'multiverseId\': 617882}, \'multiverseid\': 617882}, {\'name\': \'東四が一の庄の農夫\', \'text\': \'東四が一の庄の農夫が戦場に出たとき、食物・トークン１つを生成する。そうしたとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはあなたがコントロールしている食物１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。（食物・トークンは、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハーフリング・農民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc9f5636-78e5-434c-8037-a2884c1677f1\', \'multiverseId\': 618143}, \'multiverseid\': 618143}, {\'name\': \'Fazendeiro da Quarta Leste\', \'text\': \'Quando Fazendeiro da Quarta Leste entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de Comida. Quando você faz isso, a criatura alvo que você controla recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno para cada Comida que você controla. (Uma ficha de Comida é um artefato com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pequenino Plebeu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6258cabc-de40-4a9e-8146-03701077dcd9\', \'multiverseId\': 618404}, \'multiverseid\': 618404}, {\'name\': \'东区农夫\', \'text\': \'当东区农夫进战场时，派出一个食品衍生物。当你如此作时，你每操控一个食品，目标由你操控的生物便得+1/+1直到回合结束。（食品衍生物是具有「{2}，{T}，牺牲此神器：你获得3点生命」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半身人／平民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2be08bc0-8ea7-4efa-bfa9-f569066d2f6d\', \'multiverseId\': 618665}, \'multiverseid\': 618665}]', '[{\'name\': \'Becken mit Ent-Trunk\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke X. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Wirkung des Trunks machte sich zunächst in den Zehen bemerkbar, und seine belebende und stärkende Kraft stieg dann in alle Gliedmaßen auf, bis sie schließlich die Haarspitzen erreichte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617329&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dc9f50f-64a7-4519-b779-81303f07628d\', \'multiverseId\': 617329}, \'multiverseid\': 617329}, {\'name\': \'Manantial de brebaje de los ents\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo con fuerza de X. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El efecto de la bebida empezó a sentirse en los dedos de los pies y subió firmemente por todo el cuerpo, refrescándolo y fortaleciéndolo, hasta las mismísimas puntas de los cabellos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60e993ff-7151-4a62-af0a-de90e25925ca\', \'multiverseId\': 617590}, \'multiverseid\': 617590}, {\'name\': \'Bassin de boisson entique\', \'text\': "{X}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature de force X ciblée. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'effet de la boisson se sentait d\'abord dans les orteils puis remontait lentement dans chaque membre, rafraîchissant et revigorant tout l\'être, jusqu\'à la pointe des cheveux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617851&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29fc5dd3-26fb-488d-ba44-7e19016a2bc2\', \'multiverseId\': 617851}, \'multiverseid\': 617851}, {\'name\': \'Bacino di Pozioni degli Ent\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio con forza X. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "L\'effetto della pozione iniziò dai piedi e risalì inesorabile per ogni arto, portando ristoro e vigore lungo il percorso, fino alle punte dei capelli.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfa23b9a-7edb-4c51-aae2-fb87a3c99a71\', \'multiverseId\': 618112}, \'multiverseid\': 618112}, {\'name\': \'エント枯れの盆地\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}：パワーがＸであるクリーチャーを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'その効果は爪先からじわりじわりと四肢まで染み渡り、毛先に至るまで力をみなぎらせた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f500c12-634c-4a5f-aab9-0c0956f8bd11\', \'multiverseId\': 618373}, \'multiverseid\': 618373}, {\'name\': \'Bacia de Elixir de Ent\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo com poder X. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O efeito do elixir começou nos pés e subiu gradativamente por todos os membros, levando restabelecimento e vigor conforme se elevava até a ponta do cabelo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3525635-c134-4ca2-88ed-8d5e9c627780\', \'multiverseId\': 618634}, \'multiverseid\': 618634}, {\'name\': \'恩特饮料石坛\', \'text\': \'{X}，{T}：在目标力量为X的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'饮料的效果先从脚趾开始，缓慢攀升到四肢，一路带去焕新感觉与激情活力，直达发梢。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8973b946-df23-4c2d-b47e-34e20624c31c\', \'multiverseId\': 618895}, \'multiverseid\': 618895}]', '[{\'name\': \'Berittener Bote aus Gondor\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Berittene Bote aus Gondor ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte. Falls du dann keine legendäre Kreatur kontrollierst, lege eine Karte aus deiner Hand unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Gondor ist in großer Not. Fürst Denethor ersucht euch um all eure Stärke und Eile, damit Gondor nicht fällt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617102&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e9a10a1-69e0-4d40-88b0-77b38ca99e21\', \'multiverseId\': 617102}, \'multiverseid\': 617102}, {\'name\': \'Mensajero de Gondor\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Mensajero de Gondor entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta. Luego, si no controlas una criatura legendaria, pon una carta de tu mano en el fondo de tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Un gran peligro amenaza Gondor. El señor Denethor precisa de vuestra fuerza y diligencia para impedir que caiga el reino".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc0b6054-7d3a-4b6f-bc40-5c9e88cf4b6e\', \'multiverseId\': 617363}, \'multiverseid\': 617363}, {\'name\': \'Messager du Gondor\', \'text\': \'Quand le Messager du Gondor arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte. Puis, si vous ne contrôlez pas de créature légendaire, mettez une carte de votre main au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Le Gondor a grand besoin d\'aide. Le seigneur Denethor demande toute votre force et toute votre célérité, de crainte que le Gondor ne finisse par tomber. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617624&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c99d4c5-c480-41f3-a80a-1d72da6a08dd\', \'multiverseId\': 617624}, \'multiverseid\': 617624}, {\'name\': \'Messaggero di Gondor\', \'text\': \'Quando il Messaggero di Gondor entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta. Poi, se non controlli una creatura leggendaria, metti una carta dalla tua mano in fondo al tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Gondor ha bisogno di aiuto. Sire Denethor richiede tutta la vostra forza e la vostra rapidità, altrimenti Gondor cadrà."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cc48dc0-b8cd-4d16-b418-132305fc13d6\', \'multiverseId\': 617885}, \'multiverseid\': 617885}, {\'name\': \'ゴンドールの使者\', \'text\': \'ゴンドールの使者が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。その後、あなたが伝説のクリーチャーをコントロールしていないなら、あなたの手札にあるカード１枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「ゴンドールには助けが必要です。ゴンドールが落ちてしまわぬよう、デネソール侯は皆様の持つ全ての力を可能な限り早く所望しておられます。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce4c985e-7a67-41d9-a080-159d8c7cbd78\', \'multiverseId\': 618146}, \'multiverseid\': 618146}, {\'name\': \'Estafeta de Gondor\', \'text\': \'Quando Estafeta de Gondor entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card. Em seguida, se você não controlar uma criatura lendária, coloque um card de sua mão no fundo de seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Gondor está em grandes apuros. O Senhor Denethor pede toda a sua força e presteza, ou Gondor finalmente cairá."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e62d90a-4ed7-4931-b810-47cae80efebf\', \'multiverseId\': 618407}, \'multiverseid\': 618407}, {\'name\': \'刚铎信使\', \'text\': \'当刚铎信使进战场时，抓一张牌。然后若你未操控传奇生物，则将一张牌从你手上置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「刚铎如今情势危急。德内梭尔城主请您倾力相助，尽速出兵，否则刚铎必将陷落。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fefced70-aab3-42ef-a4d7-60b033c08619\', \'multiverseId\': 618668}, \'multiverseid\': 618668}]', "[{'name': 'Beschützer Gondors', 'text': 'Wenn der Beschützer Gondors ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat', 'flavor': 'Die Orks gruben tiefe Gräben in einem gewaltigen Ring gerade außerhalb der Reichweite der Bögen, während die Menschen von Minas Tirith nur machtlos zusehen konnten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617116&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd137281b-67c0-4d11-be16-ed838a706f10', 'multiverseId': 617116}, 'multiverseid': 617116}, {'name': 'Protector de Gondor', 'text': 'Cuando el Protector de Gondor entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado Humano blanca 1/1.', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado humano', 'flavor': 'Los orcos cavaban profundas trincheras en un vasto círculo, justo fuera del alcance de los arcos de los muros, mientras los hombres de Minas Tirith observaban sin poder hacer nada.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617377&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a6b86d1-0aab-41fc-a7b6-4b84e489d004', 'multiverseId': 617377}, 'multiverseid': 617377}, {'name': 'Protecteur du Gondor', 'text': 'Quand le Protecteur du Gondor arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et soldat', 'flavor': 'Les orques creusaient de profondes tranchées dans un grand cercle, juste hors de portée des archers qui tenaient le mur, tandis que les hommes de Minas Tirith les regardaient, impuissants.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617638&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09880b8c-fe0e-4be9-84e1-786a677d93d5', 'multiverseId': 617638}, 'multiverseid': 617638}, {'name': 'Protettore di Gondor', 'text': 'Quando il Protettore di Gondor entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianca.', 'type': 'Creatura — Soldato Umano', 'flavor': 'Gli Orchi scavavano una profonda trincea ad anello, fuori dalla portata degli arcieri sulle mura, sotto lo sguardo impotente degli Uomini di Minas Tirith.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617899&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51effbbf-4614-4ee2-aa0c-ad304082e3d1', 'multiverseId': 617899}, 'multiverseid': 617899}, {'name': 'ゴンドールの守護者', 'text': 'ゴンドールの守護者が戦場に出たとき、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': 'オーク達が城壁の間際に深く巨大な円形の塹壕を掘り進めた一方、ミナス・ティリスの民はただその様を見つめる他なかった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618160&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30439872-e8cc-48bd-832d-25f50c1fd609', 'multiverseId': 618160}, 'multiverseid': 618160}, {'name': 'Protetor de Gondor', 'text': 'Quando Protetor de Gondor entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Humano Soldado branca 1/1.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Soldado', 'flavor': 'Os Orcs escavavam profundas trincheiras num grande anel logo além do alcance dos arcos, enquanto os Homens de Minas Tirith assistiam, incapazes de detê-los.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618421&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd261bd71-cdc3-4ce0-800a-5db2f659d7be', 'multiverseId': 618421}, 'multiverseid': 618421}, {'name': '刚铎保护者', 'text': '当刚铎保护者进战场时，派出一个1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／士兵', 'flavor': '奥克就在城墙弓箭射程之外挖起深深的巨大环形壕沟，而米那斯提力斯的人类守军只能眼睁睁地看着，却无力阻止。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618682&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d599d5e-d60c-4f51-8db3-5b9bc8483354', 'multiverseId': 618682}, 'multiverseid': 618682}]", '[{\'name\': \'Besprechung des Rats\', \'text\': \'Ziehe eine Karte.\\nImmer wenn du Hellsicht anwendest und falls du eine Insel kontrollierst, kannst du die Besprechung des Rats aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schicken. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde den Ring nach Mordor bringen, allerdings kenne ich den Weg nicht."\\n—Frodo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617137&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'358f8a23-cb3b-4a0d-9ec5-158468bbb226\', \'multiverseId\': 617137}, \'multiverseid\': 617137}, {\'name\': \'Deliberación del Concilio\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta.\\nSiempre que adivines, si controlas una Isla, puedes exiliar la Deliberación del Concilio de tu cementerio. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Llevaré el Anillo a Mordor, pero no conozco el camino".\\n—Frodo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0bbeb64-46db-4ed5-bdc4-f403e956b14a\', \'multiverseId\': 617398}, \'multiverseid\': 617398}, {\'name\': \'Délibération du Conseil\', \'text\': \'Piochez une carte.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous appliquez le regard, si vous contrôlez une île, vous pouvez exiler la Délibération du Conseil depuis votre cimetière. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je porterai l\'Anneau jusqu\'au Mordor, mais je ne connais pas le chemin. »\\n—Frodo", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617659&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0da1131f-df16-48a8-a8b7-fa2aa38bd894\', \'multiverseId\': 617659}, \'multiverseid\': 617659}, {\'name\': \'Delibera del Consiglio\', \'text\': "Pesca una carta.\\nOgniqualvolta profetizzi, se controlli un\'Isola, puoi esiliare la Delibera del Consiglio dal tuo cimitero. Se lo fai, peschi una carta.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Porterò l\\\'Anello a Mordor, ma non conosco la strada."\\n—Frodo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dd71df8-6447-45dc-a88f-b388c5805d43\', \'multiverseId\': 617920}, \'multiverseid\': 617920}, {\'name\': \'会議の末の熟慮\', \'text\': \'カード１枚を引く。\\nあなたが占術を行うたび、あなたが島をコントロールしている場合、あなたの墓地にある会議の末の熟慮を追放してもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「行く術は分からないけど、僕が指輪をモルドールまで運びましょう。」\\n――フロド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7594db3c-899c-4195-81b4-a2a4857b33bd\', \'multiverseId\': 618181}, \'multiverseid\': 618181}, {\'name\': \'Deliberação do Conselho\', \'text\': \'Compre um card.\\nToda vez que usa vidência, se você controla uma Ilha, você pode exilar Deliberação do Conselho de seu cemitério. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu levarei o Anel até Mordor, mesmo não sabendo o caminho."\\n— Frodo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d7fd1bc-4c39-4620-ac2e-1b51e32fed65\', \'multiverseId\': 618442}, \'multiverseid\': 618442}, {\'name\': \'议会千虑\', \'text\': \'抓一张牌。\\n每当你占卜时，若你操控海岛，则你可以从你的坟墓场放逐议会千虑。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「虽然我不识前路，但愿将魔戒带到魔多。」\\n～弗罗多\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70adb72d-fa57-4bcc-9846-a4f76f9fe741\', \'multiverseId\': 618703}, \'multiverseid\': 618703}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bilbo, Meisterdieb im Ruhestand\', \'text\': \'Wenn Bilbo, Meisterdieb im Ruhestand, ins Spiel kommt oder das Spiel verlässt, führt der Ring dich in Versuchung.\\nImmer wenn Bilbo einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kenne die Hälfte von euch nicht halb so gut, wie ich es gerne täte, und ich schätze weniger als die Hälfte von euch nur halb so sehr, wie ihr es verdient."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617287&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ba08e62-3f8e-442e-8ad8-bf2ae461215f\', \'multiverseId\': 617287}, \'multiverseid\': 617287}, {\'name\': \'Bilbo, ladrón jubilado\', \'text\': \'Cuando Bilbo, ladrón jubilado entre a o deje el campo de batalla, el Anillo te tienta.\\nSiempre que Bilbo haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón mediano\', \'flavor\': \'"No conozco a la mitad de ustedes ni la mitad de lo que me gustaría, y lo que me gustaría es menos de la mitad de lo que la mitad de ustedes merita".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f10446bb-def3-46ca-9fbe-026ea325fbaa\', \'multiverseId\': 617548}, \'multiverseid\': 617548}, {\'name\': \'Bilbo, cambrioleur à la retraite\', \'text\': "Quand Bilbo, cambrioleur à la retraite arrive sur le champ de bataille ou le quitte, l\'Anneau vous tente.\\nÀ chaque fois que Bilbo inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton Trésor.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« Je ne connais pas la moitié d\'entre vous aussi bien que je le souhaiterais, et j\'apprécie moins de la moitié d\'entre vous à moitié moins que vous ne le méritez. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617809&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0e001f1-4f45-4978-a98f-a212a1584942\', \'multiverseId\': 617809}, \'multiverseid\': 617809}, {\'name\': \'Bilbo, Scassinatore in Congedo\', \'text\': "Quando Bilbo, Scassinatore in Congedo entra nel campo di battaglia o lo lascia, l\'Anello ti tenta.\\nOgniqualvolta Bilbo infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crei una pedina Tesoro.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Farabutto Halfling\', \'flavor\': \'"Conosco la metà di voi solo a metà e nutro per meno della metà di voi metà dell\\\'affetto che meritate."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80c40be9-501e-42b7-bde9-b9576c1d6cff\', \'multiverseId\': 618070}, \'multiverseid\': 618070}, {\'name\': \'引退した忍びの者、ビルボ\', \'text\': \'引退した忍びの者、ビルボが戦場に出たか戦場を離れたとき、指輪があなたを誘惑する。\\n引退した忍びの者、ビルボがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「ここに居る半分は見知らぬ仲だ。更にその半分の奴らはいけ好かんと思っている。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b99af30-23cc-46c4-91b9-24455d0e0dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 618331}, \'multiverseid\': 618331}, {\'name\': \'Bilbo, Ladrão Aposentado\', \'text\': \'Quando Bilbo, Ladrão Aposentado, entra no campo de batalha ou o deixa, o Anel tenta você.\\nToda vez que Bilbo causar dano de combate a um jogador, crie uma ficha de Tesouro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pequenino Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu não conheço a metade de vocês nem metade do que eu gostaria; e eu gosto de menos da metade de vocês a metade do que vocês merecem."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da51c5b4-6655-44c4-9b94-d74ed7b1c8a0\', \'multiverseId\': 618592}, \'multiverseid\': 618592}, {\'name\': \'退休小偷比尔博\', \'text\': \'当退休小偷比尔博进入或离开战场时，魔戒引诱你。\\n每当比尔博对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「你们当中有一半人，我了解你们的程度还没有我了解喜欢人程度的一半；而你们当中少于一半人，我喜欢你们的程度也只有你们值得程度的一半。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f179d914-5bd7-4131-9b95-0ef2dce5b206\', \'multiverseId\': 618853}, \'multiverseid\': 618853}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bilbo, Meisterdieb im Ruhestand\', \'text\': \'Wenn Bilbo, Meisterdieb im Ruhestand, ins Spiel kommt oder das Spiel verlässt, führt der Ring dich in Versuchung.\\nImmer wenn Bilbo einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Halbling, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619350&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfe739fe-3d6e-4ebc-b5f4-dd3b2976848a\', \'multiverseId\': 619350}, \'multiverseid\': 619350}, {\'name\': \'Bilbo, ladrón jubilado\', \'text\': \'Cuando Bilbo, ladrón jubilado entre a o deje el campo de batalla, el Anillo te tienta.\\nSiempre que Bilbo haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón mediano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b024fd64-6e3b-44af-90a1-63fb9c09f243\', \'multiverseId\': 619356}, \'multiverseid\': 619356}, {\'name\': \'Bilbo, cambrioleur à la retraite\', \'text\': "Quand Bilbo, cambrioleur à la retraite arrive sur le champ de bataille ou le quitte, l\'Anneau vous tente.\\nÀ chaque fois que Bilbo inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton Trésor.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : halfelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619362&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33f42ce5-ad8e-4d1e-9c5d-f186b3e988f2\', \'multiverseId\': 619362}, \'multiverseid\': 619362}, {\'name\': \'Bilbo, Scassinatore in Congedo\', \'text\': "Quando Bilbo, Scassinatore in Congedo entra nel campo di battaglia o lo lascia, l\'Anello ti tenta.\\nOgniqualvolta Bilbo infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crei una pedina Tesoro.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Farabutto Halfling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'471cdf2d-20be-49ac-8ae2-bedb579ede9d\', \'multiverseId\': 619368}, \'multiverseid\': 619368}, {\'name\': \'引退した忍びの者、ビルボ\', \'text\': \'引退した忍びの者、ビルボが戦場に出たか戦場を離れたとき、指輪があなたを誘惑する。\\n引退した忍びの者、ビルボがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハーフリング・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4a015aa-6b11-4895-9824-2346f4d50c62\', \'multiverseId\': 619374}, \'multiverseid\': 619374}, {\'name\': \'Bilbo, Ladrão Aposentado\', \'text\': \'Quando Bilbo, Ladrão Aposentado, entra no campo de batalha ou o deixa, o Anel tenta você.\\nToda vez que Bilbo causar dano de combate a um jogador, crie uma ficha de Tesouro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pequenino Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aabfa51f-ee5b-4532-83a3-92dc3dc3b697\', \'multiverseId\': 619380}, \'multiverseid\': 619380}, {\'name\': \'退休小偷比尔博\', \'text\': \'当退休小偷比尔博进入或离开战场时，魔戒引诱你。\\n每当比尔博对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～半身人／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4388a0e7-d4e8-43fa-b66c-7944654cd438\', \'multiverseId\': 619386}, \'multiverseid\': 619386}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bilbos Ring\', \'text\': \'Solange es dein Zug ist, hat die ausgerüstete Kreatur Fluchsicherheit und kann nicht geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur alleine angreift, ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.\\nAusrüsten eines Halblings {1} ({1}: Lege diese Karte an einen Halbling deiner Wahl an, den du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\\nAusrüsten {4} ({4}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620121&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e35bbecc-bfc0-4028-930e-ea143767fa6f\', \'multiverseId\': 620121}, \'multiverseid\': 620121}, {\'name\': \'Anillo de Bilbo\', \'text\': \'Mientras sea tu turno, la criatura equipada tiene la habilidad de antimaleficio y no puede ser bloqueada.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada ataque sola, robas una carta y pierdes 1 vida.\\nEquipar Mediano {1}. ({1}: Anexa este Equipo al Mediano objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\\nEquipar {4}. ({4}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21f4bdff-e413-412f-867b-30da6748ad29\', \'multiverseId\': 620131}, \'multiverseid\': 620131}, {\'name\': \'Anneau de Bilbo\', \'text\': "Tant que c\'est votre tour, la créature équipée a la défense talismanique et ne peut pas être bloquée.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque seule, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.\\nÉquipement de halfelin {1} ({1} : Attachez à un halfelin ciblé que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)\\nÉquipement {4} ({4} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620141&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ebc6f02-b8e3-4098-9e78-7bc6b66e1ea5\', \'multiverseId\': 620141}, \'multiverseid\': 620141}, {\'name\': \'Anello di Bilbo\', \'text\': \'Fintanto che è il tuo turno, la creatura equipaggiata ha anti-malocchio e non può essere bloccata.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca da sola, peschi una carta e perdi 1 punto vita.\\nEquipaggiare Halfling {1} ({1}: Assegna a un Halfling bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\\nEquipaggiare {4} ({4}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9471a6fc-71a3-4274-9953-31d66f08f8dc\', \'multiverseId\': 620151}, \'multiverseid\': 620151}, {\'name\': \'ビルボの指輪\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの間、装備しているクリーチャーは呪禁を持ち、ブロックされない。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、あなたはカード１枚を引き、１点のライフを失う。\\nハーフリングに装備{1}（{1}：あなたがコントロールしているハーフリング１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\n装備{4}（{4}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb0be23b-d476-4f14-b307-8996f6b65e0a\', \'multiverseId\': 620161}, \'multiverseid\': 620161}, {\'name\': \'Anel de Bilbo\', \'text\': \'Enquanto for o seu turno, a criatura equipada terá resistência a magia e não poderá ser bloqueada.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada ataca sozinha, você compra um card e perde 1 ponto de vida.\\nEquipar Pequenino {1} ({1}: Anexe este equipamento ao Pequenino alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\\nEquipar {4} ({4}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f08a7a28-2e7e-45d6-92dc-152c22a7598b\', \'multiverseId\': 620171}, \'multiverseid\': 620171}, {\'name\': \'比尔博的戒指\', \'text\': \'只要是在你的回合中，佩带此武具的生物便具有辟邪异能且不能被阻挡。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物单独攻击时，你抓一张牌且失去1点生命。\\n佩带半身人{1}（{1}：贴附在目标由你操控的半身人上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\\n佩带{4}（{4}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'传奇神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9e35750-e4be-4db8-9525-85efb1620d74\', \'multiverseId\': 620181}, \'multiverseid\': 620181}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bilbos Ring\', \'text\': \'Solange es dein Zug ist, hat die ausgerüstete Kreatur Fluchsicherheit und kann nicht geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur alleine angreift, ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.\\nAusrüsten eines Halblings {1}\\nAusrüsten {4}\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620217&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09fbd8b8-52a4-4c9f-8da5-1d9ad592af18\', \'multiverseId\': 620217}, \'multiverseid\': 620217}, {\'name\': \'Anneau de Bilbo\', \'text\': "Tant que c\'est votre tour, la créature équipée a la défense talismanique et ne peut pas être bloquée.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque seule, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.\\nÉquipement de halfelin {1}\\nÉquipement {4}", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620227&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4c12e16-4b95-422e-aa1d-71a2135a88ad\', \'multiverseId\': 620227}, \'multiverseid\': 620227}, {\'name\': \'ビルボの指輪\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの間、装備しているクリーチャーは呪禁を持ち、ブロックされない。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、あなたはカード１枚を引き、１点のライフを失う。\\nハーフリングに装備{1}\\n装備{4}\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0a56ece-5863-4673-8d58-a3e8cfd59564\', \'multiverseId\': 620237}, \'multiverseid\': 620237}, {\'name\': \'比尔博的戒指\', \'text\': \'只要是在你的回合中，佩带此武具的生物便具有辟邪异能且不能被阻挡。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物单独攻击时，你抓一张牌且失去1点生命。\\n佩带半身人{1}\\n佩带{4}\', \'type\': \'传奇神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5d5e15a-8025-4d98-ab00-b4ffc185c31a\', \'multiverseId\': 620247}, \'multiverseid\': 620247}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bitterer Untergang\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {3} weniger, falls er eine Kreatur als Ziel hat, der in diesem Zug Schaden zugefügt wurde.\\nZerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Ihr Beherrscher verliert 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich wollte Frodo den Ring entreißen. Es tut mir leid. Nun habe ich den Preis dafür gezahlt."\\n—Boromir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617168&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0f98b86-06e2-4d7e-ad9c-c4189daf257a\', \'multiverseId\': 617168}, \'multiverseid\': 617168}, {\'name\': \'Desenlace amargo\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {3} menos lanzar este hechizo si hace objetivo a una criatura que recibió daño este turno.\\nDestruye la criatura objetivo. Su controlador pierde 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Intenté arrebatarle el Anillo a Frodo. Lo siento. He pagado".\\n—Boromir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3096b73c-d85a-46de-a89d-3bf2834c2ace\', \'multiverseId\': 617429}, \'multiverseid\': 617429}, {\'name\': \'Chute amère\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {3} de moins à lancer s\'il cible une créature qui a subi des blessures ce tour-ci.\\nDétruisez une créature ciblée. Son contrôleur perd 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai essayé de prendre l\'Anneau à Frodo. Je suis désolé. Je l\'ai payé. »\\n—Boromir", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617690&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6056d4c-ea76-4820-977b-a6521b5be4bf\', \'multiverseId\': 617690}, \'multiverseid\': 617690}, {\'name\': \'Disfatta Acre\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {3} in meno per essere lanciata se bersaglia una creatura a cui è stato inflitto danno in questo turno.\\nDistruggi una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore perde 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho tentato di sottrarre l\\\'Anello a Frodo. Mi dispiace. Ne ho pagato il prezzo."\\n—Boromir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b252790-d2c1-42e3-bb08-4094f9fd97f8\', \'multiverseId\': 617951}, \'multiverseid\': 617951}, {\'name\': \'悲惨な破滅\', \'text\': \'これがこのターンにダメージを受けたクリーチャー１体を対象とするなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{3}少なくなる。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「フロドから指輪を奪おうとしてしまった。すまなかった。その報いを受けたのだ。」\\n――ボロミア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aba217a2-71a6-4c17-b325-2835c285fc1c\', \'multiverseId\': 618212}, \'multiverseid\': 618212}, {\'name\': \'Queda Amarga\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {3} a menos para ser conjurada se tiver como alvo uma criatura que tenha sofrido dano neste turno.\\nDestrua a criatura alvo. Seu controlador perde 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu tentei tomar o Anel de Frodo. Eu lamento. Paguei por isso."\\n— Boromir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22c1147d-ac8a-437f-8b12-bfd8a9c32d41\', \'multiverseId\': 618473}, \'multiverseid\': 618473}, {\'name\': \'苦涩败亡\', \'text\': \'如果此咒语以本回合中受过伤害的生物为目标，则它减少{3}来施放。\\n消灭目标生物。其操控者失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我刚才试图从弗罗多手里抢过魔戒。非常抱歉。我已经付出了代价。」\\n～波洛米尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a94797b-9ffa-4399-8b99-9ec3671d5280\', \'multiverseId\': 618734}, \'multiverseid\': 618734}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blüte des Weißen Baums\', \'text\': \'Legendäre Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+1 und haben Abwehr {1}.\\nNichtlegendäre Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Aragorn pflanzte den neuen Baum im Hof neben dem Brunnen und er wuchs schnell und stark.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617106&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53b7cd45-2221-4c5e-8ec9-55d71fc16e64\', \'multiverseId\': 617106}, \'multiverseid\': 617106}, {\'name\': \'Floración del Árbol Blanco\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas legendarias que controlas obtienen +2/+1 y tienen la habilidad de rebatir {1}.\\nLas criaturas que no sean legendarias que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento legendario\', \'flavor\': \'Aragorn plantó el árbol nuevo en el patio, al pie del manantial, y rápidamente comenzó a crecer, vivo y lozano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aec1901-3460-4ef7-802b-b6c61bff127e\', \'multiverseId\': 617367}, \'multiverseid\': 617367}, {\'name\': "Floraison de l\'Arbre blanc", \'text\': \'Les créatures légendaires que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+1 et ont parade {1}.\\nLes créatures non-légendaires que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'Aragorn planta le nouvel arbre dans la cour, près de la fontaine, où il commença à croître rapidement et joyeusement.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617628&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55c0d32e-56fd-41e3-ad40-7a4eec5740d2\', \'multiverseId\': 617628}, \'multiverseid\': 617628}, {\'name\': "Fioritura dell\'Albero Bianco", \'text\': \'Le creature leggendarie che controlli prendono +2/+1 e hanno egida {1}.\\nLe creature non leggendarie che controlli prendono +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'Il nuovo albero piantato da Aragorn nel cortile della fontana iniziò presto a crescere vigoroso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'412d7b27-b89a-4d3f-9768-86a1d86aa44d\', \'multiverseId\': 617889}, \'multiverseid\': 617889}, {\'name\': \'白の木に花開く\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての伝説のクリーチャーは＋２/＋１の修整を受け護法{1}を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて伝説でないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のエンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'アラゴルンが若木を噴水そばの庭に植えると、それは待ちわびたかのように瞬く間に成長した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'070cbff7-b516-42f2-9702-71c52e0fc90e\', \'multiverseId\': 618150}, \'multiverseid\': 618150}, {\'name\': \'Florescimento da Árvore Branca\', \'text\': \'As criaturas lendárias que você controla recebem +2/+1 e têm salvaguarda {1}.\\nAs criaturas não lendárias que você controla recebem +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'Aragorn plantou a árvore nova no pátio ao lado da fonte, e rápida e alegremente ela começou a crescer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'319d403b-db00-4e8b-9aa9-2c2f0d32b1b3\', \'multiverseId\': 618411}, \'multiverseid\': 618411}, {\'name\': \'白树开花\', \'text\': \'由你操控的传奇生物得+2/+1且具有守护{1}。\\n由你操控的非传奇生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界\', \'flavor\': \'阿拉贡将新树种在王庭喷泉边，于是它便欢快地迅速生长。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca810f9a-182e-4b88-a393-52dc69b66616\', \'multiverseId\': 618672}, \'multiverseid\': 618672}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blüte des Weißen Baums\', \'text\': \'Legendäre Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+1 und haben Abwehr {1}.\\nNichtlegendäre Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Aragorn pflanzte den neuen Baum im Hof neben dem Brunnen und er wuchs schnell und stark.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619194&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'666f6580-7ff3-4b01-9f84-d9982c9e3603\', \'multiverseId\': 619194}, \'multiverseid\': 619194}, {\'name\': "Floraison de l\'Arbre blanc", \'text\': \'Les créatures légendaires que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+1 et ont parade {1}.\\nLes créatures non-légendaires que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'Aragorn planta le nouvel arbre dans la cour, près de la fontaine, où il commença à croître rapidement et joyeusement.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619231&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2edd9f9-b6ba-4718-b75c-d898f0c6dc54\', \'multiverseId\': 619231}, \'multiverseid\': 619231}, {\'name\': \'白の木に花開く\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての伝説のクリーチャーは＋２/＋１の修整を受け護法{1}を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて伝説でないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のエンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'アラゴルンが若木を噴水そばの庭に植えると、それは待ちわびたかのように瞬く間に成長した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db9f95ee-7a07-40c1-b355-a0c52e5beeaf\', \'multiverseId\': 619268}, \'multiverseid\': 619268}, {\'name\': \'白树开花\', \'text\': \'由你操控的传奇生物得+2/+1且具有守护{1}。\\n由你操控的非传奇生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界\', \'flavor\': \'阿拉贡将新树种在王庭喷泉边，于是它便欢快地迅速生长。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d305ec7c-7c54-4bfa-a90c-77550699a8d9\', \'multiverseId\': 619305}, \'multiverseid\': 619305}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bogen der Galadrim\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn der Bogen der Galadrim ins Spiel kommt, lege ihn an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Enttappe die Kreatur.\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+2 und hat Reichweite.\\nAusrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617258&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d3d511c-05d3-4a37-9948-8b5dadce47c9\', \'multiverseId\': 617258}, \'multiverseid\': 617258}, {\'name\': \'Arco de los galadrim\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando el Arco de los galadrim entre al campo de batalla, anéxalo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Endereza esa criatura.\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +1/+2 y tiene la habilidad de alcance.\\nEquipar {2}. ({2}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef6ee703-c76d-4464-85a4-bded5da0d811\', \'multiverseId\': 617519}, \'multiverseid\': 617519}, {\'name\': \'Arc des Galadhrim\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand l\'Arc des Galadhrim arrive sur le champ de bataille, attachez-le à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Dégagez cette créature.\\nLa créature équipée gagne +1/+2 et a la portée.\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617780&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e6f6028-dd68-4da5-aaab-ecc8c46dc0ee\', \'multiverseId\': 617780}, \'multiverseid\': 617780}, {\'name\': \'Arco Galadhrim\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nQuando l\'Arco Galadhrim entra nel campo di battaglia, assegnalo a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. STAPpa quella creatura.\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+2 e ha raggiungere.\\nEquipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3b777bd-07de-41ff-a58f-f843fd4e3caa\', \'multiverseId\': 618041}, \'multiverseid\': 618041}, {\'name\': \'ガラズリムの弓\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nガラズリムの弓が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。そのクリーチャーをアンタップする。\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋２の修整を受け到達を持つ。\\n装備{2}（{2}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7e65340-2dc4-40db-9924-0ee35b55c9de\', \'multiverseId\': 618302}, \'multiverseid\': 618302}, {\'name\': \'Arco Galadhrim\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Arco Galadhrim entrar no campo de batalha, anexe-o à criatura alvo que você controla. Desvire aquela criatura.\\nA criatura equipada recebe +1/+2 e tem alcance.\\nEquipar {2} ({2}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fdefa07-a2e6-455f-842a-97bdcf8da584\', \'multiverseId\': 618563}, \'multiverseid\': 618563}, {\'name\': \'加拉兹民之弓\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当加拉兹民之弓进战场时，将它贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。重置该生物。\\n佩带此武具的生物得+1/+2且具有延势异能。\\n佩带{2}（{2}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43aceeea-e1fd-472f-bd9d-1bd4af099a1b\', \'multiverseId\': 618824}, \'multiverseid\': 618824}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bombadils Lied\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+1 und Fluchsicherheit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Der Ring führt dich in Versuchung. (Eine Kreatur mit Fluchsicherheit kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Hey, ho! Merrido! Kling-a-dopp, ding-do!\\nKling-a-dopp! Im Galopp! Weidenmann, ist so froh!\\nTom Bom, toller Tom, Tom Bombadilloh!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617245&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b141c04-e8ac-45af-ba66-c623f2dd8878\', \'multiverseId\': 617245}, \'multiverseid\': 617245}, {\'name\': \'Canción de Bombadil\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de antimaleficio hasta el final del turno. El Anillo te tienta. (Una criatura con la habilidad de antimaleficio no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlan tus oponentes.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Hola, dol! ¡Feliz dol! ¡Toca un don dilló!\\n¡Toca un don! ¡Salta! ¡Con un fal se maravilló!\\n¡Tom Bom, alegre Tom, Tom Bombadilló!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9abcfbe5-5ee7-40d4-ad97-18aa418bbc3c\', \'multiverseId\': 617506}, \'multiverseid\': 617506}, {\'name\': \'Chanson de Bombadil\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 et acquiert la défense talismanique jusqu\'à la fin du tour. L\'Anneau vous tente. (Une créature avec la défense talismanique ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Hé dol ! Joyeux dol ! Ding et dong, ding et dilo !\\nDing et dong ! Sautillons ! Falali le saule !\\nTom Bom, joyeux Tom, Tom Bombadilo ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617767&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5367f4ab-3c9b-4f3f-9715-b31fd6a5846b\', \'multiverseId\': 617767}, \'multiverseid\': 617767}, {\'name\': \'Canzone di Bombadil\', \'text\': "Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+1 e ha anti-malocchio fino alla fine del turno. L\'Anello ti tenta. (Una creatura con anti-malocchio non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ehi, gingillo! Tu, pupillo! Stai tranquillo!\\nFai un trillo! Resta arzillo! Mangia un mirtillo!\\nTom Bom, bello Tom, Tom Bombadillo!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f76c738-2e0b-4fb2-8d4b-3b250bf13fe6\', \'multiverseId\': 618028}, \'multiverseid\': 618028}, {\'name\': \'ボンバディルの歌\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受け呪禁を得る。指輪があなたを誘惑する。（呪禁を持つクリーチャーは、対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「やあ、ドル！よう、ドル！ドンドン鳴らそう！\\nドンと鳴れ！跳ねて回れ！柳の側で踊ろう！\\nトム・ボム、愉快なトム、トム・ボンバディル！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f3e9bf5-c5a3-4588-adce-57ad33896b7e\', \'multiverseId\': 618289}, \'multiverseid\': 618289}, {\'name\': \'Canção de Bombadil\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +1/+1 e ganha resistência a magia até o final do turno. O Anel tenta você. (Uma criatura com resistência a magia não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades controladas por seus oponentes.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Ei, dom! alegre dom! toca dom dillo!\\nToca dom! venha com! Fá, lá, tranquilo!\\nTom Bom, feliz Tom, Tom Bombadillo!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9737d861-4e29-4efd-90c7-dfdab3e6fbaa\', \'multiverseId\': 618550}, \'multiverseid\': 618550}, {\'name\': \'邦巴迪尔之歌\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标由你操控的生物得+1/+1且获得辟邪异能。魔戒引诱你。（具辟邪异能的生物不能成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「嘿嘿咚！欢乐咚！敲响叮叮咚！\\n响叮咚！跳叮咚！柳树倒叮咚！\\n汤姆砰！开心砰！邦巴迪尔砰！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bce85c22-81c4-4fad-bc0f-1cefb7fbc41f\', \'multiverseId\': 618811}, \'multiverseid\': 618811}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boromir, Wächter des Turms\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner einen Zauberspruch wirkt und falls für ihn beim Wirken kein Mana ausgegeben wurde, neutralisiere den Zauberspruch.\\nOpfere Boromir, Wächter des Turms: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Der Ring führt dich in Versuchung.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Lebewohl Aragorn! Reise nach Minas Tirith und rette mein Volk!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617095&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'755f8498-c7b8-42f3-abb0-73f3cec9f580\', \'multiverseId\': 617095}, \'multiverseid\': 617095}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, Guardián de la Torre\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nSiempre que un oponente lance un hechizo, si no se usó maná para lanzarlo, contrarresta ese hechizo.\\nSacrificar a Boromir, Guardián de la Torre: Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. El Anillo te tienta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Adiós, Aragorn! ¡Dirígete a Minas Tirith y socorre a mi pueblo!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'339a74bb-efcb-4bf4-a0da-29560779a229\', \'multiverseId\': 617356}, \'multiverseid\': 617356}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, Gardien de la Tour\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort, si aucun mana n\'a été dépensé pour le lancer, contrecarrez ce sort.\\nSacrifiez Boromir, Gardien de la Tour : Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. L\'Anneau vous tente.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Adieu, Aragorn ! Allez à Minas Tirith et sauvez mon peuple ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617617&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ea0be6f-09bf-486a-b5db-6a7d23edae1b\', \'multiverseId\': 617617}, \'multiverseid\': 617617}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, Guardiano della Torre\', \'text\': "Cautela\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario lancia una magia, se non è stato speso mana per lanciarla, neutralizza quella magia.\\nSacrifica Boromir, Guardiano della Torre: Le creature che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. L\'Anello ti tenta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Addio, Aragorn! Vai a Minas Tirith e salva il mio popolo!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'312fde14-9f26-4cc2-9986-4e06e84058d4\', \'multiverseId\': 617878}, \'multiverseid\': 617878}, {\'name\': \'塔の長官、ボロミア\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n対戦相手が呪文を唱えるたび、それを唱えるためにマナが支払われていない場合、その呪文を打ち消す。\\n塔の長官、ボロミアを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。指輪があなたを誘惑する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「さらばだ、アラゴルン！ミナス・ティリスへ行き、我が民を救ってくれ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'216080d7-1d4e-447e-b747-d0bf3ebb906c\', \'multiverseId\': 618139}, \'multiverseid\': 618139}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, Guardião da Torre\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nToda vez que um oponente conjurar uma mágica, se nenhum mana tiver sido gasto para conjurá-la, anule aquela mágica.\\nSacrifique Boromir, Guardião da Torre: As criaturas que você controla ganham indestrutível até o final do turno. O Anel tenta você.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Adeus, Aragorn! Vá para Minas Tirith e salve o meu povo!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f4855db-42d1-44d1-a7ce-e408f62ff2ee\', \'multiverseId\': 618400}, \'multiverseid\': 618400}, {\'name\': \'白塔守护波洛米尔\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n每当任一对手施放咒语，若施放它时未支付过法术力，则反击该咒语。\\n牺牲白塔守护波洛米尔：由你操控的生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。魔戒引诱你。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「别了，阿拉贡！去米那斯提力斯，拯救我的人民！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c58bd828-ad12-47c8-8f75-658b162f2ea8\', \'multiverseId\': 618661}, \'multiverseid\': 618661}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boromir, Wächter des Turms\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner einen Zauberspruch wirkt und falls für ihn beim Wirken kein Mana ausgegeben wurde, neutralisiere den Zauberspruch.\\nOpfere Boromir, Wächter des Turms: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Der Ring führt dich in Versuchung.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619482&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3648db8-b3e2-4f69-87a5-65de88cabe30\', \'multiverseId\': 619482}, \'multiverseid\': 619482}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, Guardián de la Torre\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nSiempre que un oponente lance un hechizo, si no se usó maná para lanzarlo, contrarresta ese hechizo.\\nSacrificar a Boromir, Guardián de la Torre: Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. El Anillo te tienta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aecb80d-a1a1-4f6e-8b0c-ce56c5103f9b\', \'multiverseId\': 619512}, \'multiverseid\': 619512}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, Gardien de la Tour\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort, si aucun mana n\'a été dépensé pour le lancer, contrecarrez ce sort.\\nSacrifiez Boromir, Gardien de la Tour : Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. L\'Anneau vous tente.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619542&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cea8d1a-f66f-4794-b8db-dce2f8ebed00\', \'multiverseId\': 619542}, \'multiverseid\': 619542}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, Guardiano della Torre\', \'text\': "Cautela\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario lancia una magia, se non è stato speso mana per lanciarla, neutralizza quella magia.\\nSacrifica Boromir, Guardiano della Torre: Le creature che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. L\'Anello ti tenta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1e35faa-013a-4251-a344-85a7f67a2079\', \'multiverseId\': 619572}, \'multiverseid\': 619572}, {\'name\': \'塔の長官、ボロミア\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n対戦相手が呪文を唱えるたび、それを唱えるためにマナが支払われていない場合、その呪文を打ち消す。\\n塔の長官、ボロミアを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。指輪があなたを誘惑する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'687d7bd5-0cc7-43ca-bfd3-a993300b6375\', \'multiverseId\': 619602}, \'multiverseid\': 619602}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, Guardião da Torre\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nToda vez que um oponente conjurar uma mágica, se nenhum mana tiver sido gasto para conjurá-la, anule aquela mágica.\\nSacrifique Boromir, Guardião da Torre: As criaturas que você controla ganham indestrutível até o final do turno. O Anel tenta você.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9544a7f9-09b3-42b6-997f-c31eb44d069d\', \'multiverseId\': 619632}, \'multiverseid\': 619632}, {\'name\': \'白塔守护波洛米尔\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n每当任一对手施放咒语，若施放它时未支付过法术力，则反击该咒语。\\n牺牲白塔守护波洛米尔：由你操控的生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。魔戒引诱你。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5654a47f-35ba-448f-b158-e41443f1c9ae\', \'multiverseId\': 619662}, \'multiverseid\': 619662}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boromir, Wächter des Turms\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner einen Zauberspruch wirkt und falls für ihn beim Wirken kein Mana ausgegeben wurde, neutralisiere den Zauberspruch.\\nOpfere Boromir, Wächter des Turms: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Der Ring führt dich in Versuchung.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619737&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa8c2093-b9e6-4dec-8bdf-664601f9040e\', \'multiverseId\': 619737}, \'multiverseid\': 619737}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, Guardián de la Torre\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nSiempre que un oponente lance un hechizo, si no se usó maná para lanzarlo, contrarresta ese hechizo.\\nSacrificar a Boromir, Guardián de la Torre: Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. El Anillo te tienta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4c5302a-19eb-45a0-a468-3f479ab21fd3\', \'multiverseId\': 619780}, \'multiverseid\': 619780}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, Gardien de la Tour\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort, si aucun mana n\'a été dépensé pour le lancer, contrecarrez ce sort.\\nSacrifiez Boromir, Gardien de la Tour : Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. L\'Anneau vous tente.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619823&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2a53a50-e17b-49d3-a4e6-4b3f85d01a51\', \'multiverseId\': 619823}, \'multiverseid\': 619823}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, Guardiano della Torre\', \'text\': "Cautela\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario lancia una magia, se non è stato speso mana per lanciarla, neutralizza quella magia.\\nSacrifica Boromir, Guardiano della Torre: Le creature che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. L\'Anello ti tenta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf29143e-0f96-4f64-8fc4-1b3d9db52230\', \'multiverseId\': 619866}, \'multiverseid\': 619866}, {\'name\': \'塔の長官、ボロミア\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n対戦相手が呪文を唱えるたび、それを唱えるためにマナが支払われていない場合、その呪文を打ち消す。\\n塔の長官、ボロミアを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。指輪があなたを誘惑する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'537c4492-1558-4344-9e51-de144350d704\', \'multiverseId\': 619909}, \'multiverseid\': 619909}, {\'name\': \'Boromir, Guardião da Torre\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nToda vez que um oponente conjurar uma mágica, se nenhum mana tiver sido gasto para conjurá-la, anule aquela mágica.\\nSacrifique Boromir, Guardião da Torre: As criaturas que você controla ganham indestrutível até o final do turno. O Anel tenta você.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92f9ba56-5bd2-4ea5-ab63-5aa8278886ee\', \'multiverseId\': 619952}, \'multiverseid\': 619952}, {\'name\': \'白塔守护波洛米尔\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n每当任一对手施放咒语，若施放它时未支付过法术力，则反击该咒语。\\n牺牲白塔守护波洛米尔：由你操控的生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。魔戒引诱你。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af2f992b-05a1-4d7a-a9f7-d26b312cb437\', \'multiverseId\': 619995}, \'multiverseid\': 619995}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boshaftes Banditentum\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Boshafte Banditentum ins Spiel kommt, fügt es jeder Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, sterben, erzeugst du einen Schatz-Spielstein. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Eine böse Tat bleibt nicht ungesühnt."\\n—Saruman\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617240&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ccdc64d-ec6f-4a30-9f58-de8908314bd5\', \'multiverseId\': 617240}, \'multiverseid\': 617240}, {\'name\': \'Saqueo malicioso\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Saqueo malicioso entre al campo de batalla, hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas que controlan tus oponentes mueran, creas una ficha de Tesoro. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Una mano lava la otra".\\n—Saruman\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65cc7d8b-765f-4977-a7d3-cb3d9ae84802\', \'multiverseId\': 617501}, \'multiverseid\': 617501}, {\'name\': \'Banditisme malveillant\', \'text\': "Quand le Banditisme malveillant arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige X blessures à chaque créature.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vos adversaires contrôlent meurt, vous créez un jeton Trésor. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Un mauvais tour en mérite un autre. »\\n—Saruman\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617762&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54edbd57-a910-4252-96a8-106e638f8cfe\', \'multiverseId\': 617762}, \'multiverseid\': 617762}, {\'name\': \'Brigantaggio Perfido\', \'text\': \'Quando il Brigantaggio Perfido entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge X danni a ogni creatura.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature controllate dai tuoi avversari muoiono, crei una pedina Tesoro. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Un\\\'azione malvagia ne genera un\\\'altra."\\n—Saruman\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76bbab24-0a21-41fe-8bf8-faf7512a3947\', \'multiverseId\': 618023}, \'multiverseid\': 618023}, {\'name\': \'悪辣な略奪\', \'text\': \'悪辣な略奪が戦場に出たとき、これは各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーが死亡するたび、あなたは宝物・トークン１つを生成する。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「一つの悪行は更なる悪意を呼ぶものだ。」\\n――サルマン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a42f053-4163-4384-868e-9617e6922b16\', \'multiverseId\': 618284}, \'multiverseid\': 618284}, {\'name\': \'Bandidagem Descarada\', \'text\': \'Quando Bandidagem Descarada entra no campo de batalha, ela causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura.\\nToda vez que uma ou mais criaturas que seus oponentes controlam morrem, você cria uma ficha de Tesouro. Esta habilidade é desencadeada apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma jogada suja merece outra."\\n— Saruman\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75ccbfec-eafc-4fa9-aadd-4117b42cd7ab\', \'multiverseId\': 618545}, \'multiverseid\': 618545}, {\'name\': \'怨毒行劫\', \'text\': \'当怨毒行劫进战场时，它对每个生物各造成X点伤害。\\n每当由对手操控的一个或数个生物死去时，你派出一个珍宝衍生物。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「居心不良者活该受罪。」\\n～萨茹曼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29606ae0-bd3f-474d-9eb6-25d30eb4be7f\', \'multiverseId\': 618806}, \'multiverseid\': 618806}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boshaftes Banditentum\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Boshafte Banditentum ins Spiel kommt, fügt es jeder Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, sterben, erzeugst du einen Schatz-Spielstein. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619769&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'364d22a6-688c-4d60-9439-938f05c5adb1\', \'multiverseId\': 619769}, \'multiverseid\': 619769}, {\'name\': \'Saqueo malicioso\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Saqueo malicioso entre al campo de batalla, hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas que controlan tus oponentes mueran, creas una ficha de Tesoro. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81b24566-2be0-42f3-8c45-d083de0f9300\', \'multiverseId\': 619812}, \'multiverseid\': 619812}, {\'name\': \'Banditisme malveillant\', \'text\': "Quand le Banditisme malveillant arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige X blessures à chaque créature.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vos adversaires contrôlent meurt, vous créez un jeton Trésor. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619855&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57aa748c-bb78-4712-9338-5a52e73f0c60\', \'multiverseId\': 619855}, \'multiverseid\': 619855}, {\'name\': \'Brigantaggio Perfido\', \'text\': \'Quando il Brigantaggio Perfido entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge X danni a ogni creatura.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature controllate dai tuoi avversari muoiono, crei una pedina Tesoro. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c341d2c5-5ffb-43af-a3b8-6af4a5e707da\', \'multiverseId\': 619898}, \'multiverseid\': 619898}, {\'name\': \'悪辣な略奪\', \'text\': \'悪辣な略奪が戦場に出たとき、これは各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーが死亡するたび、あなたは宝物・トークン１つを生成する。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f288d332-f218-4389-9ad4-223c6a09a815\', \'multiverseId\': 619941}, \'multiverseid\': 619941}, {\'name\': \'Bandidagem Descarada\', \'text\': \'Quando Bandidagem Descarada entra no campo de batalha, ela causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura.\\nToda vez que uma ou mais criaturas que seus oponentes controlam morrem, você cria uma ficha de Tesouro. Esta habilidade é desencadeada apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed00c6ed-8f60-4e08-9df3-27a56d055022\', \'multiverseId\': 619984}, \'multiverseid\': 619984}, {\'name\': \'怨毒行劫\', \'text\': \'当怨毒行劫进战场时，它对每个生物各造成X点伤害。\\n每当由对手操控的一个或数个生物死去时，你派出一个珍宝衍生物。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce40ed4b-3bf2-4c2f-bbf1-52c4a72d9028\', \'multiverseId\': 620027}, \'multiverseid\': 620027}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brandfackel des Waldläufers\', \'text\': \'Die Brandfackel des Waldläufers fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu. Der Ring führt dich in Versuchung.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Bleibt nah am Feuer und blickt nach außen! Nehmt einige der längeren Äste zur Hand!"\\n—Streicher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617234&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8e61b57-0e84-4615-953c-1a04ac53f8ec\', \'multiverseId\': 617234}, \'multiverseid\': 617234}, {\'name\': \'Tea del montaraz\', \'text\': \'La Tea del montaraz hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo. El Anillo te tienta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Acérquense todos hacia el fuego, mirando hacia fuera! ¡Preparen los palos más largos!".\\n—Trancos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edcab4e7-68cf-448b-9886-5d355eaec956\', \'multiverseId\': 617495}, \'multiverseid\': 617495}, {\'name\': \'Brandon du rôdeur\', \'text\': "Le Brandon du rôdeur inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible. L\'Anneau vous tente.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Restez près du feu, en lui tournant le dos ! Prenez les bâtons les plus longs et tenez-vous prêts ! »\\n—Grands-Pas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617756&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1891f66-7aef-45e8-83af-e811f9488579\', \'multiverseId\': 617756}, \'multiverseid\': 617756}, {\'name\': \'Tizzone del Ramingo\', \'text\': "Il Tizzone del Ramingo infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio. L\'Anello ti tenta.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"State vicini al fuoco e tenete gli occhi aperti! Preparate altri rami e tenetevi pronti!"\\n—Grampasso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4329f4d-d0d7-4dff-b2c9-b99e6899bd7a\', \'multiverseId\': 618017}, \'multiverseid\': 618017}, {\'name\': \'レンジャーの松明\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。レンジャーの松明はそれに２点のダメージを与える。指輪があなたを誘惑する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「火から離れず、顔は外に向けろ！長い棒を手にとるのだ！」\\n——馳夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85419546-4be1-459b-9d2f-23990782cba9\', \'multiverseId\': 618278}, \'multiverseid\': 618278}, {\'name\': \'Tição do Caminheiro\', \'text\': \'Tição do Caminheiro causa 2 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo. O Anel tenta você.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Fiquem perto do fogo, olhando para a frente! Preparem-se, peguem alguns dos galhos mais longos!"\\n— Passolargo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c592d3f-9015-43c1-b986-63e68951e9d8\', \'multiverseId\': 618539}, \'multiverseid\': 618539}, {\'name\': \'游民惹事\', \'text\': \'游民惹事对任意一个目标造成2点伤害。魔戒引诱你。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「全都靠近火堆，脸朝外侧！手里都拿好长点的木棍！」\\n～大步佬\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da23be01-e836-4298-a6e6-ae8dd20227fa\', \'multiverseId\': 618800}, \'multiverseid\': 618800}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brandywein-Bäuerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Brandywein-Bäuerin ins Spiel kommt oder das Spiel verlässt, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Halbling, Gesinde\', \'flavor\': \'„Euer Land muss ein Hort des Friedens und der Zufriedenheit sein, und eure Gärtner hoch angesehene Leute."\\n—Faramir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617246&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30b074f7-de8a-463d-aef4-0cbe9d78641e\', \'multiverseId\': 617246}, \'multiverseid\': 617246}, {\'name\': \'Granjera del Brandivino\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Granjera del Brandivino entre a o deje el campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Comida. (Es un artefacto con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Plebeyo mediano\', \'flavor\': \'"Vuestra tierra parece un remanso de paz y tranquilidad, e indudablemente estimáis a los jardineros".\\n—Faramir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75be5345-7f00-4453-92d7-e49062c2cea7\', \'multiverseId\': 617507}, \'multiverseid\': 617507}, {\'name\': \'Fermière du Brandevin\', \'text\': "Quand la Fermière du Brandevin arrive sur le champ de bataille ou le quitte, créez un jeton Nourriture. (C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)", \'type\': \'Créature : halfelin et paysan\', \'flavor\': \'« Votre pays doit être une terre de paix et de satisfaction, et les jardiniers doivent y être tenus en grand honneur. »\\n—Faramir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617768&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bdb77a3-6a0b-4b3e-bd23-27f17932b7e6\', \'multiverseId\': 617768}, \'multiverseid\': 617768}, {\'name\': \'Contadina del Brandivino\', \'text\': \'Quando la Contadina del Brandivino entra nel campo di battaglia o lo lascia, crea una pedina Cibo. (È un artefatto con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Popolano Halfling\', \'flavor\': \'"La tua terra deve essere un regno di pace e contentezza, dove i giardinieri devono godere di alta considerazione."\\n—Faramir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a1a56e5-e0ef-44d4-9e72-702f7cbbecd4\', \'multiverseId\': 618029}, \'multiverseid\': 618029}, {\'name\': \'ブランディワインの農民\', \'text\': \'ブランディワインの農民が戦場に出たか戦場を離れたとき、食物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハーフリング・農民\', \'flavor\': \'「そこは平和で喜び溢れる場所でなければならないだろう。そして気高い庭師も居なければならない。」\\n――ファラミア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'296d4202-a57b-4201-9343-3f67ca5c7f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 618290}, \'multiverseid\': 618290}, {\'name\': \'Fazendeira do Brandevin\', \'text\': \'Quando Fazendeira do Brandevin entrar no campo de batalha ou o deixar, crie uma ficha de Comida. (Ela é um artefato com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pequenino Plebeu\', \'flavor\': \'"Sua terra deve ser um reino de paz e contentamento, e lá os jardineiros devem ser da mais alta estima."\\n— Faramir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2495c19-bf93-412f-93e4-6f517740d0f0\', \'multiverseId\': 618551}, \'multiverseid\': 618551}, {\'name\': \'白兰地河农夫\', \'text\': \'当白兰地河农夫进入或离开战场时，派出一个食品衍生物。（它是具有「{2}，{T}，牺牲此神器：你获得3点生命」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半身人／平民\', \'flavor\': \'「想必你们的国度是个和平、快乐的地方，园丁在那一定备受敬重。」\\n～法拉米尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa0c90c4-ee3d-4a19-8a0a-51f9a290a874\', \'multiverseId\': 618812}, \'multiverseid\': 618812}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bruchtal\', \'text\': \'Bruchtal kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine legendäre Kreatur.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Hellsicht 2. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du eine legendäre Kreatur kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Könnte ich dorthin gehen, wo mein Herz verweilt, so würde ich jetzt durch das schöne Bruchtal streifen."\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617350&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb8c7e4f-b249-4dfe-9b99-daba9bdbd58a\', \'multiverseId\': 617350}, \'multiverseid\': 617350}, {\'name\': \'Rivendel\', \'text\': \'Rivendel entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles una criatura legendaria.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Adivina 2. Activa esto solo si controlas una criatura legendaria.\', \'type\': \'Tierra legendaria\', \'flavor\': \'"Si escuchara lo que dice mi corazón, estaría en este momento paseando por el hermoso valle de Rivendel".\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'341e4ae6-f3dd-44c5-a65d-2c727ad1a264\', \'multiverseId\': 617611}, \'multiverseid\': 617611}, {\'name\': \'Fondcombe\', \'text\': "Fondcombe arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez une créature légendaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\\n{1}{U}, {T} : Regard 2. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez une créature légendaire.", \'type\': \'Terrain légendaire\', \'flavor\': "« Si j\'allais où se trouve mon cœur, je me promènerais en ce moment dans la belle vallée de Fondcombe. »\\n—Aragorn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617872&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'812522a6-bb13-45f6-bf2b-770ac157ced8\', \'multiverseId\': 617872}, \'multiverseid\': 617872}, {\'name\': \'Gran Burrone\', \'text\': \'Gran Burrone entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli una creatura leggendaria.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Profetizza 2. Attiva solo se controlli una creatura leggendaria.\', \'type\': \'Terra Leggendaria\', \'flavor\': \'"Se potessi andare dove il mio cuore dimora, starei ora passeggiando nella valle serena di Gran Burrone."\\n—Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38d740ac-64a0-490b-bfc3-2f4625b09873\', \'multiverseId\': 618133}, \'multiverseid\': 618133}, {\'name\': \'裂け谷\', \'text\': \'あなたが伝説のクリーチャーをコントロールしていないかぎり、裂け谷はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\\n{1}{U}, {T}：占術２を行う。あなたが伝説のクリーチャーをコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'伝説の土地\', \'flavor\': \'「私が心に想う場所に行けるとしたら、今は裂け谷の丘を歩いていることだろう。」\\n——アラゴルン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32fbd860-86ac-4d96-9201-2f86958f523a\', \'multiverseId\': 618394}, \'multiverseid\': 618394}, {\'name\': \'Valfenda\', \'text\': \'Valfenda entra no campo de batalha virada, a menos que você controle uma criatura lendária.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Use vidência 2. Ative somente se você controlar uma criatura lendária.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'"Fosse eu para onde está meu coração, estaria agora vagando no belo vale de Valfenda."\\n— Aragorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5f3e98a-ca11-4f43-9642-2b47f00ce505\', \'multiverseId\': 618655}, \'multiverseid\': 618655}, {\'name\': \'幽谷\', \'text\': \'除非你操控传奇生物，否则幽谷须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}。\\n{1}{U}，{T}：占卜2。只能于你操控传奇生物时起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇地\', \'flavor\': \'「假如能前往一心牵挂之地，那我现在就会徜徉在幽谷美丽山峡间。」\\n～阿拉贡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3d3bf92-cd8b-46e3-8e9b-092aca9b1bec\', \'multiverseId\': 618916}, \'multiverseid\': 618916}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bruchtal\', \'text\': \'Bruchtal kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine legendäre Kreatur.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Hellsicht 2. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du eine legendäre Kreatur kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619089&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e030cef-dd07-4479-9aee-2975034314e1\', \'multiverseId\': 619089}, \'multiverseid\': 619089}, {\'name\': \'Rivendel\', \'text\': \'Rivendel entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles una criatura legendaria.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Adivina 2. Activa esto solo si controlas una criatura legendaria.\', \'type\': \'Tierra legendaria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af789ec3-ec80-44ef-b554-83bca0040cd1\', \'multiverseId\': 619095}, \'multiverseid\': 619095}, {\'name\': \'Fondcombe\', \'text\': "Fondcombe arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez une créature légendaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\\n{1}{U}, {T} : Regard 2. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez une créature légendaire.", \'type\': \'Terrain légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619101&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e6534ad-85ee-49c4-a947-b58bdcd7348a\', \'multiverseId\': 619101}, \'multiverseid\': 619101}, {\'name\': \'Gran Burrone\', \'text\': \'Gran Burrone entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli una creatura leggendaria.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Profetizza 2. Attiva solo se controlli una creatura leggendaria.\', \'type\': \'Terra Leggendaria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b780534-957b-4cf2-b44b-0edd01d7f298\', \'multiverseId\': 619107}, \'multiverseid\': 619107}, {\'name\': \'裂け谷\', \'text\': \'あなたが伝説のクリーチャーをコントロールしていないかぎり、裂け谷はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\\n{1}{U}, {T}：占術２を行う。あなたが伝説のクリーチャーをコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'伝説の土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d941f821-8a0c-43c2-a8a9-61f449854ff3\', \'multiverseId\': 619113}, \'multiverseid\': 619113}, {\'name\': \'Valfenda\', \'text\': \'Valfenda entra no campo de batalha virada, a menos que você controle uma criatura lendária.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Use vidência 2. Ative somente se você controlar uma criatura lendária.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fd2c0ca-8363-4b10-9767-9058fafeb3db\', \'multiverseId\': 619119}, \'multiverseid\': 619119}, {\'name\': \'幽谷\', \'text\': \'除非你操控传奇生物，否则幽谷须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}。\\n{1}{U}，{T}：占卜2。只能于你操控传奇生物时起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9dfbda1-cb92-4894-9906-165ebe6b1394\', \'multiverseId\': 619125}, \'multiverseid\': 619125}]', '[{\'name\': \'Buch von Mazarbul\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Ork-Aufmarsch 1. (Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Armee, die du kontrollierst. Sie ist auch ein Ork. Falls du keine Armee kontrollierst, erzeuge zuerst einen 0/0 schwarzen Ork-Armee-Kreaturenspielstein.)\\nII — Ork-Aufmarsch 2.\\nIII — Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0 und Bedrohlichkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617207&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d367fbd-8ffd-47c1-98a4-04d1314067fd\', \'multiverseId\': 617207}, \'multiverseid\': 617207}, {\'name\': \'Libro de Mazarbul\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Enrola 1 Orco. (Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre un Ejército que controlas. También es un Orco. Si no controlas un Ejército, crea primero una ficha de criatura Ejército Orco negra 0/0.)\\nII — Enrola 2 Orcos.\\nIII — Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+0 y ganan la habilidad de amenaza hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'093ad437-7ef4-412e-826d-eabcecdd9d48\', \'multiverseId\': 617468}, \'multiverseid\': 617468}, {\'name\': \'Livre de Mazarbul\', \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Amassez des orques 1. (Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une armée que vous contrôlez. C\'est aussi un orque. Si vous ne contrôlez pas d\'armée, créez d\'abord un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Orque et Armée.)\\nII — Amassez des orques 2.\\nIII — Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 et acquièrent la menace jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617729&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21ada26a-105d-43d5-a646-eb1720d47749\', \'multiverseId\': 617729}, \'multiverseid\': 617729}, {\'name\': \'Libro di Mazarbul\', \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Recluta Orchi 1. (Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su un Esercito che controlli. È anche un Orco. Se non controlli un Esercito, crea prima una pedina creatura Esercito Orco 0/0 nera.)\\nII — Recluta Orchi 2.\\nIII — Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+0 e hanno minacciare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f84a8019-ba98-4f16-a131-8c3774d60191\', \'multiverseId\': 617990}, \'multiverseid\': 617990}, {\'name\': \'マザルブルの書\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI — オーク動員１を行う。（あなたがコントロールしている軍団１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。それはオークでもある。あなたが軍団をコントロールしていないなら、その前に、黒の０/０のオーク・軍団・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。）\\nII — オーク動員２を行う。\\nIII — ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受け威迫を得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0472d8b8-e6f5-43cf-a0b8-3e12387ab1c3\', \'multiverseId\': 618251}, \'multiverseid\': 618251}, {\'name\': \'Livro de Mazarbul\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Arregimentar Orcs 1. (Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em um Exército que você controla. Ele também é um Orc. Se você não controlar um Exército, crie antes uma ficha de criatura Orc Exército preta 0/0.)\\nII — Arregimente Orcs 2.\\nIII — As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+0 e ganham ameaçar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'920be691-9bd7-4c5c-9a89-56638057b725\', \'multiverseId\': 618512}, \'multiverseid\': 618512}, {\'name\': \'马扎布尔之书\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 囤兵半兽人1。（在一个由你操控的军队上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它也是半兽人。如果你未操控军队，则先派出一个0/0黑色半兽人／军队衍生生物。）\\nI — 囤兵半兽人2。\\nIII — 直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+1/+0且获得威慑异能。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30f9d344-6d06-4619-8418-32f910c0ab9a\', \'multiverseId\': 618773}, \'multiverseid\': 618773}]', '[{\'name\': \'Butterblume, Wirt aus Bree\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du keine Speise kontrollierst, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Gesinde\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich hoffe, ihr habt es hier gemütlich. Ihr werdet sicher Abendessen wollen. Wann immer es euch passt. Erst einmal hier entlang!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617288&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36faee64-900d-44be-af64-3c115ec1af3e\', \'multiverseId\': 617288}, \'multiverseid\': 617288}, {\'name\': \'Mantecona, posadero de Bree\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, si no controlas una Comida, crea una ficha de Comida. (Es un artefacto con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Plebeyo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Espero que estén ustedes cómodos. Seguramente querrán cenar tan pronto como sea posible. ¡Síganme!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f27c9a7-f1b3-458b-b7ca-a524be5c6d80\', \'multiverseId\': 617549}, \'multiverseid\': 617549}, {\'name\': \'Poiredebeurré, aubergiste de Bree\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous ne contrôlez pas de nourriture, créez un jeton Nourriture. (C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et paysan\', \'flavor\': "« J\'espère que vous serez bien à votre aise. Vous voudrez souper, à n\'en pas douter. Dès que cela sera possible. Suivez-moi ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617810&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0881a899-0f70-4514-bec9-aa264cbb0087\', \'multiverseId\': 617810}, \'multiverseid\': 617810}, {\'name\': \'Omorzo, Locandiere di Bree\', \'text\': \'All\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se non controlli un Cibo, crea una pedina Cibo. (È un artefatto con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Popolano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Spero che vi troverete bene. Vorrete la cena, senza dubbio. Arriva subito. Venite!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d757f6b-e3b0-4075-b4da-1432d09e099c\', \'multiverseId\': 618071}, \'multiverseid\': 618071}, {\'name\': \'ブリー村の亭主、バタバー\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたが食物をコントロールしていない場合、食物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・農民\', \'flavor\': \'「遠慮なくくつろいでくれ。きっと、夕食も食べたい頃合いだろう？すぐに支度しておこう。さあこっちだ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20f62243-b8d6-4741-a6d6-52fc93558406\', \'multiverseId\': 618332}, \'multiverseid\': 618332}, {\'name\': \'Carrapicho, Estalajadeiro de Bree\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, se você não controlar uma Comida, crie uma ficha de Comida. (Ela é um artefato com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Plebeu\', \'flavor\': \'"Espero que vocês estejam confortáveis. Vocês vão querer ceia, sem dúvida. O quanto antes. Venham. Por aqui!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d33e9ed-2d5e-47fd-a4b4-1d5ca775b878\', \'multiverseId\': 618593}, \'multiverseid\': 618593}, {\'name\': \'布理客栈老板黄油菊\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，若你未操控食品，则派出一个食品衍生物。（它是具有「{2}，{T}，牺牲此神器：你获得3点生命」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／平民\', \'flavor\': \'「我希望你们住得舒服。你们一定想吃晚饭了吧。这就尽快送上。现请这边走！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dbb673c-e56a-4016-891c-4df77c68f8f8\', \'multiverseId\': 618854}, \'multiverseid\': 618854}]', '[{\'name\': \'Böses Ende\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nZiehe zwei Karten. Falls die geopferte Kreatur legendär war, ziehe stattdessen drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Und das war\\\'s. Ein böses Ende für Saruman und ich wünschte, ich hätte es nicht mitansehen müssen; aber gut, dass wir ihn los sind."\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617190&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01e47316-0c41-4b52-b65e-ddc291e7633d\', \'multiverseId\': 617190}, \'multiverseid\': 617190}, {\'name\': \'Final horrible\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una criatura.\\nRoba dos cartas. Si la criatura sacrificada era legendaria, en vez de eso, roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"He aquí el final de Saruman, un final horrible que desearía no haber visto, pero es una liberación".\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fce29de-bdae-4778-87f3-e150411ac221\', \'multiverseId\': 617451}, \'multiverseid\': 617451}, {\'name\': \'Sale fin\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez une créature.\\nPiochez deux cartes. Si la créature sacrifiée était légendaire, piochez trois cartes à la place.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Et c\'en est fini. C\'est une sale fin pour Saruman, et j\'aurais préféré ne pas avoir eu besoin d\'y assister ; mais bon débarras. »\\n—Sam", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617712&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39433689-60e9-4070-9911-319b2619befa\', \'multiverseId\': 617712}, \'multiverseid\': 617712}, {\'name\': \'Brutta Fine\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una creatura.\\nPesca due carte. Se la creatura sacrificata era leggendaria, pesca invece tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"E questa è la fine. Una brutta fine per Saruman e avrei preferito non vederla, ma è una liberazione."\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f5034df-ae8c-4b8d-86c6-7a323cda9d64\', \'multiverseId\': 617973}, \'multiverseid\': 617973}, {\'name\': \'悲惨な最期\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nカード２枚を引く。その生け贄に捧げたクリーチャーが伝説であったなら、代わりにカード３枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「これで終わりだ。サルマンの最期は目を逸らしたくなるような惨いものだったけれど、精々しただよ。」\\n――サム\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0414a7b2-0695-4169-a95e-a60379c2f205\', \'multiverseId\': 618234}, \'multiverseid\': 618234}, {\'name\': \'Fim Terrível\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, sacrifique uma criatura.\\nCompre dois cards. Se a criatura sacrificada era lendária, em vez disso, compre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"E esse é o fim. Um fim terrível para Saruman, e eu não queria ter precisado ver isso; mas já vai tarde."\\n— Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56cc0858-8c47-4751-8bd7-f7d870f29e71\', \'multiverseId\': 618495}, \'multiverseid\': 618495}, {\'name\': \'邋遢终局\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n抓两张牌。如果所牺牲的生物是传奇，则改为抓三张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「那事这样就算结束了。萨茹曼的下场真惨，我真希望没有看到那一幕；不过总算完了。」\\n～山姆\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5305a579-d2c7-4b7a-a59c-989cbfe68eaa\', \'multiverseId\': 618756}, \'multiverseid\': 618756}]', "[{'name': 'Böses Ende', 'text': 'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nZiehe zwei Karten. Falls die geopferte Kreatur legendär war, ziehe stattdessen drei Karten.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619746&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '015a9713-56e7-4707-ae5e-dec470afe087', 'multiverseId': 619746}, 'multiverseid': 619746}, {'name': 'Final horrible', 'text': 'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una criatura.\\nRoba dos cartas. Si la criatura sacrificada era legendaria, en vez de eso, roba tres cartas.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619789&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97e14472-4a5e-4efb-8ac9-58b12eeb804f', 'multiverseId': 619789}, 'multiverseid': 619789}, {'name': 'Sale fin', 'text': 'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez une créature.\\nPiochez deux cartes. Si la créature sacrifiée était légendaire, piochez trois cartes à la place.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619832&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4c636b5-c67b-4282-9c02-b7d587dc1a6c', 'multiverseId': 619832}, 'multiverseid': 619832}, {'name': 'Brutta Fine', 'text': 'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una creatura.\\nPesca due carte. Se la creatura sacrificata era leggendaria, pesca invece tre carte.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619875&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6e0d349-560e-4693-8ebf-0c65d3976dc9', 'multiverseId': 619875}, 'multiverseid': 619875}, {'name': '悲惨な最期', 'text': 'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nカード２枚を引く。その生け贄に捧げたクリーチャーが伝説であったなら、代わりにカード３枚を引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619918&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c3fdd6e8-dada-4ec8-a04d-62fe27221aae', 'multiverseId': 619918}, 'multiverseid': 619918}, {'name': 'Fim Terrível', 'text': 'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, sacrifique uma criatura.\\nCompre dois cards. Se a criatura sacrificada era lendária, em vez disso, compre três cards.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619961&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4e38127-64be-43a5-916a-3a79319444e6', 'multiverseId': 619961}, 'multiverseid': 619961}, {'name': '邋遢终局', 'text': '牺牲一个生物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n抓两张牌。如果所牺牲的生物是传奇，则改为抓三张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620004&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6bedf871-edcb-40f5-9f8f-2c932cb171d1', 'multiverseId': 620004}, 'multiverseid': 620004}]", '[{\'name\': \'Celeborn der Weise\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du mit einem oder mehreren Elfen angreifst, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\nImmer wenn du Hellsicht anwendest, erhält Celeborn der Weise für jede Karte, die du dir auf diese Weise mit Hellsicht angeschaut hast, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'Seine Augen waren scharf wie Lanzen im Sternenlicht und doch tief wie die Brunnen uralter Erinnerungen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617247&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d6b814e-8256-449e-be47-f13ab25f605f\', \'multiverseId\': 617247}, \'multiverseid\': 617247}, {\'name\': \'Celeborn, el Sabio\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ataques con uno o más Elfos, adivina 1.\\nSiempre que adivines, Celeborn, el Sabio obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno por cada carta que miraste mientras adivinabas de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Tenía unos ojos penetrantes como lanzas a la luz de las estrellas y, al mismo tiempo, profundos como pozos de recuerdos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'187419a0-1542-4c41-9ece-2743b9474788\', \'multiverseId\': 617508}, \'multiverseid\': 617508}, {\'name\': \'Celeborn le Sage\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous attaquez avec au moins un elfe, regard 1.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous appliquez le regard, Celeborn le Sage gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque carte que vous avez regardée en appliquant le regard de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et noble\', \'flavor\': \'Ses yeux étaient perçants comme des lances à la lumière des étoiles, et ils étaient profonds, tels des puits de souvenirs lointains.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617769&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'487455fb-3731-4dc5-b128-368422c67aff\', \'multiverseId\': 617769}, \'multiverseid\': 617769}, {\'name\': \'Celeborn il Saggio\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta attacchi con uno o più Elfi, profetizza 1.\\nOgniqualvolta profetizzi, Celeborn il Saggio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni carta guardata profetizzando in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'I suoi occhi erano affilati come lance alla luce delle stelle, eppure profondi come pozzi di antica memoria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'037bdff0-d777-4cc4-993d-57f1a05e581c\', \'multiverseId\': 618030}, \'multiverseid\': 618030}, {\'name\': \'賢者ケレボルン\', \'text\': \'あなたが１体以上のエルフで攻撃するたび、占術１を行う。\\nあなたが占術を行うたび、ターン終了時まで、賢者ケレボルンはこれにより占術を行っている間に見たカード１枚につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'彼の目は星夜に輝く槍のように鋭く、深く、そして多くの記憶に満ちていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'518d7045-d9cd-4242-928a-b0d28911f92e\', \'multiverseId\': 618291}, \'multiverseid\': 618291}, {\'name\': \'Celeborn, o Sábio\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você atacar com um ou mais Elfos, use vidência 1.\\nToda vez que você usa vidência, Celeborn, o Sábio, recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno para cada card olhado enquanto você usou vidência dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'Os olhos dele eram aguçados como lanças à luz das estrelas, mas ainda assim profundos, poços de longa memória.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce67fc98-c9e8-49a0-b7f2-cd39442fba52\', \'multiverseId\': 618552}, \'multiverseid\': 618552}, {\'name\': \'智者凯勒博恩\', \'text\': \'每当你以一个或数个妖精攻击时，占卜1。\\n每当你占卜时，以此法占卜期间每检视过一张牌，智者凯勒博恩便得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'他的双眼如星耀长枪般尖锐，又如记忆深井般深沉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'806d7110-e486-43e5-a4ab-fdd401f4e172\', \'multiverseId\': 618813}, \'multiverseid\': 618813}]', '[{\'name\': \'Crebain aus dem Dunland\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Crebain aus dem Dunland ins Spiel kommen, wende Ork-Aufmarsch 2 an. (Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Armee, die du kontrollierst. Sie ist auch ein Ork. Falls du keine Armee kontrollierst, erzeuge zuerst einen 0/0 schwarzen Ork-Armee-Kreaturenspielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': \'„Was ist das, Streicher? Das sieht nicht wie eine Wolke aus."\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617173&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2ebf1ae-bb2e-4c35-bb90-78d92bdb7482\', \'multiverseId\': 617173}, \'multiverseid\': 617173}, {\'name\': \'Crebain de las Tierras Brunas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Crebain de las Tierras Brunas entre al campo de batalla, enrola 2 Orcos. (Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre un Ejército que controlas. También es un Orco. Si no controlas un Ejército, crea primero una ficha de criatura Ejército Orco negra 0/0.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror ave\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Eso qué es, Trancos? No parece una nube".\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b82551d-bd12-47b1-997c-e25cfae29d69\', \'multiverseId\': 617434}, \'multiverseid\': 617434}, {\'name\': \'Crebain du Pays de Dun\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Crebain du Pays de Dun arrive sur le champ de bataille, amassez des orques 2. (Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une armée que vous contrôlez. C\'est aussi un orque. Si vous ne contrôlez pas d\'armée, créez d\'abord un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Orque et Armée.)", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et horreur\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'est-ce que c\'est que ça, Grand-Pas ? On ne dirait pas un nuage. »\\n—Sam", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617695&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c5c7ee1-a28c-4948-b611-3488b8d749ae\', \'multiverseId\': 617695}, \'multiverseid\': 617695}, {\'name\': \'Crebain di Dunland\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando i Crebain di Dunland entrano nel campo di battaglia, recluta Orchi 2. (Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su un Esercito che controlli. È anche un Orco. Se non controlli un Esercito, crea prima una pedina creatura Esercito Orco 0/0 nera.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"Cos\\\'è quello, Grampasso? Non mi sembra una nuvola."\\n—Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8a88f9f-2177-4413-997e-d8eee9e323f8\', \'multiverseId\': 617956}, \'multiverseid\': 617956}, {\'name\': \'褐色国のクレバイン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n褐色国のクレバインが戦場に出たとき、オーク動員２を行う。（あなたがコントロールしている軍団１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。それはオークでもある。あなたが軍団をコントロールしていないなら、その前に、黒の０/０のオーク・軍団・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・ホラー\', \'flavor\': \'「ストライダーさま、ありゃ何です？雲じゃなさそうですが。」\\n――サム\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4a0bc1f-98e3-421b-87fd-d13d046fade5\', \'multiverseId\': 618217}, \'multiverseid\': 618217}, {\'name\': \'Crebain da Terra Parda\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Crebain da Terra Parda entrar no campo de batalha, arregimente Orcs 2. (Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em um Exército que você controla. Ele também é um Orc. Se você não controlar um Exército, crie antes uma ficha de criatura Orc Exército preta 0/0.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Horror\', \'flavor\': \'"O que é aquilo, Passolargo? Não parece nuvem, não."\\n— Sam\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2065640c-55f5-4e5a-bb1f-2e375bdd43f6\', \'multiverseId\': 618478}, \'multiverseid\': 618478}, {\'name\': \'黑蛮地克拉班\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当黑蛮地克拉班进战场时，囤兵半兽人2。（在一个由你操控的军队上放置两个+1/+1指示物。它也是半兽人。如果你未操控军队，则先派出一个0/0黑色半兽人／军队衍生生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': \'「大步佬，那是什么？看起来不像是云。」\\n～山姆\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39267fa2-f33a-488d-ad88-2e144261669c\', \'multiverseId\': 618739}, \'multiverseid\': 618739}]', "[{'name': 'Crebain aus dem Dunland', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn die Crebain aus dem Dunland ins Spiel kommen, wende Ork-Aufmarsch 2 an.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Vogel, Schrecken', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619741&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df16807b-1a9b-4492-8cd2-f069a46083ff', 'multiverseId': 619741}, 'multiverseid': 619741}, {'name': 'Crebain de las Tierras Brunas', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCuando el Crebain de las Tierras Brunas entre al campo de batalla, enrola 2 Orcos.', 'type': 'Criatura — Horror ave', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619784&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da410e9e-cab9-4734-a09c-207c2c830ae2', 'multiverseId': 619784}, 'multiverseid': 619784}, {'name': 'Crebain du Pays de Dun', 'text': 'Vol\\nQuand le Crebain du Pays de Dun arrive sur le champ de bataille, amassez des orques 2.', 'type': 'Créature : oiseau et horreur', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619827&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '462d6d3f-8806-409d-8c25-6d659ad30071', 'multiverseId': 619827}, 'multiverseid': 619827}, {'name': 'Crebain di Dunland', 'text': 'Volare\\nQuando i Crebain di Dunland entrano nel campo di battaglia, recluta Orchi 2.', 'type': 'Creatura — Orrore Uccello', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619870&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65fc01a1-0fee-4fc0-ab80-cb13c35cde0f', 'multiverseId': 619870}, 'multiverseid': 619870}, {'name': '褐色国のクレバイン', 'text': '飛行\\n褐色国のクレバインが戦場に出たとき、オーク動員２を行う。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鳥・ホラー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619913&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b8dfa7d-a450-46cd-98d9-8c8d84a2aa14', 'multiverseId': 619913}, 'multiverseid': 619913}, {'name': 'Crebain da Terra Parda', 'text': 'Voar\\nQuando Crebain da Terra Parda entrar no campo de batalha, arregimente Orcs 2.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ave Horror', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619956&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6da54a06-a1e5-4312-8f17-b9883ec3cfe7', 'multiverseId': 619956}, 'multiverseid': 619956}, {'name': '黑蛮地克拉班', 'text': '飞行\\n当黑蛮地克拉班进战场时，囤兵半兽人2。', 'type': '生物 ～鸟／惊惧兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619999&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a894906-938c-438b-bb39-dfd392ea405b', 'multiverseId': 619999}, 'multiverseid': 619999}]", '[{\'name\': \'Das Auenland\', \'text\': \'Das Auenland kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine legendäre Kreatur.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, tappe eine ungetappte Kreatur, die du kontrollierst: Erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Irgendwo muss man sich niederlassen und Wurzeln schlagen, und die Erde des Auenlands ist tief."\\n—Merry\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617351&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'819b7223-8e8a-4ced-af19-48998cc6b1b9\', \'multiverseId\': 617351}, \'multiverseid\': 617351}, {\'name\': \'La Comarca\', \'text\': \'La Comarca entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles una criatura legendaria.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, girar una criatura enderezada que controlas: Crea una ficha de Comida.\', \'type\': \'Tierra legendaria\', \'flavor\': \'"Es necesario empezar por algo y echar raíces, y el suelo de la Comarca es profundo".\\n—Merry\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ecde916-74ca-4348-af53-a90aa201435c\', \'multiverseId\': 617612}, \'multiverseid\': 617612}, {\'name\': \'La Comté\', \'text\': \'La Comté arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez une créature légendaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, engagez une créature dégagée que vous contrôlez : Créez un jeton Nourriture.\', \'type\': \'Terrain légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'« Il faut commencer quelque part, et avoir des racines, et la terre de la Comté est profonde. »\\n—Merry\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617873&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18dc2529-6f48-427a-9e9a-30c758cc8cc4\', \'multiverseId\': 617873}, \'multiverseid\': 617873}, {\'name\': \'La Contea\', \'text\': \'La Contea entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli una creatura leggendaria.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, TAPpa una creatura STAPpata che controlli: Crea una pedina Cibo.\', \'type\': \'Terra Leggendaria\', \'flavor\': \'"Da qualche parte bisogna mettere le radici e il terreno della Contea è profondo."\\n—Merry\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5169141f-a519-4c2c-8521-5c4069484d83\', \'multiverseId\': 618134}, \'multiverseid\': 618134}, {\'name\': \'ホビット庄\', \'text\': \'あなたが伝説のクリーチャーをコントロールしていないかぎり、ホビット庄はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}を加える。\\n{1}{G}, {T}, あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるクリーチャー１体をタップする：食物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説の土地\', \'flavor\': \'「始めるにしても、しっかり根を張れる場所じゃないと。このホビット庄の土は深く豊かなんだ。」\\n――メリー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95b71206-5c6a-4642-b9ae-1cc4d444d43b\', \'multiverseId\': 618395}, \'multiverseid\': 618395}, {\'name\': \'O Condado\', \'text\': \'O Condado entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle uma criatura lendária.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, vire uma criatura desvirada que você controla: Crie uma ficha de Comida.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'"Você precisa começar de algum lugar e criar raízes, e o solo do Condado é profundo."\\n— Merry\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78f81ca2-2977-4628-a0d3-e29e1f1914c4\', \'multiverseId\': 618656}, \'multiverseid\': 618656}, {\'name\': \'夏尔\', \'text\': \'除非你操控传奇生物，否则夏尔须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}。\\n{1}{G}，{T}，横置一个由你操控且未横置的生物：派出一个食品衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇地\', \'flavor\': \'「你必须有个起步的地方，扎下些根，而夏尔的土壤是很深的。」\\n～梅里\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06755d86-b8aa-4f70-91a7-c638d23464ac\', \'multiverseId\': 618917}, \'multiverseid\': 618917}]', "[{'name': 'Das Auenland', 'text': 'Das Auenland kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine legendäre Kreatur.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, tappe eine ungetappte Kreatur, die du kontrollierst: Erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein.', 'type': 'Legendäres Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619090&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3f7dd564-57f8-4a0e-a038-1808e0c7f700', 'multiverseId': 619090}, 'multiverseid': 619090}, {'name': 'La Comarca', 'text': 'La Comarca entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles una criatura legendaria.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, girar una criatura enderezada que controlas: Crea una ficha de Comida.', 'type': 'Tierra legendaria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619096&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83508d78-ee54-42f4-bbdc-d80255362f6c', 'multiverseId': 619096}, 'multiverseid': 619096}, {'name': 'La Comté', 'text': 'La Comté arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez une créature légendaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, engagez une créature dégagée que vous contrôlez : Créez un jeton Nourriture.', 'type': 'Terrain légendaire', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619102&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '260ffe2a-3b9a-462c-afd9-4a6246401709', 'multiverseId': 619102}, 'multiverseid': 619102}, {'name': 'La Contea', 'text': 'La Contea entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli una creatura leggendaria.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, TAPpa una creatura STAPpata che controlli: Crea una pedina Cibo.', 'type': 'Terra Leggendaria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619108&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2217cdb-e5cd-4cac-a043-480e051e9645', 'multiverseId': 619108}, 'multiverseid': 619108}, {'name': 'ホビット庄', 'text': 'あなたが伝説のクリーチャーをコントロールしていないかぎり、ホビット庄はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}を加える。\\n{1}{G}, {T}, あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるクリーチャー１体をタップする：食物・トークン１つを生成する。', 'type': '伝説の土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619114&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '388a8149-5867-4160-85a1-3bacb29a9c3a', 'multiverseId': 619114}, 'multiverseid': 619114}, {'name': 'O Condado', 'text': 'O Condado entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle uma criatura lendária.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}.\\n{1}{G}, {T}, vire uma criatura desvirada que você controla: Crie uma ficha de Comida.', 'type': 'Terreno Lendário', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619120&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd51eca6d-ddb6-4b72-9562-0fc1cf0ced6a', 'multiverseId': 619120}, 'multiverseid': 619120}, {'name': '夏尔', 'text': '除非你操控传奇生物，否则夏尔须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}。\\n{1}{G}，{T}，横置一个由你操控且未横置的生物：派出一个食品衍生物。', 'type': '传奇地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619126&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb1e9211-630f-4b93-9498-feeea7cedb88', 'multiverseId': 619126}, 'multiverseid': 619126}]", '[{\'name\': \'Das Badelied\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI, II — Ziehe zwei Karten und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\\nIII — Mische eine beliebige Anzahl an Karten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof in deine Bibliothek. Erzeuge {U}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617131&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b69a769d-1cb4-4f2f-af41-6d9a104cf7ad\', \'multiverseId\': 617131}, \'multiverseid\': 617131}, {\'name\': \'La canción de baño\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI, II — Roba dos cartas, luego descarta una carta.\\nIII — Baraja cualquier cantidad de cartas objetivo de tu cementerio en tu biblioteca. Agrega {U}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55c9fe1c-db83-4164-98d5-d67e95c45ee6\', \'multiverseId\': 617392}, \'multiverseid\': 617392}, {\'name\': \'La chanson de bain\', \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI, II — Piochez deux cartes, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nIII — Mélangez n\'importe quel nombre de cartes ciblées depuis votre cimetière dans votre bibliothèque. Ajoutez {U}{U}.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617653&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35a10521-e8bb-4d2b-9921-ff79095d458a\', \'multiverseId\': 617653}, \'multiverseid\': 617653}, {\'name\': \'La Canzone del Bagno\', \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI, II — Pesca due carte, poi scarta una carta.\\nIII — Rimescola nel tuo grimorio un qualsiasi numero di carte bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Aggiungi {U}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2703f10-ec17-4350-b3c6-f2ba50dfb2dd\', \'multiverseId\': 617914}, \'multiverseid\': 617914}, {\'name\': \'湯浴み歌\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI, II — カード２枚を引く。その後、カード１枚を捨てる。\\nIII — あなたの墓地にある望む枚数のカードを対象とする。それらをあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。{U}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb779120-ce14-4630-ba32-28ecfda079f1\', \'multiverseId\': 618175}, \'multiverseid\': 618175}, {\'name\': \'A Canção do Banho\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI, II — Compre dois cards e depois descarte um card.\\nIII — Embaralhe qualquer número de cards alvo de seu cemitério em seu grimório. Adicione {U}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88dc0ac7-8aec-4496-a4d7-8b6b0ad0efa5\', \'multiverseId\': 618436}, \'multiverseid\': 618436}, {\'name\': \'洗澡歌\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI, II — 抓两张牌，然后弃一张牌。\\nIII — 将任意数量的目标牌从你的坟墓场洗入你的牌库。加{U}{U}。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b0cff00-788d-425f-8a3c-3effaa9ee539\', \'multiverseId\': 618697}, \'multiverseid\': 618697}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Boten täuschen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -3/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nOrk-Aufmarsch 1. (Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Armee, die du kontrollierst. Sie ist auch ein Ork. Falls du keine Armee kontrollierst, erzeuge zuerst einen 0/0 schwarzen Ork-Armee-Kreaturenspielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Sag Gandalf, dass er auf der Stelle um meine Hilfe ersuchen muss."\\n—Saruman\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617138&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c29842c1-2356-4a6c-b62d-bef0d8160d3a\', \'multiverseId\': 617138}, \'multiverseid\': 617138}, {\'name\': \'Engañar al mensajero\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -3/-0 hasta el final del turno.\\nEnrola 1 Orco. (Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre un Ejército que controlas. También es un Orco. Si no controlas un Ejército, crea primero una ficha de criatura Ejército Orco negra 0/0.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dile a Gandalf que busque mi ayuda de inmediato".\\n—Saruman\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff47f077-f032-4855-bdda-5af2fcf3166f\', \'multiverseId\': 617399}, \'multiverseid\': 617399}, {\'name\': \'Tromper le messager\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne -3/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nAmassez des orques 1. (Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une armée que vous contrôlez. C\'est aussi un orque. Si vous ne contrôlez pas d\'armée, créez d\'abord un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Orque et Armée.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Dites à Gandalf qu\'il doit quérir mon aide sur le champ. »\\n—Saruman", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617660&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6636b613-7000-4089-87da-098ead390603\', \'multiverseId\': 617660}, \'multiverseid\': 617660}, {\'name\': \'Ingannare il Messaggero\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -3/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nRecluta Orchi 1. (Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su un Esercito che controlli. È anche un Orco. Se non controlli un Esercito, crea prima una pedina creatura Esercito Orco 0/0 nera.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Riferisci a Gandalf di cercare subito il mio aiuto."\\n—Saruman\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58d41aa5-08e6-400c-aeb8-afda2568e52a\', \'multiverseId\': 617921}, \'multiverseid\': 617921}, {\'name\': \'使者を欺く\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－３/－０の修整を受ける。\\nオーク動員１を行う。（あなたがコントロールしている軍団１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。それはオークでもある。あなたが軍団をコントロールしていないなら、その前に、黒の０/０のオーク・軍団・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ガンダルフに直ちに私の元へ来いと伝えろ。」\\n――サルマン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71eea0b7-7e29-4a38-a034-0bf9a2647748\', \'multiverseId\': 618182}, \'multiverseid\': 618182}, {\'name\': \'Enganar o Mensageiro\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -3/-0 até o final do turno.\\nArregimente Orcs 1. (Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em um Exército que você controla. Ele também é um Orc. Se você não controlar um Exército, crie antes uma ficha de criatura Orc Exército preta 0/0.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Diga a Gandalf que ele deve buscar meu auxílio imediatamente."\\n— Saruman\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3538a44b-0f56-47ba-b088-fded3991f5e4\', \'multiverseId\': 618443}, \'multiverseid\': 618443}, {\'name\': \'欺骗信使\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-3/-0直到回合结束。\\n囤兵半兽人1。（在一个由你操控的军队上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它也是半兽人。如果你未操控军队，则先派出一个0/0黑色半兽人／军队衍生生物。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「告诉甘道夫：他必须马上寻求我的援助。」\\n～萨茹曼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a0a1b74-7b2a-4d43-a485-34cf68c986c0\', \'multiverseId\': 618704}, \'multiverseid\': 618704}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Feind herausfordern\', \'text\': \'Bringe einen Zauberspruch oder eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, und den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, auf die Hand seines bzw. ihres Besitzers zurück. Du kannst einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei mit gleichem oder niedrigerem Manabetrag aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne seine bzw. ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich offenbarte ihm die neu geschmiedete Klinge. Noch ist er nicht so mächtig, dass er keine Furcht mehr kennt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617156&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2613ac5-ebdf-4381-8e8d-143329d6d095\', \'multiverseId\': 617156}, \'multiverseid\': 617156}, {\'name\': \'Presionar al enemigo\', \'text\': \'Regresa el hechizo o permanente que no sea tierra objetivo que controla un oponente a la mano de su propietario. Puedes lanzar un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro con valor de maná igual o menor desde tu mano sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le mostré la hoja que fue forjada de nuevo. Aún no tiene suficiente poder como para ser insensible al temor".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'924985b2-42cd-407d-9cf3-574812d5d001\', \'multiverseId\': 617417}, \'multiverseid\': 617417}, {\'name\': "Pression sur l\'ennemi", \'text\': "Renvoyez un permanent non-terrain ou un sort ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle dans la main de son propriétaire. Vous pouvez lancer un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je lui ai montré la lame reforgée. Il n\'est pas encore assez puissant pour être au-dessus de la peur. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617678&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'153254a7-9205-4eb2-864b-80050739eeef\', \'multiverseId\': 617678}, \'multiverseid\': 617678}, {\'name\': \'Incalzare il Nemico\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare una magia o un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario in mano al suo proprietario. Puoi lanciare una magia istantaneo o stregoneria con valore di mana pari o inferiore dalla tua mano senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli mostrai la lama riforgiata. Nemmeno la sua potenza gli impedisce di provare paura."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d723e70-a875-46cd-af5f-18a9a27210db\', \'multiverseId\': 617939}, \'multiverseid\': 617939}, {\'name\': \'敵の徴用\', \'text\': \'呪文や、土地でないパーマネントのうち、対戦相手がコントロールしている１つを対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。あなたは、あなたの手札からマナ総量がそれ以下でありインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「鍛え直された剣を見せてやった。恐れを乗り越えられるほど、奴はまだ強大ではないようだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c52c714e-90c5-4284-a7e5-0e2e2bb940b6\', \'multiverseId\': 618200}, \'multiverseid\': 618200}, {\'name\': \'Pressionar o Inimigo\', \'text\': \'Devolva a mágica ou permanente não de terreno alvo que um oponente controla para a mão de seu dono. Você pode conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou feitiço com valor de mana igual ou inferior de sua mão sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu mostrei a espada reforjada a ele. Ele ainda não é poderoso o suficiente para estar acima do medo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3d655f1-acf1-4ea3-aadf-6f3825e47d60\', \'multiverseId\': 618461}, \'multiverseid\': 618461}, {\'name\': \'压制敌军\', \'text\': \'将目标由对手操控的咒语或非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。你可以从你手上施放一个法术力值相等或较小的瞬间或法术咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我向他展示了重铸的剑。他还没有强大到无所畏惧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17f5cfa2-0044-44b6-946b-9dfce778fb47\', \'multiverseId\': 618722}, \'multiverseid\': 618722}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Feind herausfordern\', \'text\': \'Bringe einen Zauberspruch oder eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, und den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, auf die Hand seines bzw. ihres Besitzers zurück. Du kannst einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei mit gleichem oder niedrigerem Manabetrag aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne seine bzw. ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich offenbarte ihm die neu geschmiedete Klinge. Noch ist er nicht so mächtig, dass er keine Furcht mehr kennt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619198&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9175ab4-9d3d-401e-a80a-7be85db0a881\', \'multiverseId\': 619198}, \'multiverseid\': 619198}, {\'name\': "Pression sur l\'ennemi", \'text\': "Renvoyez un permanent non-terrain ou un sort ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle dans la main de son propriétaire. Vous pouvez lancer un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je lui ai montré la lame reforgée. Il n\'est pas encore assez puissant pour être au-dessus de la peur. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619235&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cf8e073-6c38-4abc-bdf8-9ae06328c583\', \'multiverseId\': 619235}, \'multiverseid\': 619235}, {\'name\': \'敵の徴用\', \'text\': \'呪文や、土地でないパーマネントのうち、対戦相手がコントロールしている１つを対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。あなたは、あなたの手札からマナ総量がそれ以下でありインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「鍛え直された剣を見せてやった。恐れを乗り越えられるほど、奴はまだ強大ではないようだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc5c9996-4b3a-4cb0-9759-c263b8bd71b1\', \'multiverseId\': 619272}, \'multiverseid\': 619272}, {\'name\': \'压制敌军\', \'text\': \'将目标由对手操控的咒语或非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。你可以从你手上施放一个法术力值相等或较小的瞬间或法术咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我向他展示了重铸的剑。他还没有强大到无所畏惧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0066b9ff-f937-4491-b210-ab492276581b\', \'multiverseId\': 619309}, \'multiverseid\': 619309}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Ring anstecken\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du besitzt, ins Exil und bringe sie dann unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück. Der Ring führt dich in Versuchung.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Wie war er an seinen Finger gelangt? Er fragte sich, ob der Ring selbst ihm wohl einen Streich gespielt hatte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617122&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0b334b7-782c-4756-a067-adb21089b00b\', \'multiverseId\': 617122}, \'multiverseid\': 617122}, {\'name\': \'Ponerse el Anillo\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo de la cual eres propietario, luego regrésala al campo de batalla bajo tu control. El Anillo te tienta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'¿Cómo le había llegado al dedo? Se preguntó si el Anillo le había jugado una mala pasada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35fdc602-74c5-43df-bb47-2bcfe4fd9a12\', \'multiverseId\': 617383}, \'multiverseid\': 617383}, {\'name\': "Enfiler l\'Anneau", \'text\': "Exilez une créature ciblée que vous possédez, puis renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle. L\'Anneau vous tente.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Comment était-il arrivé à son doigt ? Il se demanda si l\'Anneau lui-même ne lui avait pas joué un tour à sa façon.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617644&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'344d444c-11f0-4df7-8997-c09ad88e887d\', \'multiverseId\': 617644}, \'multiverseid\': 617644}, {\'name\': "Indossare l\'Anello", \'text\': "Esilia una creatura bersaglio che possiedi, poi rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo. L\'Anello ti tenta.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Com\'era finito al suo dito? Si chiese se l\'Anello stesso non gli avesse giocato un brutto scherzo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecdbaada-dbc7-4a5c-8259-83298a34bfb9\', \'multiverseId\': 617905}, \'multiverseid\': 617905}, {\'name\': \'指輪嵌め\', \'text\': \'あなたがオーナーであるクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放し、その後、あなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。指輪があなたを誘惑する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'どうやって指輪が指に嵌ったのだろう？まるで指輪が意図したかのようだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'591ab013-0e97-48d4-88d5-0779d0174ecc\', \'multiverseId\': 618166}, \'multiverseid\': 618166}, {\'name\': \'Colocar o Anel\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura alvo que você possui e depois a devolva ao campo de batalha sob seu controle. O Anel tenta você.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Como é que ele tinha ido parar no dedo dele? Ele se perguntou se o próprio Anel não lhe havia pregado uma peça.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbd69fb7-8204-4065-8c82-6a45a3753970\', \'multiverseId\': 618427}, \'multiverseid\': 618427}, {\'name\': \'误戴魔戒\', \'text\': \'放逐目标由你拥有的生物，然后将它在你的操控下移回战场。魔戒引诱你。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'这是怎么戴到他手指上去的？他在想是不是戒指本身就在作弄他。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5de7db38-f39a-46be-a693-5a85c5b85b00\', \'multiverseId\': 618688}, \'multiverseid\': 618688}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Schatz beanspruchen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Der Ring führt dich in Versuchung.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Für mich ist es eine traurige Geschichte; und sie hätte auch anderen geschehen können, selbst einigen Hobbits, die ich kannte."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617172&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f458142d-3123-460d-b2cb-ba537aaf2870\', \'multiverseId\': 617172}, \'multiverseid\': 617172}, {\'name\': \'Conseguir el Tesoro\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo. El Anillo te tienta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Creo que es una historia triste que podría haber ocurrido a otros, incluso a algunos hobbits que conozco".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf1f1c6c-a86e-4e5a-8f61-4b8e579a5cc9\', \'multiverseId\': 617433}, \'multiverseid\': 617433}, {\'name\': "S\'emparer du trésor", \'text\': "Détruisez une créature ciblée. L\'Anneau vous tente.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Je pense que c\'est une triste histoire, et qu\'elle aurait pu arriver à d\'autres, y compris à des hobbits que j\'ai connus. »\\n—Gandalf", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617694&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bea2a58-073f-4164-acd5-3b5925d43dbe\', \'multiverseId\': 617694}, \'multiverseid\': 617694}, {\'name\': \'Reclamare il Tesoro\', \'text\': "Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. L\'Anello ti tenta.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ritengo sia una storia triste, probabilmente accaduta anche ad altri, persino a certi Hobbit di mia conoscenza."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bb2225e-8a5d-4f95-9637-18e16ac0d51a\', \'multiverseId\': 617955}, \'multiverseid\': 617955}, {\'name\': \'いとしいものを取り返す\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。指輪があなたを誘惑する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「悲しき話かな。これは誰の身にも起こり得たことだ。わしの知るホビットだったかも知れぬ。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fbdb903-47c9-436a-bb4d-d177039829ba\', \'multiverseId\': 618216}, \'multiverseid\': 618216}, {\'name\': \'Reivindicar o Precioso\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo. O Anel tenta você.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu acho que é uma história triste, e poderia ter acontecido com outros, até mesmo com alguns Hobbits que eu conheci."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ae96ddc-1b05-4a6f-9065-a6114bf53613\', \'multiverseId\': 618477}, \'multiverseid\': 618477}, {\'name\': \'收获宝贝\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物。魔戒引诱你。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我认为这是个悲伤的故事。它可能发生在其他人身上，甚至在某些我认识的霍比特人身上。」\\n～甘道夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72e15b0a-d77b-4fb9-9c51-5ab7e1b5952b\', \'multiverseId\': 618738}, \'multiverseid\': 618738}]', '[{\'name\': \'Denethor, Herrschender Truchsess\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle gestorben ist, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{2}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Jeder Gegner verliert 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Im Krieg muss viel aufs Spiel gesetzt werden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617289&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89917f6d-19fe-4ccd-86c9-eee00b130801\', \'multiverseId\': 617289}, \'multiverseid\': 617289}, {\'name\': \'Denethor, senescal regente\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, si una criatura murió bajo tu control este turno, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado Humano blanca 1/1.\\n{2}, sacrificar otra criatura: Cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble humano\', \'flavor\': \'"En la guerra se debe arriesgar mucho".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc9e2e1f-e320-4623-8ce0-7cb311bb1519\', \'multiverseId\': 617550}, \'multiverseid\': 617550}, {\'name\': \'Denethor, surintendant gouvernant\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre étape de fin, si une créature est morte sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.\\n{2}, sacrifiez une autre créature : Chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': \'« Beaucoup doit être risqué à la guerre. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617811&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d9081c3-bc6f-400a-9ca6-56f29e75804c\', \'multiverseId\': 617811}, \'multiverseid\': 617811}, {\'name\': \'Denethor, Sovrintendente Regnante\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se una creatura è morta sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianca.\\n{2}, Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: Ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"In guerra i rischi sono molti."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b01886c0-aa7d-4a78-b26e-c55cb195ec26\', \'multiverseId\': 618072}, \'multiverseid\': 618072}, {\'name\': \'統治する執政、デネソール\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で死亡していた場合、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{2}, これでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「戦ではあらゆる危険を冒さねばならない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7918f4b3-2afd-4b12-8662-58f1bb69d568\', \'multiverseId\': 618333}, \'multiverseid\': 618333}, {\'name\': \'Denethor, Regente Governante\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, se uma criatura tiver morrido sob seu controle neste turno, crie uma ficha de criatura Humano Soldado branca 1/1.\\n{2}, sacrifique outra criatura: Cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Nobre\', \'flavor\': \'"Muito precisa ser arriscado na guerra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b610743-fc47-4ebc-a83a-98f18d1ae7b5\', \'multiverseId\': 618594}, \'multiverseid\': 618594}, {\'name\': \'执政宰相德内梭尔\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，若本回合中有生物在你的操控下死去，则派出一个1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物。\\n{2}，牺牲另一个生物：每位对手各失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「战争中必须冒很多险。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01ae7f4f-2f9a-48a2-a24f-f91863eb5650\', \'multiverseId\': 618855}, \'multiverseid\': 618855}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Alte Weidenmann\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft des Alten Weidenmanns sind gleich der Anzahl an Ländern, die du kontrollierst.\\nImmer wenn der Alte Weidenmann angreift, kannst du eine andere Kreatur oder einen Spielstein opfern. Wenn du dies tust, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Baumhirte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617308&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d52fbe51-c9a5-48de-b378-4b097127f5e6\', \'multiverseId\': 617308}, \'multiverseid\': 617308}, {\'name\': \'El viejo Hombre-Sauce\', \'text\': \'Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia de El viejo Hombre-Sauce son iguales a la cantidad de tierras que controlas.\\nSiempre que El viejo Hombre-Sauce ataque, puedes sacrificar otra criatura o una ficha. Cuando lo hagas, la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente obtiene -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pueblo-arbóreo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8193acdd-4c58-4797-bdab-4af5440b24da\', \'multiverseId\': 617569}, \'multiverseid\': 617569}, {\'name\': \'Vieil Homme-Saule\', \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance du Vieil Homme-Saule sont chacune égales au nombre de terrains que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Vieil Homme-Saule attaque, vous pouvez sacrifier une autre créature ou un jeton. Quand vous faites ainsi, une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle gagne -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : sylvin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617830&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17e97d0e-240a-4007-866c-7ed4d16ce8f8\', \'multiverseId\': 617830}, \'multiverseid\': 617830}, {\'name\': \'Vecchio Salice\', \'text\': "La forza e la costituzione di Vecchio Salice sono pari al numero di terre che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta Vecchio Salice attacca, puoi sacrificare un\'altra creatura o una pedina. Quando lo fai, una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario prende -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Silvantropo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f65cb077-e03b-4dcb-b5ab-f14695175ee0\', \'multiverseId\': 618091}, \'multiverseid\': 618091}, {\'name\': \'柳じじい\', \'text\': \'柳じじいのパワーとタフネスはそれぞれ、あなたがコントロールしている土地の数に等しい。\\n柳じじいが攻撃するたび、あなたはこれでないクリーチャー１体かトークン１つを生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ツリーフォーク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2406226e-ee50-41c7-aa21-2d621455b296\', \'multiverseId\': 618352}, \'multiverseid\': 618352}, {\'name\': \'Velho Salgueiro-homem\', \'text\': \'O poder e a resistência de Velho Salgueiro-homem são ambos iguais ao número de terrenos que você controla.\\nToda vez que Velho Salgueiro-homem ataca, você pode sacrificar outra criatura ou uma ficha. Quando você faz isso, a criatura alvo que um oponente controla recebe -2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Ent\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f175ce9-eec1-431b-992d-37612ac1fc9b\', \'multiverseId\': 618613}, \'multiverseid\': 618613}, {\'name\': \'柳树老头儿\', \'text\': \'柳树老头儿的力量和防御力各等同于由你操控的地数量。\\n每当柳树老头儿攻击时，你可以牺牲另一个生物或一个衍生物。当你如此作时，目标由对手操控的生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～树妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f0629a0-ca79-4e1b-a4c8-7cf54ec55714\', \'multiverseId\': 618874}, \'multiverseid\': 618874}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Balrog, Durins Fluch\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede bleibende Karte, die in diesem Zug geopfert wurde, {1} weniger.\\nEile\\nDer Balrog, Durins Fluch, kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von legendären Kreaturen.\\nWenn Der Balrog stirbt, zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, das bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Avatar, Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617286&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92d1e9ce-19f1-42bd-bd82-5674b5cb9b4c\', \'multiverseId\': 617286}, \'multiverseid\': 617286}, {\'name\': \'El balrog, el Daño de Durin\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada permanente sacrificado este turno.\\nPrisa.\\nEl balrog, el Daño de Durin no puede ser bloqueado excepto por criaturas legendarias.\\nCuando El balrog muera, destruye el artefacto o criatura objetivo que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Demonio avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ed4e1ab-b513-4e5b-b3de-433973469731\', \'multiverseId\': 617547}, \'multiverseid\': 617547}, {\'name\': \'Le Balrog, Fléau de Durin\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque permanent sacrifié ce tour-ci.\\nCélérité\\nLe Balrog, Fléau de Durin ne peut pas être bloqué excepté par des créatures légendaires.\\nQuand Le Balrog meurt, détruisez une cible qu\'un adversaire contrôle, artefact ou créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : avatar et démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617808&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb3c4e5e-a32a-4bc0-8783-5a0dc72328dd\', \'multiverseId\': 617808}, \'multiverseid\': 617808}, {\'name\': \'Il Balrog, Flagello di Durin\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni permanente sacrificato in questo turno.\\nRapidità\\nIl Balrog, Flagello di Durin non può essere bloccato tranne che da creature leggendarie.\\nQuando Il Balrog muore, distruggi un artefatto o una creatura bersaglio controllati da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Demone Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06933ada-6a20-4f49-a9c2-3ce06f0e7f42\', \'multiverseId\': 618069}, \'multiverseid\': 618069}, {\'name\': \'ドゥリンの禍、バルログ\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、このターンに生け贄に捧げられたパーマネント１つにつき{1}少なくなる。\\n速攻\\nドゥリンの禍、バルログは伝説のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。\\nドゥリンの禍、バルログが死亡したとき、アーティファクトやクリーチャーのうち対戦相手がコントロールしている１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — アバター・デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4b715ad-c860-4f72-894a-66d6b5a7666f\', \'multiverseId\': 618330}, \'multiverseid\': 618330}, {\'name\': \'O Balrog, Ruína de Durin\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada permanente sacrificada neste turno.\\nÍmpeto\\nO Balrog, Ruína de Durin, só pode ser bloqueado por criaturas lendárias.\\nQuando O Balrog morrer, destrua a criatura ou o artefato alvo que um oponente controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Avatar Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c81d4aed-11f7-4875-9041-7f6761920079\', \'multiverseId\': 618591}, \'multiverseid\': 618591}, {\'name\': \'都林克星炎魔\', \'text\': \'本回合中每牺牲过一个永久物，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n敏捷\\n都林克星炎魔只能被传奇生物阻挡。\\n当炎魔死去时，消灭目标由对手操控的神器或生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～圣者／恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'070721d9-e851-43b4-a087-e195e5ba825a\', \'multiverseId\': 618852}, \'multiverseid\': 618852}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Balrog, Durins Fluch\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede bleibende Karte, die in diesem Zug geopfert wurde, {1} weniger.\\nEile\\nDer Balrog, Durins Fluch, kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von legendären Kreaturen.\\nWenn Der Balrog stirbt, zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, das bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Avatar, Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619735&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e28ee921-ef39-49d0-9222-c3a711a648f1\', \'multiverseId\': 619735}, \'multiverseid\': 619735}, {\'name\': \'El balrog, el Daño de Durin\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada permanente sacrificado este turno.\\nPrisa.\\nEl balrog, el Daño de Durin no puede ser bloqueado excepto por criaturas legendarias.\\nCuando El balrog muera, destruye el artefacto o criatura objetivo que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Demonio avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8a81180-53f9-4538-886d-ffa61232946e\', \'multiverseId\': 619778}, \'multiverseid\': 619778}, {\'name\': \'Le Balrog, Fléau de Durin\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque permanent sacrifié ce tour-ci.\\nCélérité\\nLe Balrog, Fléau de Durin ne peut pas être bloqué excepté par des créatures légendaires.\\nQuand Le Balrog meurt, détruisez une cible qu\'un adversaire contrôle, artefact ou créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : avatar et démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619821&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'050e1e75-1e33-4fa8-a717-8c29a1290a9a\', \'multiverseId\': 619821}, \'multiverseid\': 619821}, {\'name\': \'Il Balrog, Flagello di Durin\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni permanente sacrificato in questo turno.\\nRapidità\\nIl Balrog, Flagello di Durin non può essere bloccato tranne che da creature leggendarie.\\nQuando Il Balrog muore, distruggi un artefatto o una creatura bersaglio controllati da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Demone Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'582a3fa0-acd4-4371-8e8a-cbfef43413f1\', \'multiverseId\': 619864}, \'multiverseid\': 619864}, {\'name\': \'ドゥリンの禍、バルログ\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、このターンに生け贄に捧げられたパーマネント１つにつき{1}少なくなる。\\n速攻\\nドゥリンの禍、バルログは伝説のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。\\nドゥリンの禍、バルログが死亡したとき、アーティファクトやクリーチャーのうち対戦相手がコントロールしている１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — アバター・デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ffae2bc-7d99-4258-bda0-da229d72cef0\', \'multiverseId\': 619907}, \'multiverseid\': 619907}, {\'name\': \'O Balrog, Ruína de Durin\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada permanente sacrificada neste turno.\\nÍmpeto\\nO Balrog, Ruína de Durin, só pode ser bloqueado por criaturas lendárias.\\nQuando O Balrog morrer, destrua a criatura ou o artefato alvo que um oponente controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Avatar Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eee2e47-4c80-40fa-8e41-3c6d7623fcde\', \'multiverseId\': 619950}, \'multiverseid\': 619950}, {\'name\': \'都林克星炎魔\', \'text\': \'本回合中每牺牲过一个永久物，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n敏捷\\n都林克星炎魔只能被传奇生物阻挡。\\n当炎魔死去时，消灭目标由对手操控的神器或生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～圣者／恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76c429e1-9fee-4c46-8992-b124113e00f0\', \'multiverseId\': 619993}, \'multiverseid\': 619993}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Balrog, Flamme von Udûn\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn eine legendäre Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, lege Den Balrog, Flamme von Udûn, unter die Bibliothek seines Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Avatar, Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Übel der Alten Welt aus Schatten und Flamme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620120&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75cf1d32-aab1-4562-a979-3e6864c5608e\', \'multiverseId\': 620120}, \'multiverseid\': 620120}, {\'name\': \'El balrog, llama de Udûn\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando una criatura legendaria que controla un oponente muera, pon a El balrog, llama de Udûn en el fondo de la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Demonio avatar\', \'flavor\': \'Un mal del Mundo Antiguo que es tanto una sombra como una llama.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9432bce5-9a4c-49ba-a758-858456f09943\', \'multiverseId\': 620130}, \'multiverseid\': 620130}, {\'name\': "Le Balrog, flamme d\'Udûn", \'text\': "Piétinement\\nQuand une créature légendaire qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, mettez Le Balrog, flamme d\'Udûn au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : avatar et démon\', \'flavor\': \'Un mal du Monde Ancien, à la fois ombre et flamme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620140&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29b61518-81dc-4a09-8a7e-02b6c8f1da55\', \'multiverseId\': 620140}, \'multiverseid\': 620140}, {\'name\': \'Il Balrog, Fiamma di Udûn\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nQuando una creatura leggendaria controllata da un avversario muore, metti Il Balrog, Fiamma di Udûn in fondo al grimorio del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Demone Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'Un male del Mondo Antico, al tempo stesso ombra e fiamma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95211a68-87db-4860-b37e-971850a17d9c\', \'multiverseId\': 620150}, \'multiverseid\': 620150}, {\'name\': \'ウドゥーンの焰、バルログ\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n対戦相手がコントロールしている伝説のクリーチャー１体が死亡したとき、ウドゥーンの焰、バルログをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — アバター・デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'古の世の禍の一つ、影であると同時に焰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca74845-a4a2-48b3-821a-b88dd5a432cf\', \'multiverseId\': 620160}, \'multiverseid\': 620160}, {\'name\': \'O Balrog, Chama de Udûn\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nQuando uma criatura lendária que um oponente controla morrer, coloque O Balrog, Chama de Udûn, no fundo do grimório de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Avatar Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'Um mal do Mundo Antigo, ao mesmo tempo uma sombra e uma chama.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ece8c35a-1eee-43db-8f4b-2d9fa2fb7e95\', \'multiverseId\': 620170}, \'multiverseid\': 620170}, {\'name\': \'乌顿之火炎魔\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当一个由对手操控的传奇生物死去时，将乌顿之火炎魔置于其拥有者的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～圣者／恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'来自古代世界的邪物，它既是阴影，又是火焰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95775f7a-a09f-4161-bd62-7b352a000ce7\', \'multiverseId\': 620180}, \'multiverseid\': 620180}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Balrog, Flamme von Udûn\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn eine legendäre Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, lege Den Balrog, Flamme von Udûn, unter die Bibliothek seines Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Avatar, Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Übel der Alten Welt aus Schatten und Flamme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620215&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'834515a1-4fba-4dfb-9f9a-f1bf1da252f5\', \'multiverseId\': 620215}, \'multiverseid\': 620215}, {\'name\': "Le Balrog, flamme d\'Udûn", \'text\': "Piétinement\\nQuand une créature légendaire qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, mettez Le Balrog, flamme d\'Udûn au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : avatar et démon\', \'flavor\': \'Un mal du Monde Ancien, à la fois ombre et flamme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620225&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2054eb2e-b030-42ca-98c8-eb1826d36364\', \'multiverseId\': 620225}, \'multiverseid\': 620225}, {\'name\': \'ウドゥーンの焰、バルログ\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n対戦相手がコントロールしている伝説のクリーチャー１体が死亡したとき、ウドゥーンの焰、バルログをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — アバター・デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'古の世の禍の一つ、影であると同時に焰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74058448-dca3-4622-af13-03348dd37f80\', \'multiverseId\': 620235}, \'multiverseid\': 620235}, {\'name\': \'乌顿之火炎魔\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当一个由对手操控的传奇生物死去时，将乌顿之火炎魔置于其拥有者的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～圣者／恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'来自古代世界的邪物，它既是阴影，又是火焰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78de0f38-0dda-4c4a-b729-36b55fa0a6fb\', \'multiverseId\': 620245}, \'multiverseid\': 620245}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Eine Ring\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nWenn Der Eine Ring ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn gewirkt hast, erhältst du bis zu deinem nächsten Zug Schutz vor allem.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments verlierst du für jede Bürdemarke auf dem Einen Ring 1 Lebenspunkt.\\n{T}: Lege eine Bürdemarke auf den Einen Ring und ziehe dann für jede Bürdemarke auf dem Einen Ring eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617337&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19bec5fa-08cc-49c7-ac71-c04963c13853\', \'multiverseId\': 617337}, \'multiverseid\': 617337}, {\'name\': \'El Anillo Único\', \'text\': \'Indestructible.\\nCuando El Anillo Único entre al campo de batalla, si lo lanzaste, gana protección contra todo hasta tu próximo turno.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pierdes 1 vida por cada contador de cometido sobre El Anillo Único.\\n{T}: Pon un contador de cometido sobre El Anillo Único, luego roba una carta por cada contador de cometido sobre El Anillo Único.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55f46e4f-18d2-4ade-a5cb-ef26256b0f45\', \'multiverseId\': 617598}, \'multiverseid\': 617598}, {\'name\': "L\'Anneau Unique", \'text\': "Indestructible\\nQuand L\'Anneau Unique arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé, vous acquérez la protection contre tout jusqu\'à votre prochain tour.\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous perdez 1 point de vie pour chaque marqueur « fardeau » sur L\'Anneau Unique.\\n{T} : Mettez un marqueur « fardeau » sur L\'Anneau Unique, puis piochez une carte pour chaque marqueur « fardeau » sur L\'Anneau Unique.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617859&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b6791c1-090e-4cd8-be9c-f25c702b7a36\', \'multiverseId\': 617859}, \'multiverseid\': 617859}, {\'name\': "L\'Unico Anello", \'text\': "Indistruttibile\\nQuando L\'Unico Anello entra nel campo di battaglia, se l\'hai lanciato, hai protezione da tutto fino al tuo prossimo turno.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, perdi 1 punto vita per ogni segnalino onere su L\'Unico Anello.\\n{T}: Metti un segnalino onere su L\'Unico Anello, poi pesca una carta per ogni segnalino onere su L\'Unico Anello.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'425a31eb-b7d3-4fde-af64-beea6dad5637\', \'multiverseId\': 618120}, \'multiverseid\': 618120}, {\'name\': \'一つの指輪\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\n一つの指輪が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、次のあなたのターンまで、あなたはプロテクション（すべて）を得る。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、一つの指輪の上にある重荷カウンター１個につき１点のライフを失う。\\n{T}：一つの指輪の上に重荷カウンター１個を置く。その後、一つの指輪の上にある重荷カウンター１個につき１枚のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b0566a4-3efc-4d90-84f6-4733ede0e705\', \'multiverseId\': 618381}, \'multiverseid\': 618381}, {\'name\': \'O Um Anel\', \'text\': \'Indestrutível\\nQuando O Um Anel entra no campo de batalha, se você o conjurou, você ganha proteção contra tudo até seu próximo turno.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, você perde 1 ponto de vida para cada marcador de fardo em O Um Anel.\\n{T}: Coloque um marcador de fardo em O Um Anel e depois compre um card para cada marcador de fardo em O Um Anel.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e67b3274-9f81-4dca-9dcb-e9e4b5df08ba\', \'multiverseId\': 618642}, \'multiverseid\': 618642}, {\'name\': \'至尊戒\', \'text\': \'不灭\\n当至尊戒进战场时，若它经你施放，则你获得反一切保护异能直到你的下一个回合。\\n在你的维持开始时，至尊戒上每有一个重负指示物，你便失去1点生命。\\n{T}：在至尊戒上放置一个重负指示物，然后至尊戒上每有一个重负指示物，便抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6f98b23-be28-4187-a54b-df66dfe3c43b\', \'multiverseId\': 618903}, \'multiverseid\': 618903}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Eine Ring\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nWenn Der Eine Ring ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn gewirkt hast, erhältst du bis zu deinem nächsten Zug Schutz vor allem.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments verlierst du für jede Bürdemarke auf dem Einen Ring 1 Lebenspunkt.\\n{T}: Lege eine Bürdemarke auf den Einen Ring und ziehe dann für jede Bürdemarke auf dem Einen Ring eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619134&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efa9b54d-94d6-4af6-9f22-0bb52a5ef3aa\', \'multiverseId\': 619134}, \'multiverseid\': 619134}, {\'name\': "L\'Anneau Unique", \'text\': "Indestructible\\nQuand L\'Anneau Unique arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé, vous acquérez la protection contre tout jusqu\'à votre prochain tour.\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous perdez 1 point de vie pour chaque marqueur « fardeau » sur L\'Anneau Unique.\\n{T} : Mettez un marqueur « fardeau » sur L\'Anneau Unique, puis piochez une carte pour chaque marqueur « fardeau » sur L\'Anneau Unique.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619138&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6581e150-6038-41fc-8b6e-dbec3d7da89f\', \'multiverseId\': 619138}, \'multiverseid\': 619138}, {\'name\': \'一つの指輪\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\n一つの指輪が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、次のあなたのターンまで、あなたはプロテクション（すべて）を得る。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、一つの指輪の上にある重荷カウンター１個につき１点のライフを失う。\\n{T}：一つの指輪の上に重荷カウンター１個を置く。その後、一つの指輪の上にある重荷カウンター１個につき１枚のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'996eb6f8-9030-49e4-90e3-4f99393874db\', \'multiverseId\': 619142}, \'multiverseid\': 619142}, {\'name\': \'至尊戒\', \'text\': \'不灭\\n当至尊戒进战场时，若它经你施放，则你获得反一切保护异能直到你的下一个回合。\\n在你的维持开始时，至尊戒上每有一个重负指示物，你便失去1点生命。\\n{T}：在至尊戒上放置一个重负指示物，然后至尊戒上每有一个重负指示物，便抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb90a8c1-7dc9-479b-a0c1-0ddcd85b382f\', \'multiverseId\': 619146}, \'multiverseid\': 619146}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Eine Ring\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nWenn Der Eine Ring ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn gewirkt hast, erhältst du bis zu deinem nächsten Zug Schutz vor allem.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments verlierst du für jede Bürdemarke auf dem Einen Ring 1 Lebenspunkt.\\n{T}: Lege eine Bürdemarke auf den Einen Ring und ziehe dann für jede Bürdemarke auf dem Einen Ring eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619226&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45b7f740-ff20-45b6-a8d8-2f367357ed05\', \'multiverseId\': 619226}, \'multiverseid\': 619226}, {\'name\': "L\'Anneau Unique", \'text\': "Indestructible\\nQuand L\'Anneau Unique arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé, vous acquérez la protection contre tout jusqu\'à votre prochain tour.\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous perdez 1 point de vie pour chaque marqueur « fardeau » sur L\'Anneau Unique.\\n{T} : Mettez un marqueur « fardeau » sur L\'Anneau Unique, puis piochez une carte pour chaque marqueur « fardeau » sur L\'Anneau Unique.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619263&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab416fb4-e1fe-4715-a362-9b97594adbb7\', \'multiverseId\': 619263}, \'multiverseid\': 619263}, {\'name\': \'一つの指輪\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\n一つの指輪が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、次のあなたのターンまで、あなたはプロテクション（すべて）を得る。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、一つの指輪の上にある重荷カウンター１個につき１点のライフを失う。\\n{T}：一つの指輪の上に重荷カウンター１個を置く。その後、一つの指輪の上にある重荷カウンター１個につき１枚のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0015534-1078-4e3d-a677-d0026fabee1c\', \'multiverseId\': 619300}, \'multiverseid\': 619300}, {\'name\': \'至尊戒\', \'text\': \'不灭\\n当至尊戒进战场时，若它经你施放，则你获得反一切保护异能直到你的下一个回合。\\n在你的维持开始时，至尊戒上每有一个重负指示物，你便失去1点生命。\\n{T}：在至尊戒上放置一个重负指示物，然后至尊戒上每有一个重负指示物，便抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4288754b-b5e8-47ea-8de4-b734727a0d15\', \'multiverseId\': 619337}, \'multiverseid\': 619337}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Hexenkönig, Verderbnisbringer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn Der Hexenkönig, Verderbnisbringer, angreift, opfert der verteidigende Spieler eine Kreatur mit der niedrigsten Stärke unter den Kreaturen, die er kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Wraith, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Kein lebender Mann kann mich bezwingen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620211&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac6b93db-3a59-45b0-94f2-228f078a2d91\', \'multiverseId\': 620211}, \'multiverseid\': 620211}, {\'name\': \'Roi-sorcier, porteur de ruine\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Roi-sorcier, porteur de ruine attaque, le joueur défenseur sacrifie une créature avec la force la moins élevée parmi les créatures qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : apparition et noble\', \'flavor\': "« Aucun homme vivant ne pourra m\'en empêcher ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620221&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'736d8d34-42bb-49d6-ba01-43de489275fe\', \'multiverseId\': 620221}, \'multiverseid\': 620221}, {\'name\': \'破滅をもたらす者、魔王\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n破滅をもたらす者、魔王が攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーは自分がコントロールしているクリーチャーの中でパワーが最も小さい１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — レイス・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「生きた人間の男に、おれを阻むことはできぬわ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bfc2224-7206-4ddd-89b6-928430a2e6e9\', \'multiverseId\': 620231}, \'multiverseid\': 620231}, {\'name\': \'毁灭使者巫王\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当毁灭使者巫王攻击时，防御牌手牺牲一个生物，且须是由其操控的生物中力量最小者。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼魂／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「没有活人能够阻止我！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3ed7fb0-682c-4f33-b915-3129639774fb\', \'multiverseId\': 620241}, \'multiverseid\': 620241}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Ring geht nach Süden\', \'text\': \'Der Ring führt dich in Versuchung. Decke dann Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du X Länderkarten aufdeckst, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an legendären Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst. Bringe jene Länderkarten getappt ins Spiel und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617277&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35cff0a2-bebb-4448-81d4-7f17001c6539\', \'multiverseId\': 617277}, \'multiverseid\': 617277}, {\'name\': \'El Anillo va hacia el sur\', \'text\': \'El Anillo te tienta. Luego, muestra cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres X cartas de tierra, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas legendarias que controlas. Pon esas cartas de tierra en el campo de batalla giradas y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d895de7e-1a62-4078-9fce-18ac153876c7\', \'multiverseId\': 617538}, \'multiverseid\': 617538}, {\'name\': "L\'Anneau prend le chemin du sud", \'text\': "L\'Anneau vous tente. Puis révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez X cartes de terrain, X étant le nombre de créatures légendaires que vous contrôlez. Mettez ces cartes de terrain sur le champ de bataille engagées et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617799&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdf4ea42-8b9d-4650-b77a-bcff4b420cf4\', \'multiverseId\': 617799}, \'multiverseid\': 617799}, {\'name\': "L\'Anello va a Sud", \'text\': "L\'Anello ti tenta. Poi rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli X carte terra, dove X è il numero di creature leggendarie che controlli. Metti quelle carte terra sul campo di battaglia TAPpate e le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2b5ff38-f0a7-4a7b-a787-92de63b67a09\', \'multiverseId\': 618060}, \'multiverseid\': 618060}, {\'name\': \'指輪、南へいく\', \'text\': \'指輪があなたを誘惑する。その後、土地・カードＸ枚が公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしている伝説のクリーチャーの数に等しい。それらの土地・カードをタップ状態で戦場に出し、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c8d9ee3-dd74-4d5c-9a5a-4eb3fffbd3f2\', \'multiverseId\': 618321}, \'multiverseid\': 618321}, {\'name\': \'O Anel Vai para o Sul\', \'text\': \'O Anel tenta você. Depois, revele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar X cards de terreno, sendo X o número de criaturas lendárias que você controla. Coloque aqueles cards de terreno no campo de batalha virados e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bfacfda-4771-4d83-b94c-40ee96b97722\', \'multiverseId\': 618582}, \'multiverseid\': 618582}, {\'name\': \'魔戒南去\', \'text\': \'魔戒引诱你。然后从你的牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出X张地牌为止，X为由你操控的传奇生物数量。将这些地牌横置放进战场，其余则以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8c3f5c8-5600-4432-92c6-621d3a2f3e83\', \'multiverseId\': 618843}, \'multiverseid\': 618843}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Ring geht nach Süden\', \'text\': \'Der Ring führt dich in Versuchung. Decke dann Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du X Länderkarten aufdeckst, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an legendären Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst. Bringe jene Länderkarten getappt ins Spiel und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619212&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57e5fbd5-17a6-43cd-a2da-1d5ce28cf07b\', \'multiverseId\': 619212}, \'multiverseid\': 619212}, {\'name\': "L\'Anneau prend le chemin du sud", \'text\': "L\'Anneau vous tente. Puis révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez X cartes de terrain, X étant le nombre de créatures légendaires que vous contrôlez. Mettez ces cartes de terrain sur le champ de bataille engagées et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619249&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaf4f346-c0e7-4e3f-8020-a2b7472c9121\', \'multiverseId\': 619249}, \'multiverseid\': 619249}, {\'name\': \'指輪、南へいく\', \'text\': \'指輪があなたを誘惑する。その後、土地・カードＸ枚が公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしている伝説のクリーチャーの数に等しい。それらの土地・カードをタップ状態で戦場に出し、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47ecf402-3b74-4afd-9ce2-cec4aec60072\', \'multiverseId\': 619286}, \'multiverseid\': 619286}, {\'name\': \'魔戒南去\', \'text\': \'魔戒引诱你。然后从你的牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出X张地牌为止，X为由你操控的传奇生物数量。将这些地牌横置放进战场，其余则以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8eedff8-18e9-44e9-bfc2-c3977b2c4654\', \'multiverseId\': 619323}, \'multiverseid\': 619323}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Schicksalsberg\', \'text\': \'{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.\\n{1}{B}{R}, {T}: Der Schicksalsberg fügt jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{5}{B}{R}, {T}, opfere Den Schicksalsberg und ein legendäres Artefakt: Bestimme bis zu zwei Kreaturen und zerstöre dann den Rest. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617349&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50ff8905-8b7a-4015-b41e-170bda3ea223\', \'multiverseId\': 617349}, \'multiverseid\': 617349}, {\'name\': \'Monte del Destino\', \'text\': \'{T}, pagar 1 vida: Agrega {B} o {R}.\\n{1}{B}{R}, {T}: El Monte del Destino hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\\n{5}{B}{R}, {T}, sacrificar el Monte del Destino y un artefacto legendario: Elige hasta dos criaturas, luego destruye el resto. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Tierra legendaria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22781cf7-33f0-461c-8cc6-cef93e990b35\', \'multiverseId\': 617610}, \'multiverseid\': 617610}, {\'name\': \'Montagne du Destin\', \'text\': "{T}, payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.\\n{1}{B}{R}, {T} : La Montagne du Destin inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.\\n{5}{B}{R}, {T}, sacrifiez la Montagne du Destin et un artefact légendaire : Choisissez jusqu\'à deux créatures, puis détruisez le reste. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Terrain légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617871&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ea839d2-bbe1-4464-9196-77235ece9718\', \'multiverseId\': 617871}, \'multiverseid\': 617871}, {\'name\': \'Monte Fato\', \'text\': \'{T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Aggiungi {B} o {R}.\\n{1}{B}{R}, {T}: Il Monte Fato infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.\\n{5}{B}{R}, {T}, Sacrifica il Monte Fato e un artefatto leggendario: Scegli fino a due creature, poi distruggi le altre. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Terra Leggendaria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdaa4623-7a16-4215-9fef-1d88e66b7642\', \'multiverseId\': 618132}, \'multiverseid\': 618132}, {\'name\': \'滅びの山\', \'text\': \'{T}, １点のライフを支払う：{B}か{R}を加える。\\n{1}{B}{R}, {T}：滅びの山は各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\n{5}{B}{R}, {T}, 滅びの山と伝説のアーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー最大２体を選ぶ。その後、残りを破壊する。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説の土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aa4e96f-52b7-4697-b352-b4d1144164bd\', \'multiverseId\': 618393}, \'multiverseid\': 618393}, {\'name\': \'Monte da Perdição\', \'text\': \'{T}, pague 1 ponto de vida: Adicione {B} ou {R}.\\n{1}{B}{R}, {T}: Monte da Perdição causa 1 ponto de dano a cada oponente.\\n{5}{B}{R}, {T}, sacrifique Monte da Perdição e um artefato lendário: Escolha até duas criaturas e depois destrua as restantes. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ad82a2d-6d7f-4ea2-ad66-988e05d5cdbf\', \'multiverseId\': 618654}, \'multiverseid\': 618654}, {\'name\': \'末日山\', \'text\': \'{T}，支付1点生命：加{B}或{R}。\\n{1}{B}{R}，{T}：末日山向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\\n{5}{B}{R}，{T}，牺牲末日山和一个传奇神器：选择至多两个生物，然后消灭其他生物。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f227d8c-7baa-4420-935c-6fdb1ce2ef3f\', \'multiverseId\': 618915}, \'multiverseid\': 618915}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Schicksalsberg\', \'text\': \'{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.\\n{1}{B}{R}, {T}: Der Schicksalsberg fügt jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{5}{B}{R}, {T}, opfere Den Schicksalsberg und ein legendäres Artefakt: Bestimme bis zu zwei Kreaturen und zerstöre dann den Rest. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619088&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c0d49ec-67b5-4246-9052-e4c688114192\', \'multiverseId\': 619088}, \'multiverseid\': 619088}, {\'name\': \'Monte del Destino\', \'text\': \'{T}, pagar 1 vida: Agrega {B} o {R}.\\n{1}{B}{R}, {T}: El Monte del Destino hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\\n{5}{B}{R}, {T}, sacrificar el Monte del Destino y un artefacto legendario: Elige hasta dos criaturas, luego destruye el resto. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Tierra legendaria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'147a8200-38ea-4a80-a4b1-8862031d98d8\', \'multiverseId\': 619094}, \'multiverseid\': 619094}, {\'name\': \'Montagne du Destin\', \'text\': "{T}, payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.\\n{1}{B}{R}, {T} : La Montagne du Destin inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.\\n{5}{B}{R}, {T}, sacrifiez la Montagne du Destin et un artefact légendaire : Choisissez jusqu\'à deux créatures, puis détruisez le reste. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Terrain légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619100&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9345e154-5ccc-42e4-a505-9237bf2db06d\', \'multiverseId\': 619100}, \'multiverseid\': 619100}, {\'name\': \'Monte Fato\', \'text\': \'{T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Aggiungi {B} o {R}.\\n{1}{B}{R}, {T}: Il Monte Fato infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.\\n{5}{B}{R}, {T}, Sacrifica il Monte Fato e un artefatto leggendario: Scegli fino a due creature, poi distruggi le altre. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Terra Leggendaria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc1c6fd6-4968-4676-a718-155898cc225d\', \'multiverseId\': 619106}, \'multiverseid\': 619106}, {\'name\': \'滅びの山\', \'text\': \'{T}, １点のライフを支払う：{B}か{R}を加える。\\n{1}{B}{R}, {T}：滅びの山は各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\n{5}{B}{R}, {T}, 滅びの山と伝説のアーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー最大２体を選ぶ。その後、残りを破壊する。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説の土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07d1bfd5-345d-4c28-b9b0-f00c27965785\', \'multiverseId\': 619112}, \'multiverseid\': 619112}, {\'name\': \'Monte da Perdição\', \'text\': \'{T}, pague 1 ponto de vida: Adicione {B} ou {R}.\\n{1}{B}{R}, {T}: Monte da Perdição causa 1 ponto de dano a cada oponente.\\n{5}{B}{R}, {T}, sacrifique Monte da Perdição e um artefato lendário: Escolha até duas criaturas e depois destrua as restantes. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f8717d2-eae0-4fb2-bb1d-26ff5445d5f6\', \'multiverseId\': 619118}, \'multiverseid\': 619118}, {\'name\': \'末日山\', \'text\': \'{T}，支付1点生命：加{B}或{R}。\\n{1}{B}{R}，{T}：末日山向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\\n{5}{B}{R}，{T}，牺牲末日山和一个传奇神器：选择至多两个生物，然后消灭其他生物。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7602c40-a0ed-437b-a89a-d869e3c1035e\', \'multiverseId\': 619124}, \'multiverseid\': 619124}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Schwarze Hauch\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, erhalten -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Der Ring führt dich in Versuchung.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn der Schwarze Hauch dich verhext, der Schatten des Todes erwächst."\\n—Ein Vers aus alten Tagen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617169&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b3699e2-f4b1-4a8d-8bfa-06e90ba1ded0\', \'multiverseId\': 617169}, \'multiverseid\': 617169}, {\'name\': \'El Hálito Negro\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes obtienen -1/-1 hasta el final del turno. El Anillo te tienta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando el hálito negro despierte, crecerá la sombra de la muerte".\\n—Rima de los días pasados\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13150bc2-4ac1-4191-b2ad-0268f2faaf54\', \'multiverseId\': 617430}, \'multiverseid\': 617430}, {\'name\': \'Le Souffle Noir\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent gagnent -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. L\'Anneau vous tente.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Quand le Souffle Noir est senti, l\'ombre de la mort grandit. »\\n—Proverbe des jours anciens", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617691&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'335a2501-a686-4515-85a8-78ec11848708\', \'multiverseId\': 617691}, \'multiverseid\': 617691}, {\'name\': "L\'Alito Nero", \'text\': "Le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari prendono -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno. L\'Anello ti tenta.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando l\\\'alito nero si alza, l\\\'ombra della morte incalza."\\n—Vecchia rima\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'141ebc82-187c-4fc0-8354-92f4f12bdaf3\', \'multiverseId\': 617952}, \'multiverseid\': 617952}, {\'name\': \'黒の息\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、対戦相手がコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは－１/－１の修整を受ける。指輪があなたを誘惑する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「黒の息が吹くところ、死の影が這い出でる。」\\n——古き詩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fb2c651-28f0-4140-a44d-592431242b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 618213}, \'multiverseid\': 618213}, {\'name\': \'O Hálito Negro\', \'text\': \'As criaturas controladas por seus oponentes recebem -1/-1 até o final do turno. O Anel tenta você.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando o sopro negro alenta, a sombra da morte aumenta."\\n— Rima dos velhos tempos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1e38900-fff2-4e3b-ae63-da79626a1925\', \'multiverseId\': 618474}, \'multiverseid\': 618474}, {\'name\': \'黑息\', \'text\': \'由对手操控的生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。魔戒引诱你。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「时值黑息鼓动，死亡阴影渐浓。」\\n～古代的歌谣\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99e1bc78-0085-41a7-88a3-553f5f3e2f4d\', \'multiverseId\': 618735}, \'multiverseid\': 618735}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Wächter im Wasser\', \'text\': \'Der Wächter im Wasser kommt getappt mit neun Betäubungsmarken ins Spiel. (Falls eine bleibende Karte mit Betäubungsmarke enttappt würde, entferne stattdessen eine davon.)\\nImmer wenn du während des Zuges eines Gegners eine Karte ziehst, erzeuge einen 1/1 blauen Tentakel-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nImmer wenn ein Tentakel, den du kontrollierst, stirbt, enttappe bis zu einen Kraken deiner Wahl und lege eine Betäubungsmarke auf bis zu eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Krake\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617166&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5834e492-77db-41a3-9090-9ff046cf80f3\', \'multiverseId\': 617166}, \'multiverseid\': 617166}, {\'name\': \'El Guardián del Agua\', \'text\': \'El Guardián del Agua entra al campo de batalla girado con nueve contadores de aturdimiento sobre él. (Si un permanente con un contador de aturdimiento fuera a enderezarse, en vez de eso, remueve uno de esos contadores de él.)\\nSiempre que robes una carta durante el turno de un oponente, crea una ficha de criatura Tentáculo azul 1/1.\\nSiempre que un Tentáculo que controlas muera, endereza hasta un Kraken objetivo y pon un contador de aturdimiento sobre hasta un permanente objetivo que no sea tierra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86b18c86-23d9-4800-973d-bdad35853eae\', \'multiverseId\': 617427}, \'multiverseid\': 617427}, {\'name\': "Le Guetteur de l\'Eau", \'text\': "Le Guetteur de l\'Eau arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé avec neuf marqueurs « étourdissement » sur lui. (Si un permanent avec un marqueur « étourdissement » devait devenir dégagé, retirez-lui en un à la place.)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez une carte pendant le tour d\'un adversaire, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue Tentacule.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un tentacule que vous contrôlez meurt, dégagez jusqu\'à un kraken ciblé et mettez un marqueur « étourdissement » sur jusqu\'à un permanent non-terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617688&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcf754fe-9aaf-4084-95db-9244d01aceae\', \'multiverseId\': 617688}, \'multiverseid\': 617688}, {\'name\': "L\'Osservatore nell\'Acqua", \'text\': "L\'Osservatore nell\'Acqua entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato con nove segnalini stordimento. (Se un permanente con un segnalino stordimento sta per essere STAPpato, rimuovi invece un segnalino stordimento da esso.)\\nOgniqualvolta peschi una carta durante il turno di un avversario, crei una pedina creatura Tentacolo 1/1 blu.\\nOgniqualvolta un Tentacolo che controlli muore, STAPpa fino a un Kraken bersaglio e scegli fino a un permanente non terra bersaglio. Metti un segnalino stordimento sul permanente.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ce07e6e-cf81-4487-868f-07818e94ffc9\', \'multiverseId\': 617949}, \'multiverseid\': 617949}, {\'name\': \'水中の監視者\', \'text\': \'水中の監視者はタップ状態かつ麻痺カウンター９個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。（麻痺カウンターが置かれているパーマネントがアンタップ状態になるなら、代わりにそれの上から麻痺カウンター１個を取り除く。）\\n対戦相手のターン中にあなたがカード１枚を引くたび、青の１/１の触手・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしている触手１体が死亡するたび、クラーケン最大１体と、土地でないパーマネント最大１体を対象とする。その前者をアンタップし、その後者の上に麻痺カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — クラーケン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41c022eb-d8ef-4d83-84a7-ba48a2695c29\', \'multiverseId\': 618210}, \'multiverseid\': 618210}, {\'name\': \'O Vigia na Água\', \'text\': \'O Vigia na Água entra no campo de batalha virado com nove marcadores de atordoamento. (Se uma permanente com um marcador de atordoamento se tornaria desvirada, em vez disso, remova um marcador de atordoamento dela.)\\nToda vez que você comprar um card durante o turno de um oponente, crie uma ficha de criatura Tentáculo azul 1/1.\\nToda vez que um Tentáculo que você controla morrer, desvire até um Kraken alvo e coloque um marcador de atordoamento em até uma permanente não de terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65682f40-4609-4680-8748-fba93442a6f7\', \'multiverseId\': 618471}, \'multiverseid\': 618471}, {\'name\': \'水中的监视者\', \'text\': \'水中的监视者须横置进战场，且上面有九个晕眩指示物。（如果某个其上有晕眩指示物的永久物将成为未横置，则改为从其上移去一个晕眩指示物。）\\n每当你在对手的回合中抓一张牌时，派出一个1/1蓝色触手衍生生物。\\n每当一个由你操控的触手死去时，重置至多一个目标巨海兽，并在至多一个目标非地永久物上放置一个晕眩指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～巨海兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8341397e-b69f-420d-a22c-475083b95ea1\', \'multiverseId\': 618732}, \'multiverseid\': 618732}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Wächter im Wasser\', \'text\': \'Der Wächter im Wasser kommt getappt mit neun Betäubungsmarken ins Spiel.\\nImmer wenn du während des Zuges eines Gegners eine Karte ziehst, erzeuge einen 1/1 blauen Tentakel-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nImmer wenn ein Tentakel, den du kontrollierst, stirbt, enttappe bis zu einen Kraken deiner Wahl und lege eine Betäubungsmarke auf bis zu eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Krake\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619200&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8079201d-89cf-42e4-9b01-6920f17577b1\', \'multiverseId\': 619200}, \'multiverseid\': 619200}, {\'name\': "Le Guetteur de l\'Eau", \'text\': "Le Guetteur de l\'Eau arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé avec neuf marqueurs « étourdissement » sur lui.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez une carte pendant le tour d\'un adversaire, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue Tentacule.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un tentacule que vous contrôlez meurt, dégagez jusqu\'à un kraken ciblé et mettez un marqueur « étourdissement » sur jusqu\'à un permanent non-terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619237&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81524019-2061-4229-b69c-60a04360018b\', \'multiverseId\': 619237}, \'multiverseid\': 619237}, {\'name\': \'水中の監視者\', \'text\': \'水中の監視者はタップ状態かつ麻痺カウンター９個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n対戦相手のターン中にあなたがカード１枚を引くたび、青の１/１の触手・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしている触手１体が死亡するたび、クラーケン最大１体と、土地でないパーマネント最大１体を対象とする。その前者をアンタップし、その後者の上に麻痺カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — クラーケン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'478dc5b1-7f0e-4081-9c8f-c9ee52939ccb\', \'multiverseId\': 619274}, \'multiverseid\': 619274}, {\'name\': \'水中的监视者\', \'text\': \'水中的监视者须横置进战场，且上面有九个晕眩指示物。\\n每当你在对手的回合中抓一张牌时，派出一个1/1蓝色触手衍生生物。\\n每当一个由你操控的触手死去时，重置至多一个目标巨海兽，并在至多一个目标非地永久物上放置一个晕眩指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～巨海兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c932afa-7541-4198-b031-acb63e5cad4c\', \'multiverseId\': 619311}, \'multiverseid\': 619311}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der letzte Marsch der Ents\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\nZiehe so viele Karten, wie die höchste Widerstandskraft unter den Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, beträgt, und bringe dann eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten aus deiner Hand ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Nach Isengart ziehen wir, mit Groll voran!\\nMit Groll voran, mit Groll voran!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617263&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08daa9c3-2255-4b6a-a581-9dadcaefae0d\', \'multiverseId\': 617263}, \'multiverseid\': 617263}, {\'name\': \'La última marcha de los ents\', \'text\': \'Este hechizo no puede ser contrarrestado.\\nRoba una cantidad de cartas igual a la mayor resistencia entre las criaturas que controlas, luego pon en el campo de batalla cualquier cantidad de cartas de criatura de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Marchamos a Isengard con el destino!\\n¡Marchamos con el destino, con el destino marchamos!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5bb5877-a9ac-4d92-be33-5e016e6517a8\', \'multiverseId\': 617524}, \'multiverseid\': 617524}, {\'name\': \'Dernière marche des Ents\', \'text\': "Ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\nPiochez un nombre de cartes égal à l\'endurance la plus élevée parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez, puis mettez sur le champ de bataille n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de créature depuis votre main.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Vers l\'Isengard nous portons la ruine !\\nNous portons la ruine, nous portons la ruine ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617785&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9278b354-a1b8-4b07-a8e1-10edf22caaa5\', \'multiverseId\': 617785}, \'multiverseid\': 617785}, {\'name\': \'Ultima Marcia degli Ent\', \'text\': \'Questa magia non può essere neutralizzata.\\nPesca carte pari alla costituzione maggiore tra le creature che controlli, poi metti sul campo di battaglia un qualsiasi numero di carte creatura dalla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"A Isengard portiamo distruzione!\\nPortiamo distruzione, portiamo distruzione!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4412da90-409e-4d6a-83b5-d354cdac6160\', \'multiverseId\': 618046}, \'multiverseid\': 618046}, {\'name\': \'エント最後の進軍\', \'text\': \'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーのタフネスの中の最大値に等しい枚数のカードを引く。その後、あなたの手札にある望む枚数のクリーチャー・カードを戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「アイゼンガルドに破滅をもたらしに参った！\\n破滅は我らとともにあり、破滅は我らとともにあり！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58be589a-74cb-4c5c-a086-13a36e4524b6\', \'multiverseId\': 618307}, \'multiverseid\': 618307}, {\'name\': \'Última Marcha dos Ents\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica não pode ser anulada.\\nCompre uma quantidade de cards igual à maior resistência entre as das criaturas que você controla e depois coloque qualquer número de cards de criatura de sua mão no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Para Isengard a ruína levamos!\\nRuína levamos, ruína levamos!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0c4903e-9dea-4d4f-9e8c-6231d6229dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 618568}, \'multiverseid\': 618568}, {\'name\': \'恩特最后征袭\', \'text\': \'此咒语不能被反击。\\n抓若干牌，其数量等同于由你操控的生物中的最大防御力，然后将任意数量的生物牌从你手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「前往艾森加德，我们带着毁灭来！\\n我们带着毁灭来，我们带着毁灭来！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aecddc7e-0b32-4a62-b107-a89951518725\', \'multiverseId\': 618829}, \'multiverseid\': 618829}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der letzte Marsch der Ents\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\nZiehe so viele Karten, wie die höchste Widerstandskraft unter den Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, beträgt, und bringe dann eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten aus deiner Hand ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619748&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e443eb0-0a41-467f-b888-f453a733876f\', \'multiverseId\': 619748}, \'multiverseid\': 619748}, {\'name\': \'La última marcha de los ents\', \'text\': \'Este hechizo no puede ser contrarrestado.\\nRoba una cantidad de cartas igual a la mayor resistencia entre las criaturas que controlas, luego pon en el campo de batalla cualquier cantidad de cartas de criatura de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85ff1a5a-c6a9-4f27-bbcb-2861cac84a55\', \'multiverseId\': 619791}, \'multiverseid\': 619791}, {\'name\': \'Dernière marche des Ents\', \'text\': "Ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\nPiochez un nombre de cartes égal à l\'endurance la plus élevée parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez, puis mettez sur le champ de bataille n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de créature depuis votre main.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619834&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdc28cf8-f080-4e00-aef9-a75ac6da0e46\', \'multiverseId\': 619834}, \'multiverseid\': 619834}, {\'name\': \'Ultima Marcia degli Ent\', \'text\': \'Questa magia non può essere neutralizzata.\\nPesca carte pari alla costituzione maggiore tra le creature che controlli, poi metti sul campo di battaglia un qualsiasi numero di carte creatura dalla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17f5534e-0880-4f7a-816d-ba6c7c3d95d8\', \'multiverseId\': 619877}, \'multiverseid\': 619877}, {\'name\': \'エント最後の進軍\', \'text\': \'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーのタフネスの中の最大値に等しい枚数のカードを引く。その後、あなたの手札にある望む枚数のクリーチャー・カードを戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c35793b1-e99a-4df4-9593-684a4cff4d0a\', \'multiverseId\': 619920}, \'multiverseid\': 619920}, {\'name\': \'Última Marcha dos Ents\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica não pode ser anulada.\\nCompre uma quantidade de cards igual à maior resistência entre as das criaturas que você controla e depois coloque qualquer número de cards de criatura de sua mão no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5ccb2be-86d7-4bba-ae52-9987c50584d2\', \'multiverseId\': 619963}, \'multiverseid\': 619963}, {\'name\': \'恩特最后征袭\', \'text\': \'此咒语不能被反击。\\n抓若干牌，其数量等同于由你操控的生物中的最大防御力，然后将任意数量的生物牌从你手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdb93002-f50d-4edc-a3c3-8cf1c7cd8b6e\', \'multiverseId\': 620006}, \'multiverseid\': 620006}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Grauen Anfurten\', \'text\': \'Wenn Die Grauen Anfurten ins Spiel kommen, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe unter den legendären Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Land\', \'flavor\': \'Dort lebte Círdan der Schiffbauer, und manche sagen, er haust dort noch immer, bis das Letzte Schiff gen Westen in See sticht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617346&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab661cf5-1760-4717-9554-c37d0a6d9d3d\', \'multiverseId\': 617346}, \'multiverseid\': 617346}, {\'name\': \'Los Puertos Grises\', \'text\': \'Cuando Los Puertos Grises entren al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color entre las cartas de criatura legendaria en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Tierra legendaria\', \'flavor\': \'Ahí vivía Círdan, el carpintero de barcos, y algunos afirman que vive allí todavía, hasta que el último barco zarpe hacia el Occidente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4215211e-c1e5-4380-a63f-1aa0b53ec25c\', \'multiverseId\': 617607}, \'multiverseid\': 617607}, {\'name\': \'Les Havres Gris\', \'text\': \'Quand Les Havres Gris arrivent sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix parmi les couleurs des cartes de créature légendaire de votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Terrain légendaire\', \'flavor\': "C\'est là que résidait Círdan le charpentier de navires, et certains disent qu\'il s\'y trouve encore, jusqu\'à ce que le dernier bateau fasse voile vers l\'ouest.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617868&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6aa5947-7a4f-45f0-af08-263a9bc6cdce\', \'multiverseId\': 617868}, \'multiverseid\': 617868}, {\'name\': \'I Porti Grigi\', \'text\': \'Quando I Porti Grigi entrano nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore tra le carte creatura leggendaria nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Terra Leggendaria\', \'flavor\': "Era la casa di Círdan il Timoniere e alcuni dicono che sia ancora lì, finché l\'Ultima Nave non avrà salpato verso Ovest.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de034e20-e433-4c9e-b1a5-9727c88ed73e\', \'multiverseId\': 618129}, \'multiverseid\': 618129}, {\'name\': \'灰色港\', \'text\': \'灰色港が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：あなたの墓地にある伝説のクリーチャー・カードの中の色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説の土地\', \'flavor\': \'そこには船大工キーアダンが住んでいると言われている。西方への最後の船が旅立つまで、彼は今もなお、そこで待ち続けているという。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45e7d767-28e2-43b7-b8d3-9ffcf3a0cc7d\', \'multiverseId\': 618390}, \'multiverseid\': 618390}, {\'name\': \'Os Portos Cinzentos\', \'text\': \'Quando Os Portos Cinzentos entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 1.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor entre as dos cards de criatura lendários em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'Lá vivia Círdan, o Armador, e há quem diga que ainda vive, até que o último navio zarpe para o Oeste.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0042061e-7cde-4ada-afe5-fdf235910164\', \'multiverseId\': 618651}, \'multiverseid\': 618651}, {\'name\': \'灰港\', \'text\': \'当灰港进战场时，占卜1。\\n{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你坟墓场中传奇生物牌所具有的任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'传奇地\', \'flavor\': \'这正是造船者奇尔丹的居所，有人说他仍住在那里，直到「最后航船」扬帆驶向西方。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a722596e-66b8-4f8d-bb07-203e7a34913e\', \'multiverseId\': 618912}, \'multiverseid\': 618912}]', "[{'name': 'Die Grauen Anfurten', 'text': 'Wenn Die Grauen Anfurten ins Spiel kommen, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe unter den legendären Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof.', 'type': 'Legendäres Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619773&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e36b3ef9-3f08-4083-b5ee-70fd1d55c551', 'multiverseId': 619773}, 'multiverseid': 619773}, {'name': 'Los Puertos Grises', 'text': 'Cuando Los Puertos Grises entren al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color entre las cartas de criatura legendaria en tu cementerio.', 'type': 'Tierra legendaria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619816&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6273ff53-adc7-4150-80d8-8175b43cb40a', 'multiverseId': 619816}, 'multiverseid': 619816}, {'name': 'Les Havres Gris', 'text': 'Quand Les Havres Gris arrivent sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix parmi les couleurs des cartes de créature légendaire de votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Terrain légendaire', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619859&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51015ba4-c481-44c3-b67a-cc2355d5c2da', 'multiverseId': 619859}, 'multiverseid': 619859}, {'name': 'I Porti Grigi', 'text': 'Quando I Porti Grigi entrano nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore tra le carte creatura leggendaria nel tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Terra Leggendaria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619902&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2928d7f6-de98-4c12-beb5-59bd19bca7c7', 'multiverseId': 619902}, 'multiverseid': 619902}, {'name': '灰色港', 'text': '灰色港が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：あなたの墓地にある伝説のクリーチャー・カードの中の色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '伝説の土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619945&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04a864b0-2f09-475e-865f-2b6155d7a009', 'multiverseId': 619945}, 'multiverseid': 619945}, {'name': 'Os Portos Cinzentos', 'text': 'Quando Os Portos Cinzentos entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 1.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor entre as dos cards de criatura lendários em seu cemitério.', 'type': 'Terreno Lendário', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619988&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46f9c90a-534d-46a1-bdc1-231df6c3a3b9', 'multiverseId': 619988}, 'multiverseid': 619988}, {'name': '灰港', 'text': '当灰港进战场时，占卜1。\\n{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你坟墓场中传奇生物牌所具有的任一颜色。', 'type': '传奇地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620031&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46312b46-c341-4023-b931-4b5ef170a53f', 'multiverseId': 620031}, 'multiverseid': 620031}]", '[{\'name\': \'Die Schlacht von Wasserau\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen mit Stärke 3 oder mehr. Erzeuge dann für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einen Speise-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Tuks trafen unter Pippins Führung ein. Nun hatte Merry genügend kräftige Hobbits beisammen, um die Schläger zu vertreiben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617093&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34732940-ab21-4eba-869c-13ec4d1ae975\', \'multiverseId\': 617093}, \'multiverseid\': 617093}, {\'name\': \'La batalla de Delagua\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas con fuerza de 3 o más. Luego, crea una ficha de Comida por cada criatura que controlas. (Es un artefacto con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los Tuk marchaban con Pippin a la cabeza. Ahora, Merry disponía de una hobbitería lo suficientemente robusta como para enfrentarse a los bandidos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cf6459e-dcb3-45d6-97af-facee359ff8c\', \'multiverseId\': 617354}, \'multiverseid\': 617354}, {\'name\': \'La Bataille de Lèzeau\', \'text\': "Détruisez toutes les créatures de force supérieure ou égale à 3. Puis, créez un jeton Nourriture pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez. (C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les Touque étaient en marche, Pippin à leur tête. Merry avait désormais suffisamment de hobbits solides pour s\'occuper des brigands.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617615&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84f97fe8-9476-4a1a-b0a4-2506ce55f812\', \'multiverseId\': 617615}, \'multiverseid\': 617615}, {\'name\': \'La Battaglia di Lungacque\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature con forza pari o superiore a 3. Poi crea una pedina Cibo per ogni creatura che controlli. (È un artefatto con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I Tuc avanzavano preceduti da Pipino. Merry aveva ormai abbastanza Hobbit robusti e sapeva come occuparsi dei banditi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca7aaec9-04fa-4f12-86c2-611b60ea7fa7\', \'multiverseId\': 617876}, \'multiverseid\': 617876}, {\'name\': \'水の辺村の合戦\', \'text\': \'パワーが３以上であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。その後、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき１つの食物・トークンを生成する。（それは、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'その時、ピピン率いるトゥック一家が足を踏み入れた。これでメリーのもとには、悪漢を懲らしめるに十分なホビット達が出揃った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8765216e-7d12-4647-933a-f1afdc827e5b\', \'multiverseId\': 618137}, \'multiverseid\': 618137}, {\'name\': \'A Batalha de Beirágua\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas com poder igual ou superior a 3. Em seguida, crie uma ficha de Comida para cada criatura que você controla. (Ela é um artefato com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida".)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os Tûks marchavam com Pippin à frente. Merry agora tinha suficientes hobbits robustos para lidar com os rufiões.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50279bd6-5962-40a4-bce8-ed64fa64ef92\', \'multiverseId\': 618398}, \'multiverseid\': 618398}, {\'name\': \'傍水镇之战\', \'text\': \'消灭所有力量等于或大于3的生物。然后你每操控一个生物，便派出一个食品衍生物。（它是具有「{2}，{T}，牺牲此神器：你获得3点生命」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'图克家的人全都跟着皮平来到镇上。于是梅里就有了足够的霍比特壮汉来对付恶棍。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3af81d66-7b49-4354-b5a9-465823cc0d73\', \'multiverseId\': 618659}, \'multiverseid\': 618659}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Schlacht von Wasserau\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen mit Stärke 3 oder mehr. Erzeuge dann für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einen Speise-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Tuks trafen unter Pippins Führung ein. Nun hatte Merry genügend kräftige Hobbits beisammen, um die Schläger zu vertreiben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619192&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd40140e-a758-4553-9f5b-ff8b282d4986\', \'multiverseId\': 619192}, \'multiverseid\': 619192}, {\'name\': \'La Bataille de Lèzeau\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures de force supérieure ou égale à 3. Puis, créez un jeton Nourriture pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les Touque étaient en marche, Pippin à leur tête. Merry avait désormais suffisamment de hobbits solides pour s\'occuper des brigands.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619229&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f02d4ca5-e9a6-4635-b056-ae22f95ff92a\', \'multiverseId\': 619229}, \'multiverseid\': 619229}, {\'name\': \'水の辺村の合戦\', \'text\': \'パワーが３以上であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。その後、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき１つの食物・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'その時、ピピン率いるトゥック一家が足を踏み入れた。これでメリーのもとには、悪漢を懲らしめるに十分なホビット達が出揃った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8867f3f-025f-4389-88a4-95486fcbad2f\', \'multiverseId\': 619266}, \'multiverseid\': 619266}, {\'name\': \'傍水镇之战\', \'text\': \'消灭所有力量等于或大于3的生物。然后你每操控一个生物，便派出一个食品衍生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'图克家的人全都跟着皮平来到镇上。于是梅里就有了足够的霍比特壮汉来对付恶棍。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3020b02-c70a-4d68-88fe-c1a5ed20ce2f\', \'multiverseId\': 619303}, \'multiverseid\': 619303}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die lange Liste der Ents\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach VI.)\\nI, II, III, IV, V, VI — Notiere einen Kreaturentyp, der noch nicht für Die lange Liste der Ents notiert wurde. Wenn du in in diesem Zug deinen nächsten Kreaturenzauber jenes Typs wirkst, kommt jene Kreatur mit einer zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617265&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55f327c7-ddd4-41d3-9073-fe00411d7288\', \'multiverseId\': 617265}, \'multiverseid\': 617265}, {\'name\': \'La Larga Lista de los ents\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de VI.)\\nI, II, III, IV, V, VI — Anota un tipo de criatura que no se haya anotado para La Larga Lista de los ents. Cuando lances tu próximo hechizo de criatura de ese tipo este turno, esa criatura entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 adicional sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1551093-7b4e-4553-a2e0-15682a8df634\', \'multiverseId\': 617526}, \'multiverseid\': 617526}, {\'name\': \'Longue liste des Ents\', \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après VI.)\\nI, II, III, IV, V, VI — Notez un type de créature qui n\'a pas encore été noté pour la Longue liste des Ents. Quand vous lancez votre prochain sort de créature de ce type ce tour-ci, cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 supplémentaire sur elle.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617787&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b361c54-2d0b-4e76-937a-cf69a7195233\', \'multiverseId\': 617787}, \'multiverseid\': 617787}, {\'name\': \'Lunga Lista degli Ent\', \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo VI.)\\nI, II, III, IV, V, VI — Prendi nota di un tipo di creatura che non è stato annotato per la Lunga Lista degli Ent. Quando lanci la tua prossima magia creatura di quel tipo in questo turno, quella creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 addizionale.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02dc9bfb-f51f-4572-b7bb-cd88ecff6959\', \'multiverseId\': 618048}, \'multiverseid\': 618048}, {\'name\': \'エントの長い名簿\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。VIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI, II, III, IV, V, VI — エントの長い名簿に記録されていないクリーチャー・タイプ１つを記録する。このターン、あなたが次にそのタイプのクリーチャー・呪文を唱えたとき、そのクリーチャーは追加で＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e800e52-4663-4cb5-8279-b761bc378211\', \'multiverseId\': 618309}, \'multiverseid\': 618309}, {\'name\': \'Longa Lista dos Ents\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após VI.)\\nI, II, III, IV, V, VI — Anote um tipo de criatura que não tenha sido anotado para a Longa Lista dos Ents. Quando você conjurar sua próxima mágica de criatura daquele tipo neste turno, aquela criatura entrará no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 adicional.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48799219-8d5e-40fc-a338-af940fa3f029\', \'multiverseId\': 618570}, \'multiverseid\': 618570}, {\'name\': \'恩特的长名单\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到VI后牺牲之。）\\nI, II, III, IV, V, VI — 记下一种生物类别，且须为恩特的长名单未曾记录者。本回合中，当你施放你的下一个该类别之生物咒语，该生物进战场时上面额外有一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ab1104c-48bd-4d2d-b690-3d1c921e47b1\', \'multiverseId\': 618831}, \'multiverseid\': 618831}]', "[{'name': 'Du kannst nicht vorbei!', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die in diesem Zug eine legendäre Kreatur geblockt hat oder von einer legendären Kreatur geblockt wurde.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Er hob seine Peitsche. Ihr Schlag zischte durch die Luft und ein Knall ertönte. Feuer drang aus seinen Nüstern. Doch Gandalf blieb standhaft.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617129&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c0eee60-fef4-4c9f-ba81-92b417314878', 'multiverseId': 617129}, 'multiverseid': 617129}, {'name': '¡No puedes pasar!', 'text': 'Destruye la criatura objetivo que bloqueó o fue bloqueada por una criatura legendaria este turno.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Esgrimió el látigo, y las colas crujieron y gimieron. Le salía fuego por la nariz. Pero Gandalf permaneció inmóvil.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617390&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1016c3af-fc4a-4d7c-a0f4-b690508352ad', 'multiverseId': 617390}, 'multiverseid': 617390}, {'name': 'Vous ne pouvez passer !', 'text': 'Détruisez une créature ciblée qui a bloqué ou a été bloquée par une créature légendaire ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Il leva son fouet, et les lanières sifflèrent et claquèrent. Du feu sortit de ses naseaux. Mais Gandalf tint bon.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617651&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7e6b6b2-44b7-450d-be84-2eb79890ab4e', 'multiverseId': 617651}, 'multiverseid': 617651}, {'name': 'Non Puoi Passare!', 'text': 'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio che ha bloccato o è stata bloccata da una creatura leggendaria in questo turno.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Alzò la frusta, facendone schioccare i cordoni con un gemito. Fiamme uscirono dalle sue narici. Ma Gandalf non indietreggiò.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617912&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd455e591-1366-47b9-a1ca-aa26396a5ce0', 'multiverseId': 617912}, 'multiverseid': 617912}, {'name': 'ここは通さぬ！', 'text': 'このターンに伝説のクリーチャーをブロックしたかそれにブロックされたクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'それが掲げた鞭は風を切り、弾ける。鼻孔から火を漏れ出している。これを前に、ガンダルフは一歩も動じなかった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618173&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd6475ed-9d74-498d-a56e-d045e71ba193', 'multiverseId': 618173}, 'multiverseid': 618173}, {'name': 'Você Não Pode Passar!', 'text': 'Destrua a criatura alvo que bloqueou ou foi bloqueada por uma criatura lendária neste turno.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Ele ergueu o chicote e as tiras cantaram e estalaram. O fogo lhe saiu das ventas. Mas Gandalf permaneceu firme.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618434&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8cdfec49-59a9-4168-a5f8-3169209da4cf', 'multiverseId': 618434}, 'multiverseid': 618434}, {'name': '你休想过！', 'text': '消灭目标生物，且须为本回合中曾阻挡传奇生物或被传奇生物阻挡者。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '它扬起鞭子，鞭梢呼啸，噼啪作响；鼻孔还喷着火焰。但甘道夫屹立不摇。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618695&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c3260dfc-12c9-41d7-b0f4-9c9dd85adf11', 'multiverseId': 618695}, 'multiverseid': 618695}]", '[{\'name\': \'Durins Tor\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du angreifst, wende Hellsicht 2 an. Dann kannst du die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek aufdecken. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist, bringe sie getappt und angreifend ins Spiel. Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug verursacht sie Trampelschaden, falls du einen Zwerg kontrollierst, und erhält Fluchsicherheit, falls du einen Elfen kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Sprich, Freund, und tritt ein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617290&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a184ec2a-b951-48fa-aae0-7dce18b73119\', \'multiverseId\': 617290}, \'multiverseid\': 617290}, {\'name\': \'Puertas de Durin\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ataques, adivina 2, luego puedes mostrar la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de criatura, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y atacando. Hasta tu próximo turno, gana la habilidad de arrollar si controlas un Enano y la habilidad de antimaleficio si controlas un Elfo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Habla, amigo, y entra".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc0b9717-74c3-4227-aeb3-c561f113db6e\', \'multiverseId\': 617551}, \'multiverseid\': 617551}, {\'name\': \'Portes de Durin\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous attaquez, regard 2, puis vous pouvez révéler la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de créature, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, engagée et attaquante. Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, elle acquiert le piétinement si vous contrôlez un nain et la défense talismanique si vous contrôlez un elfe.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'« Parlez, ami, et entrez. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617812&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c8beb78-0823-478f-80b2-7659e3c4912a\', \'multiverseId\': 617812}, \'multiverseid\': 617812}, {\'name\': \'Porte di Durin\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta attacchi, profetizza 2, poi puoi rivelare la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta creatura, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e attaccante. Fino al tuo prossimo turno, ha travolgere se controlli un Nano e anti-malocchio se controlli un Elfo.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Di\\\', amico, ed entra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6ec24c7-7a74-400d-a580-7ad004aa54cf\', \'multiverseId\': 618073}, \'multiverseid\': 618073}, {\'name\': \'ドゥリンの扉\', \'text\': \'あなたが攻撃するたび、占術２を行う。その後、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開してもよい。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、それをタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。次のあなたのターンまで、それは、あなたがドワーフをコントロールしているならトランプルを、あなたがエルフをコントロールしているなら呪禁を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「唱えよ、友、そして入れ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68787f28-8629-4150-9c47-891b07732906\', \'multiverseId\': 618334}, \'multiverseid\': 618334}, {\'name\': \'Portas de Durin\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você atacar, use vidência 2. Depois, você pode revelar o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de criatura, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e atacando. Até seu próximo turno, ele ganha atropelar se você controla um Anão, e resistência a magia se você controla um Elfo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'"Diga, amigo, e entre."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77f3a428-5fac-4ee7-86e2-7dcf5976ab08\', \'multiverseId\': 618595}, \'multiverseid\': 618595}, {\'name\': \'都林之门\', \'text\': \'每当你攻击时，占卜2，然后你可以展示你的牌库顶牌。若它是生物牌，则将它横置放进战场，且正进行攻击。直到你的下一个回合，如果你操控矮人，则它获得践踏异能；如果你操控妖精，则它获得辟邪异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「请说，朋友，然后进入。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e95e9cad-289b-4f9d-b952-ef9360a6d8d4\', \'multiverseId\': 618856}, \'multiverseid\': 618856}]', '[{\'name\': \'Durins Tor\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du angreifst, wende Hellsicht 2 an. Dann kannst du die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek aufdecken. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist, bringe sie getappt und angreifend ins Spiel. Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug verursacht sie Trampelschaden, falls du einen Zwerg kontrollierst, und erhält Fluchsicherheit, falls du einen Elfen kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Sprich, Freund, und tritt ein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619214&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1e8eee5-aec0-440a-9886-22fdb4113545\', \'multiverseId\': 619214}, \'multiverseid\': 619214}, {\'name\': \'Portes de Durin\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous attaquez, regard 2, puis vous pouvez révéler la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de créature, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, engagée et attaquante. Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, elle acquiert le piétinement si vous contrôlez un nain et la défense talismanique si vous contrôlez un elfe.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'« Parlez, ami, et entrez. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619251&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'991f44f8-6a1a-4584-8856-ac3a6599e71a\', \'multiverseId\': 619251}, \'multiverseid\': 619251}, {\'name\': \'ドゥリンの扉\', \'text\': \'あなたが攻撃するたび、占術２を行う。その後、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開してもよい。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、それをタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。次のあなたのターンまで、それは、あなたがドワーフをコントロールしているならトランプルを、あなたがエルフをコントロールしているなら呪禁を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「唱えよ、友、そして入れ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08290db5-6a76-40e2-a055-5a3bf2ee9bc9\', \'multiverseId\': 619288}, \'multiverseid\': 619288}, {\'name\': \'都林之门\', \'text\': \'每当你攻击时，占卜2，然后你可以展示你的牌库顶牌。若它是生物牌，则将它横置放进战场，且正进行攻击。直到你的下一个回合，如果你操控矮人，则它获得践踏异能；如果你操控妖精，则它获得辟邪异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「请说，朋友，然后进入。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9604aa4-6cc2-40d7-ab22-c2e74f662b8c\', \'multiverseId\': 619325}, \'multiverseid\': 619325}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düsterwald-Fledermäuse\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du einen Spielstein erzeugst oder opferst, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Fledermaus\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Feind hat viele Spione, Augen und Ohren überall."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617186&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b732e461-84a3-481a-9098-5c4be6d05db4\', \'multiverseId\': 617186}, \'multiverseid\': 617186}, {\'name\': \'Murciélagos del Bosque Negro\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que crees o sacrifiques una ficha, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Murciélago\', \'flavor\': \'"El enemigo tiene muchos espías y muchas formas de enterarse".\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'427f1af1-aceb-442c-8ef5-dddf29bb74cb\', \'multiverseId\': 617447}, \'multiverseid\': 617447}, {\'name\': \'Chauves-souris de la Forêt Noire\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous créez ou sacrifiez un jeton, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chauve-souris\', \'flavor\': "« L\'ennemi compte de nombreux espions et a bien des oreilles. »\\n—Gandalf", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617708&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93d2f6ab-5f0c-49da-a533-76e0dd18e8de\', \'multiverseId\': 617708}, \'multiverseid\': 617708}, {\'name\': \'Pipistrelli di Bosco Atro\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta crei o sacrifichi una pedina, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pipistrello\', \'flavor\': \'"Il nemico ha molte spie e molte orecchie."\\n—Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c187afc-d2d5-48c3-8e5d-e9c863d3e129\', \'multiverseId\': 617969}, \'multiverseid\': 617969}, {\'name\': \'闇の森のコウモリ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがトークン１つを生成するか生け贄に捧げるたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コウモリ\', \'flavor\': \'「敵は多くの密偵を従え、あらゆる手段で聞き耳を立てておる。」\\n――ガンダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e0f5fda-f31c-452b-9be8-838f3832276a\', \'multiverseId\': 618230}, \'multiverseid\': 618230}, {\'name\': \'Morcegos da Floresta das Trevas\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que você cria ou sacrifica uma ficha, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Morcego\', \'flavor\': \'"O inimigo tem muitos espiões e muitas formas de escutar."\\n— Gandalf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb59aa00-ed52-4833-8b35-2732aa975fac\', \'multiverseId\': 618491}, \'multiverseid\': 618491}, {\'name\': \'黑森林蝙蝠\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你派出或牺牲一个衍生物时，每位对手各失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蝙蝠\', \'flavor\': \'「敌人耳目众多，刺探有道。」\\n～甘道夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4de7a53-a9a3-4d0e-a7d4-853b98d3674e\', \'multiverseId\': 618752}, \'multiverseid\': 618752}]', "[{'name': 'Düsterwald-Fledermäuse', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du einen Spielstein erzeugst oder opferst, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Fledermaus', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619751&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19776e75-62db-4766-be09-f78e457d9cb8', 'multiverseId': 619751}, 'multiverseid': 619751}, {'name': 'Murciélagos del Bosque Negro', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nSiempre que crees o sacrifiques una ficha, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.', 'type': 'Criatura — Murciélago', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619794&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4762ee00-c5f2-4a7e-96e8-684303504951', 'multiverseId': 619794}, 'multiverseid': 619794}, {'name': 'Chauves-souris de la Forêt Noire', 'text': 'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous créez ou sacrifiez un jeton, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.', 'type': 'Créature : chauve-souris', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619837&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '844e66bb-c596-4582-a6e7-e5f25765e6c3', 'multiverseId': 619837}, 'multiverseid': 619837}, {'name': 'Pipistrelli di Bosco Atro', 'text': 'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta crei o sacrifichi una pedina, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.', 'type': 'Creatura — Pipistrello', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619880&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9152a600-b2db-494c-b920-58696a133484', 'multiverseId': 619880}, 'multiverseid': 619880}, {'name': '闇の森のコウモリ', 'text': '飛行\\nあなたがトークン１つを生成するか生け贄に捧げるたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — コウモリ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619923&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6398cf53-f23b-4380-804f-bb920b3e53a7', 'multiverseId': 619923}, 'multiverseid': 619923}, {'name': 'Morcegos da Floresta das Trevas', 'text': 'Voar\\nToda vez que você cria ou sacrifica uma ficha, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.', 'type': 'Criatura — Morcego', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=619966&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b8c4bfe-09ff-4b83-80e6-33240944742d', 'multiverseId': 619966}, 'multiverseid': 619966}, {'name': '黑森林蝙蝠', 'text': '飞行\\n每当你派出或牺牲一个衍生物时，每位对手各失去1点生命。', 'type': '生物 ～蝙蝠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=620009&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef535eeb-47fb-4228-bb1b-a152a805818d', 'multiverseId': 620009}, 'multiverseid': 620009}]", '[{\'name\': \'Düsterwald-Spinne\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nImmer wenn die Düsterwald-Spinne angreift, erhält eine legendäre Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Kankras Abkömmlinge breiteten sich weit und breit von Tal zu Tal aus, bis sie Dol Guldur und den abgelegenen Düsterwald erreichten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617269&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07d3b5e4-be31-46d7-8851-1e99a4f01e78\', \'multiverseId\': 617269}, \'multiverseid\': 617269}, {\'name\': \'Araña del Bosque Negro\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nSiempre que la Araña del Bosque Negro ataque, la criatura legendaria objetivo que controlas gana la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'Los vástagos de Ella-Laraña se dispersaban por doquier de valle en valle, hasta el Dol Guldur y las fortalezas del Bosque Negro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be9d568d-7c29-4466-b7f3-56cb4cb210c9\', \'multiverseId\': 617530}, \'multiverseid\': 617530}, {\'name\': \'Araignée de la Forêt Noire\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Araignée de la Forêt Noire attaque, une créature légendaire ciblée que vous contrôlez acquiert le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': "Partout, la progéniture inférieure d\'Arachne s\'étendait de vallon en vallon, jusqu\'à Dol Guldur et les bastions de la Forêt Noire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=617791&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad9d65f0-e4b9-4bb1-8fe5-9b32fcd74737\', \'multiverseId\': 617791}, \'multiverseid\': 617791}, {\'name\': \'Ragno di Bosco Atro\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\nOgniqualvolta il Ragno di Bosco Atro attacca, una creatura leggendaria bersaglio che controlli ha tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno\', \'flavor\': \'In lungo e in largo si diffondeva la prole minore di Shelob, di valle in valle, fino a Dol Guldur e alla sicurezza di Bosco Atro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6392849b-de2d-4e09-84a5-81215faff08a\', \'multiverseId\': 618052}, \'multiverseid\': 618052}, {\'name\': \'闇の森の蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'接死\\n闇の森の蜘蛛が攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールしている伝説のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは接死を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'シェロブの子はドル・グルドゥアから闇の森の住処まで、広く谷を超えて住まわっていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11eb311b-3f40-4104-9ce7-804b881983d6\', \'multiverseId\': 618313}, \'multiverseid\': 618313}, {\'name\': \'Aranha da Floresta das Trevas\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nToda vez que Aranha da Floresta das Trevas ataca, a criatura lendária alvo que você controla ganha toque mortífero até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Aranha\', \'flavor\': \'Por toda parte a prole menor de Laracna se alastrou, de vale em vale, até Dol Guldur e os fortes da Floresta das Trevas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d375ddbc-7a29-4e72-ac9d-b59cfe901187\', \'multiverseId\': 618574}, \'multiverseid\': 618574}, {\'name\': \'黑森林蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'死触\\n每当黑森林蜘蛛攻击时，目标由你操控的传奇生物获得死触异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'希洛布的后代散布得既远又广：从一处山谷到另一处山谷，再到多古尔都和黑森林的要塞。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83d1cd28-9756-4015-bb14-e88e9f3a621c\', \'multiverseId\': 618835}, \'multiverseid\': 618835}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618929&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97658f84-29e4-45b7-bd4d-aba181f7d3b6', 'multiverseId': 618929}, 'multiverseid': 618929}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618939&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ecda2d5-10fc-40e7-9c36-11c0a56515da', 'multiverseId': 618939}, 'multiverseid': 618939}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618949&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '254a3275-27b7-4d44-8c46-5864e1773f86', 'multiverseId': 618949}, 'multiverseid': 618949}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618959&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4209293b-1064-4a0b-a19a-662be656393f', 'multiverseId': 618959}, 'multiverseid': 618959}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618969&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '760bc537-f668-4fe8-bf33-a054524f3aa6', 'multiverseId': 618969}, 'multiverseid': 618969}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618979&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bea3fa4e-4f6a-40b4-bb93-1fa4aa6b5ffe', 'multiverseId': 618979}, 'multiverseid': 618979}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=618989&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bbff3728-376b-44ae-a13e-c8d94c064680', 'multiverseId': 618989}, 'multiverseid': 618989}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multive